ex:ST_Research_Ch14 backlog:hasAuditNote "Agent-reported disclosures for the chapter 14 research (from the course coordinator's relay of the research run's report, not re-verified here): 83 sources, 27 findings, 55 claims, 63 checks; lnd 0.21.3-beta and Bitcoin Core 31.1 ran on regtest; NOT EXECUTED: lightning on mainnet, other implementations, Taproot Assets and RGB, a watchtower, an HTLC timeout on chain, multipath and trampoline payments, gossip on mainnet, BOLT 8 between lnd nodes, the GPG signature of the lnd manifest, a unilateral close with HTLCs pending; no Stage-4 artefact. The check run here covers pipeline gates, executed corpus claims, the verify script and HermiT consistency." .
