ex:ST_Page_Ch09 backlog:hasAuditNote "Dated note, 2026-10-16 (open correction, not yet fixed; the Done record is untouched): the chapter 9 provenance file 03-materials/ch09/assets/ASSETS_PROVENANCE_v1_3_0.md lists bolt03_transactions.md (194359 bytes) as 'CC0 (BOLT 3)'. The chapter 14 provenance file ASSETS_PROVENANCE_v1_2_0.md lists the same file, of the same size, as 'CC BY 4.0 (stated in the BOLT file itself)', which is what the course coordinator reports the BOLT files state. The two physical files disagree; the chapter 9 one is the one believed wrong. A corrected provenance file must be a new version; it is not made here." .

