    backlog:obligationWaivedBy backlog:Ob_Backlog_ClassDiagram ;
    backlog:obligationWaiverReason "The Backlog stage owes a class model of the domain at the analysis level in the lineage. It was not produced at the Objective stage, where the stage digest table v4 counts a model artifact; the Objective output of this lineage was already committed and pushed without it, a committed file is not edited (L-112) and adding the model afterwards would move the recorded Objective digest. This is the course session's omission, not a decision that no model is owed: the debt stays on the record as an advisory and is paid by a stage revision from the Objective stage if the owner asks for one. The two link-pass stories declare no design concern." ;
    backlog:closedAtCommit "error:" .

