    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done, recorded 2026-10-19: Stage 3.F passes for chapter 4 after the citation repair (Stage 3 document patch version, commit b4c7a07), the verify script of the chapter was written (commit ff82603), and the evidence bridge ran the lineage chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch04 (Stage 1-3 gates, corpus claims, verify script, HermiT; exit 0) and, run again, for Deck/Ch04 and Page/Ch04 (the page test uses a TEST release key and proves the page logic only). It verified the SHA-256 of the newest research file, the newest Stage 3 document, the verify script and the shared verify library (commits b4c7a07, c5c5868, ff82603). Chapter 4: research v1.3.0 adds finding F15, which cites P85 and BIP 142 (P17); the label of P17 is corrected from Wuille 2015 to Lau 2015 because the saved BIP preamble names Johnson Lau (commit c5c5868). F15's status Closed and the statement that BIP 173 replaces 142 are read from saved copies and no executed corpus claim covers them (the finding says so). Disclosed: the research scorecard text still carries the old source counts. The checks Stage4.cov and Stage4.sub on the pages of chapters 2-4 are PROPOSED checks that were failing before; this register records no result for them, they are not part of this task, and nothing here claims they pass." .
