ex:Init_Slides rdfs:comment "Owner-directed. Owner's direction, 2026-10-20 09:19 Istanbul (2026-10-20T06:19:00 UTC), relayed by the course coordinator: \"Update the status of the PBI's backfilling the historic data. Never let inconsistencies in status and dates. What is still waiting in the lineage? We need to finish the work of SEN0401 as soon as possible. Keep quality and cleaning operations until we finish the lineage first as we need to reserve a concentrated time on them.\" The initiative is recorded Done in the version after the one that records its three epics Done, because its check reads the epics as Done."@en .
