ex:Init_Slides backlog:hasAuditNote "Recorded Done 2026-10-20 (owner direction of that day, backfilling the historic data): its 3 epics (the descendants below them included) all read Done, every story and task below it carries bridge-verified evidence, and the files they cite were re-hashed from the workspace (Ev4_Init_Slides, the check 08-tooling/sen0401_lineage_item_check_v1_0_0.py run by the evidence bridge). The completion of an epic or an initiative is derived from its constituent work; startedAt is the earliest start and finishedAt the latest finish below it, so a parent never finishes before a child. The item was admitted open as part of the first lineage and carried; the Backlog digest covers subjects only and does not move. The committed versions stay as the record (L-112)." .
