ex:Spec3G_3F a backlog:Specification ;
    rdfs:label "What it is for Stage 3.F passes for a Stage 3 document"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:specifiesGoal ex:G3_Stage3FPasses ;
    backlog:hasSpecificationText "Stage 3.F passes for a Stage 3 document when the chapter check and the Stage 4 gate runner, run on the newest research and document files of the unit reports PASS for the gate or gates named by the unit's criterion, with the gate, the test and the threshold exactly as they stand in the course repository; a gate the runner reports as NOT_MEASURED or CANNOT_RUN is reported as such and is not claimed as passed. A unit that fails is named with the failing gate and is not Done." ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_Derived ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:producedByStage ex:Out3_GoalR2 .
ex:Scen3G_3F_Passes a backlog:TestScenario ; rdfs:label "A unit's gate run reports PASS on unchanged gates (3F)"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:scenarioKind backlog:Scen_Nominal ; backlog:scenarioOf ex:Spec3G_3F ;
    backlog:hasScenarioText "Given the newest files of a unit in the course repository, when the chapter check and the Stage 4 gate runner, run on the newest research and document files of the unit is run, then the gate or gates of the criterion report PASS and the run exits 0 for that gate." .
ex:Scen3G_3F_NotClaimed a backlog:TestScenario ; rdfs:label "A unit whose gate still fails is not claimed as passing (3F)"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:scenarioKind backlog:Scen_Rejection ; backlog:scenarioOf ex:Spec3G_3F ;
    backlog:hasScenarioText "Given a unit whose gate reports FAIL, or whose run stops, when the story is to be recorded Done, then the criterion of that unit has no passing result and the story is not Done." .

