ex:TK_Gap3F_Ch05_Build backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC3G_3F_Ch05 ; backlog:hasEvidence ex:Ev3GE_Gates_Ch05, ex:Ev3GE_Research_Ch05, ex:Ev3GE_Deck_Ch05, ex:Ev3GE_Page_Ch05, ex:Ev3GE_File_Ch05_4, ex:Ev3GE_File_Ch05_3, ex:Ev3GE_File_Ch05_1, ex:Ev3GE_File_Ch05_2 ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done, recorded 2026-10-21: the repair commit is 76d6083 (2026-10-21T01:39:15 UTC), research v1.1.1, written by the chapter 5 work agent. Root cause of the Stage 3.F failure of chapter 5 under the current validator (v1.13.0): the citations are written 'Lightning Labs, 2026a' and 'Lightning Labs, 2026b'; the validator's resolver reads a standalone four-digit year from a source label, and '2026a' is not one, so 15 citations of sources that WERE in the research data (P20, P21) did not resolve. The pinned validator (v1.6.0) reads it, which is why the chapter check passed while the runner failed. Repair (research v1.1.1, commit 76d6083): the two labels now end ', retrieved 2026-10-04' (the sources' own verifiedAt); no source was added or invented, no citation or claim removed, no gate, test or threshold changed; the sources were re-fetched and their SHA-256 equal the saved copies. The evidence bridge ran from 2026-10-21T01:51:46 to 2026-10-21T02:02:01 UTC the Stage 4 gate runner for 05 and the chapter checks Research, Deck and Page of Ch05 (all exit 0) and verified the SHA-256 of the 4 files of the repair commits." .
