ex:Spec3T_T a backlog:Specification ;
    rdfs:label "What it is for a page meets the written standard"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:specifiesGoal ex:G3_PagesSameStandard ;
    backlog:hasSpecificationText "The written standard of a page, each element a fact the page can be measured against and none a taste: (1) template: the page is built from the current page template, 9.51.0, the one the newest pages of chapters 1 to 7, 9 and 13 use; measured by the two code markers 'const LBLRE=LBL.map' and 'function edVars()' present in the page HTML; (2) content: the page carries the deck's lecture export and stories; measured by pages_deck_match_verify, 0 not carried; (3) ERD: the relationship labels are shown after Untangle; measured by the existing page test 9.35.0, the feature 'the on-choice labels mode ... Untangle finishes and leaves no more lines through unrelated entities than the grid had', which compares the labels shown after Untangle with the grid (at least 95 percent) - no new test is written, the template carries the fix; (4) tests: the page tests 9.34.0 and 9.35.0, unchanged, report no failure and counts equal to or better than the stored result of the page as it stands; (5) Stage 4: the page ABox is rebuilt from the new page as a new file and the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 for the chapter exits 0 with Stage3.F, Stage4.A, B, cov, sub and src PASS; the Research, Deck and Page chapter checks of the chapter still pass. NOT part of the standard: the connectedness repair of the T-Box files; the concept-inventory gates (Stage1.C, Stage1.E, Stage3.E, Stage4.L, which the runner reports NOT_MEASURED because the research data holds no concept inventory) and Cross.B/Cross.C; any change to a gate, a test or a threshold; any change to the content, the decks or the research (except the chapter 8 examples); the owner's open rulings (load-time budget of the page of chapter 6, test-design ruling of chapter 13)." ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_Derived ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:producedByStage ex:Out3_GoalR3 .
ex:Scen3T_T_Passes a backlog:TestScenario ; rdfs:label "A page's checks report the standard met (T)"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:scenarioKind backlog:Scen_Nominal ; backlog:scenarioOf ex:Spec3T_T ;
    backlog:hasScenarioText "Given the newest files of a page in the course repository, when the five checks of the written standard (template markers, pages_deck_match_verify, the page tests 9.34.0 and 9.35.0, the Stage 4 gate runner and the chapter checks) are run, then they report no failure and the run exits 0." .
ex:Scen3T_T_NotClaimed a backlog:TestScenario ; rdfs:label "A page that does not meet the standard is not claimed as meeting it (T)"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:scenarioKind backlog:Scen_Rejection ; backlog:scenarioOf ex:Spec3T_T ;
    backlog:hasScenarioText "Given a page for which a check fails or stops, when the story is to be recorded Done, then the criterion of that page has no passing result and the story is not Done; the page is named with the failing check." .

