    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:memberOfContainer ex:Iter_13 ; backlog:admittedByOutput ex:Out3_BacklogR28 ;
    backlog:hasInvestmentCategory backlog:Cat_NewCapability ;
    backlog:asRole "SEN0401 instructor" ; backlog:wantsCapability "the examples of chapter 8 to be real executable code with numbers the reader can edit" ; backlog:soThat "the page of chapter 8 passes the page test every other page passes, and its examples teach by being run and changed" ;
    backlog:satisfiesDeliverable ex:Del3_Ch08Examples ; backlog:pursuesObjective ex:Obj3_Ch08Page34 ; backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC3T_Ch08_Examples ;
    backlog:effectiveDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD ; backlog:hasApplicableConcern backlog:Concern_Data ; backlog:responsible ex:Executor_ClaudeCodeSession ;
    backlog:decomposesInto ex:TK_Ch08Ex_Build, ex:TK_Ch08Ex_Verify ;
    backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:startedAt "2026-10-21T08:24:15"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:finishedAt "2026-10-21T19:49:53"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:lastAuditedAt "2026-10-21T19:49:53"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasExecutionModality backlog:Mode_Hybrid ;
    backlog:notYetScoreable true ; backlog:hasScoreabilityReason "Not scored: the owner's lean of 2026-10-21 08:12 Istanbul is to finish this before the closure, so there is no ranking left to compute." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Created by the stage revision ex:Revision_Lineage3_Scope2 on the owner's message of Wednesday 2026-10-21 08:12 Istanbul (2026-10-21T05:12:00 UTC) (quoted in ex:CR3_Pages), which follows his stated lean. Measured 2026-10-21 (coordinator; strings re-checked by the builder session in the newest page HTML of each chapter): pages 8, 10, 11, 12 and 14 (page versions 9.51.0, 9.53.0, 9.54.0, 9.55.0, 9.57.0) do not contain the code of the page template 9.50.0/9.51.0 ('const LBLRE=LBL.map' and 'function edVars()' are present in the pages of chapters 1 to 7, 9 and 13 and absent in these five): they lack the label-aware ERD untangle of 9.50.0 (the defect that left 6 labels out on chapter 3 under 9.48) and the faster load of 9.51.0 (the stability fix for the load-time budget; noisy first runs happened on chapters 11 and 13 and a chapter 11 test hung). Their content matches the decks (pages_deck_match_verify: 0 not carried on all five); the regression (evidence commit 0f7d21f) showed their test counts do not change on 9.51.0. Page 8 also fails page test 9.34.0 (113 pass, 1 fail, then a crash): no chapter 8 example has a number in its code; chapter 13 solved the same check by research v1_0_2 examples with editable numbers (commit 43886764) and a new inputs maker. The register had no work item for any of this." .

