ex:Rebase3_Iter_12 a backlog:Rebaseline ; rdfs:label "Iteration 12 closed ahead of its proposed end"@en ; backlog:rebaselines ex:Iter_12 ; backlog:hasPreviousTarget "2026-10-23T06:00:00" ; backlog:hasNewTarget "2026-10-21T08:08:43" ;
    backlog:hasRebaselineRationale "Owner direction relayed 2026-10-21 10:14 Istanbul: close Iter_12 properly with its gap work, all Done, and plan the template and chapter 8 work as a new iteration. The gap work finished before the proposed end of Friday 2026-10-23 06:00 UTC, so the end of Iter_12 is the instant of its review." ; backlog:rebaselinedAt "2026-10-21T08:08:43"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner .
ex:Iter_12 rdfs:comment "Corrections of 2026-10-21, ordered by the owner (Wednesday 2026-10-21 10:14 Istanbul (2026-10-21T07:14:00 UTC)): the sprint goal is back to the gap work it was planned for (the sentence added mid-sprint for the template work is withdrawn: a sprint goal is not extended, a new iteration is planned), the template stories and tasks belong to ex:Iter_13, and this iteration, which holds only the gap work, is closed by a review ceremony. The planning ceremony ex:PC3_Iter_12 is recorded afterwards from the existing planning events."@en .
ex:PC3_Iter_12 a backlog:SprintPlanningCeremony ; rdfs:label "Planning of iteration 12, recorded afterwards from its planning events"@en ; backlog:ceremonyFor ex:Iter_12 ; backlog:heldAt "2026-10-20T16:04:32"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:includesPlanningEvent ex:Plan3G_ST_Gap_Stage3F, ex:Plan3G_ST_Gap_Stage4, ex:Plan3G_ST_Gap_Stage3F_Ch05 ;
    rdfs:comment "Recorded on 2026-10-21: the iteration was planned on 2026-10-20 without a planning ceremony record; this one names the existing planning events (the chapter 5 event was added to the open iteration on 2026-10-20 night)."@en .
ex:RC3_Iter_12 a backlog:SprintReviewCeremony ; rdfs:label "Review of iteration 12: the gap work, closed"@en ; backlog:ceremonyFor ex:Iter_12 ; backlog:reviewsCeremony ex:PC3_Iter_12 ; backlog:closesIteration ex:Iter_12 ;
    backlog:closesStory ex:ST_Gap_Stage3F, ex:ST_Gap_Stage4 ; backlog:heldAt "2026-10-21T08:08:43"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Held 2026-10-21: both stories and all 22 tasks of the iteration are Done with bridge-verified evidence (v0.134, v0.136, v0.137); the Stage 3.F and Stage 4 readings are 3 of 3 and 8 of 8 (v0.138 measurement of all 15 units; no file of those units changed since, read from git). Nothing is carried over: the template and chapter 8 work was never started and is planned into ex:Iter_13."@en .
