    backlog:observedAt "2026-10-21T08:08:43"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:observedDuringCeremony ex:RC3_Iter_12 ;
    backlog:hasObservationMethod "Read 2026-10-21 from the measurement of v0.138 (the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 for all 15 units, 2026-10-21): Stage 3.F passes for chapters 1 and 5 and Bitcoin in numbers: 3 of 3. Files of those units changed in git since the measurement: none." .
ex:Obs40_Obj3_Stage4Pass a backlog:MetricObservation ; rdfs:label "Reading at the review that closed iteration 12"@en ;
    backlog:observesMetric ex:Met3_Stage4Pass ; backlog:observationFor ex:Obj3_Stage4Pass ; backlog:hasObservedValue "8"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:observedAt "2026-10-21T08:08:43"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:observedDuringCeremony ex:RC3_Iter_12 ;
    backlog:hasObservationMethod "Read 2026-10-21 from the measurement of v0.138 (the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 for all 15 units, 2026-10-21): the Stage 4 gate run of chapters 1 to 7 and Bitcoin in numbers exits 0: 8 of 8. Files of those units changed in git since the measurement: none." .
ex:Iter_13 a backlog:Iteration ; rdfs:label "Iteration 13: rebuild the pages of chapters 8, 10, 11, 12 and 14 on the current template and give chapter 8 real examples"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "Iter_13" ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:iterationStart "2026-10-21T08:08:43"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:iterationEnd "2026-10-23T23:59:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDurationSource "Proposed by the builder session on 2026-10-21: the start is the instant of the planning ceremony ex:PC3_Iter_13; the proposed end is Friday 2026-10-23 06:00 UTC (09:00 Istanbul), the end of the earlier iterations that the owner confirmed on 2026-10-19. The end is the owner's to decide: the plan stands whatever end he gives, and a story still open at the end shows as spillover (L4) until he rebaselines or recommits." ;
    backlog:hasSprintGoal "The pages of chapters 8, 10, 11, 12 and 14 are built as new files on the current page template (9.51.0) with the same content and meet the written standard of ex:Spec3T_T, and chapter 8 has real executable examples with numbers so its page passes page test 9.34.0; each unit whose check fails is named; then the Mission outcome stays the owner's act. Frozen at the iteration's start: work added later goes to a new iteration or to the owner's rebaseline." ;
    backlog:hasMember ex:ST_Page_Template, ex:ST_Ch08_Examples, ex:TK_Ch08Ex_Build, ex:TK_Ch08Ex_Verify, ex:TK_PageTpl_Ch08_Build, ex:TK_PageTpl_Ch08_Verify, ex:TK_PageTpl_Ch10_Build, ex:TK_PageTpl_Ch10_Verify, ex:TK_PageTpl_Ch11_Build, ex:TK_PageTpl_Ch11_Verify, ex:TK_PageTpl_Ch12_Build, ex:TK_PageTpl_Ch12_Verify, ex:TK_PageTpl_Ch14_Build, ex:TK_PageTpl_Ch14_Verify .
ex:PB3T_Iter_13 a backlog:PlanBaseline ; rdfs:label "Plan baseline of iteration 13 when it was planned"@en ; backlog:baselineFor ex:Iter_13 ; backlog:baselinedAt "2026-10-21T08:08:43"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:isCurrentBaseline true ; backlog:hasBaselineStart "2026-10-21T08:08:43"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasBaselineEnd "2026-10-23T06:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime .
ex:PC3_Iter_13 a backlog:SprintPlanningCeremony ; rdfs:label "Planning of iteration 13: the template pages and the chapter 8 examples"@en ; backlog:ceremonyFor ex:Iter_13 ; backlog:heldAt "2026-10-21T08:08:43"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:includesPlanningEvent ex:Plan3T_ST_Page_Template, ex:Plan3T_ST_Ch08_Examples ;
    rdfs:comment "Held 2026-10-21T08:08:43 by the builder session, after the owner's message of Wednesday 2026-10-21 10:14 Istanbul (2026-10-21T07:14:00 UTC) (quoted in ex:CR3_Pages and ex:Lineage3): the stories ST_Page_Template and ST_Ch08_Examples and their 12 tasks are committed to this iteration, whose goal is frozen at its start. Their planning events of 2026-10-21, first placed into the closed gap iteration, are re-pointed here. No executor has started; work begun is recorded at the real start of each executor session."@en .
ex:Iter_13 rdfs:comment "Corrected placement 2026-10-21: the template and chapter 8 items were put into ex:Iter_12 by v0.145 (the sprint goal of that iteration was extended mid-sprint); they belong to this iteration by memberOfContainer and hasMember alike."@en .

ex:ST_Gap_Stage3F backlog:hasAuditNote "Structure checked 2026-10-21 (owner's message of Wednesday 2026-10-21 10:14 Istanbul (2026-10-21T07:14:00 UTC)): one deliverable (ex:Del3_Stage3FRepair), one acceptance criterion per unit, every task decomposes from this story, Verify tasks depend on their Build tasks. Stands alone: this story has no epic. The discipline gives no rule that a story needs a parent, and the register is conformant with stories that stand alone (the link-pass stories ex:ST_Deck_LinkPass and ex:ST_Page_LinkPass of this lineage). A child added to an epic or initiative that is Done reopens it in effect (G130 Q4), and the epics EP_Deck, EP_Research, EP_Page and the initiative Init_Slides are Done with their children fixed (G125: a Done item stays Done); a new epic is an item of the Backlog stage, so a revision from the Backlog stage (about three versions) for a grouping the owner has not asked for. The tasks are tied to this story by decomposesInto (the inverse partOf is inferred), each Verify task dependsOn its Build task, and each task and the story belong to one iteration by memberOfContainer and hasMember." .
ex:ST_Gap_Stage4 backlog:hasAuditNote "Structure checked 2026-10-21 (owner's message of Wednesday 2026-10-21 10:14 Istanbul (2026-10-21T07:14:00 UTC)): one deliverable (ex:Del3_Stage4PageAbox), one acceptance criterion per unit, every task decomposes from this story, Verify tasks depend on their Build tasks. Stands alone: this story has no epic. The discipline gives no rule that a story needs a parent, and the register is conformant with stories that stand alone (the link-pass stories ex:ST_Deck_LinkPass and ex:ST_Page_LinkPass of this lineage). A child added to an epic or initiative that is Done reopens it in effect (G130 Q4), and the epics EP_Deck, EP_Research, EP_Page and the initiative Init_Slides are Done with their children fixed (G125: a Done item stays Done); a new epic is an item of the Backlog stage, so a revision from the Backlog stage (about three versions) for a grouping the owner has not asked for. The tasks are tied to this story by decomposesInto (the inverse partOf is inferred), each Verify task dependsOn its Build task, and each task and the story belong to one iteration by memberOfContainer and hasMember." .
