ex:G3_SectionsRelated a backlog:Goal ;
    rdfs:label "The sections of a chapter are related to each other as the research states, so the ERD of its page shows how they connect"@en ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:derivesFromScope ex:Scope3 ; backlog:goalCoversArea ex:Area3_SectionLinks ;
    backlog:contributesToMission ex:Mission ; backlog:hasGoalFacing backlog:Facing_Mission ; backlog:hasGoalOrigin backlog:GoalOrigin_New ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_Derived ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:hasGoalRationale "Derived from the revised scope of the third lineage (ex:Del3_SectionLinks) and from the owner's answer of Thursday 2026-10-22 01:24 Istanbul (2026-10-21T22:24:00 UTC), as relayed by the course coordinator; the time at which the owner wrote it is not known to the builder session, quoted: \"Sections are linked with each other at least by menu, possibly by semantic, syntactic, temporal, concepts, content or other relationships. You need to discover it by using the OEE relationship taxonomy and if necessary class categorization in a similar manner.\"" ;
    backlog:producedByStage ex:Out3_GoalR4 .
ex:G3_SectionsRelated rdfs:comment "Drafted by the builder session on 2026-10-22 from the owner's answer of Thursday 2026-10-22 01:24 Istanbul (2026-10-21T22:24:00 UTC), as relayed by the course coordinator; the time at which the owner wrote it is not known to the builder session (quoted in the change request ex:CR3_PageErd); the intent origin is therefore Derived. The owner gave the direction; he did not review the wording of this element."@en .

ex:Spec3L_L a backlog:Specification ;
    rdfs:label "What it is for the research to state how the sections of a chapter relate"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:specifiesGoal ex:G3_SectionsRelated ;
    backlog:hasSpecificationText "The research of a chapter states, as links between the sections' individuals or classes, how the sections relate: every section is related to at least one other section by a relation of the OEE taxonomy (semantic, syntactic, temporal, containment, ordering or another), declared in the domain T-Box with a relationship category, and the page of the chapter draws them so that the existing ERD features of the page test 9.35.0 can run. The OEE relationship taxonomy is oe-method/04-documentation/RELATIONSHIP_TAXONOMY_RESEARCH_v1_11_0.md (categories as kb:RelationshipCategory_* in oe-method/09-governance/oegov_abox_v1_36_0.ttl, properties kb:hasRelationshipCategory and kb:hasClassKind in oegov_tbox_v1_15_0.ttl); construction method BP-D58 (choose the relation: which category, is there a standard relation that says it, which pattern, what to declare), class kinds BP-D59, missing-link discovery BP-D57 (tool repo-tooling/oe_link_discovery_v1_1_0.py: syntactic, semantic, temporal families; file set = a T-Box and A-Box pair), kind rule check repo-tooling/oe_kind_rule_check_v1_1_0.py. OE v2.31.0 and v2.32.0 (ceremony of 2026-10-22: PROCEED, repo-tooling v1.77.0) add kind rules and two class kinds: they bind the ontology files and any research that declares a category or a kind; they do not bind the A-Box versions of this register." ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_Derived ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:producedByStage ex:Out3_GoalR4 .
ex:Scen3L_L_Passes a backlog:TestScenario ; rdfs:label "A chapter whose research links its sections shows labelled relationships on its ERD"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:scenarioKind backlog:Scen_Nominal ; backlog:scenarioOf ex:Spec3L_L ;
    backlog:hasScenarioText "Given the new research version of a chapter, when the section relationships it states as links are read by the page-data builder and the page is rebuilt, then the page test 9.35.0 runs the two ERD label features without a skip and passes them, and every section has a relationship to at least one other section." .
ex:Scen3L_L_NotClaimed a backlog:TestScenario ; rdfs:label "A chapter whose ERD feature is skipped is not claimed as measured"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:scenarioKind backlog:Scen_Rejection ; backlog:scenarioOf ex:Spec3L_L ;
    backlog:hasScenarioText "Given a page for which the test 9.35.0 skips the ERD label features because the research states no relationship between two sections, when the story is to be recorded Done, then the criterion of that chapter has no passing result and the chapter is named." .

