ex:AC3L_Ch10 a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The research of chapter 10 states how its sections relate as links, and its page shows them with the ERD labels measured"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Owner's answer of Thursday 2026-10-22 01:24 Istanbul (2026-10-21T22:24:00 UTC), as relayed by the course coordinator; the time at which the owner wrote it is not known to the builder session: \"Sections are linked with each other at least by menu, possibly by semantic, syntactic, temporal, concepts, content or other relationships. You need to discover it by using the OEE relationship taxonomy and if necessary class categorization in a similar manner.\" Given the research of chapter 10 (17 sections, none related to another section, ruling G134: links, not text) and its page (page 9.77.0), when a new version of the research states the relationships between sections as object-property links discovered with the OEE relationship taxonomy (each property declared in the domain T-Box with domain, range, label and a relationship category; a standard relation reused where one says it; class kinds where the kind rule needs them) and the page is rebuilt from it as a new page version, then ALL of: (1) links: every one of the 17 sections is related to at least one other section by a stated link, and no relationship is stated as text only; (2) ERD: the page test 9.35.0 runs its ERD label features (the filled ERD overlap and labels-over-entity reading, and the on-choice labels mode) with no skip and passes them, labels shown after Untangle at least 95 percent of the grid's; (3) gates: the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 for 10 (reading the current validator v1.13.0) exits 0 with Stage3.F, Stage4.A, B, cov, sub and src PASS, and the Research, Deck and Page chapter checks v1_3_0 (reading the pinned validator v1.6.0) pass; (4) the five elements of the criterion AC3T_Ch10 are measured again on the new page and all pass: the template markers, pages_deck_match_verify with 0 not carried, the page tests 9.34.0 and 9.35.0 unchanged with counts equal to or better than the stored result, the Stage 4 page ABox rebuilt as a new file; (5) no gate, test, threshold, criterion or template is changed and no committed file is edited; results are reported as printed (PASS, FAIL, NOT_MEASURED, CANNOT_RUN) and a skip is not a pass; if any element fails the chapter is named failing and this criterion has no passing result." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS_Stage4Gates, ex:TS_ChapterCheck, ex:TS_PageTest35, ex:TS_PageTest34, ex:TS_DeckMatch, ex:TS_PageCheck, ex:TS_RdodiValidatorCurrent, ex:TS_RdodiValidatorPinned, ex:TS_LinkDiscovery ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "page test 9.35.0 and 9.34.0 (unchanged); Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 reading the CURRENT RDODI validator v1.13.0; chapter check v1_3_0 reading the PINNED RDODI validator v1.6.0; deck match check v1_0_0; page check wrapper v1_0_0; relationship discovery: oe_link_discovery v1_1_0 (repo-tooling v1.77.0, OE v2.32.0)" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new research version, the page, its Stage 4 page ABox and the stored page-test results as new files cited by SHA-256, and the runs of the template markers, the deck match check, the page tests, the Stage 4 gate runner and the chapter checks, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC3L_L_Passes, ex:TC3L_L_NotClaimed .

