ex:TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Page a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Rebuild the page of chapter 11 from the research with section links, and its Stage 4 page ABox"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Page" ; backlog:hasTitle "Rebuild the page of chapter 11 from the research with section links, and its Stage 4 page ABox" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:memberOfContainer ex:Iter_14 ; backlog:admittedByOutput ex:Out3_BacklogR28 ; backlog:responsible ex:Executor_ClaudeCodeSession ;
    backlog:hasInvestmentCategory backlog:Cat_NewCapability ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:effectiveDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD ; backlog:hasState backlog:Cancelled ; backlog:startedAt "2026-10-22T01:46:24"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:lastAuditedAt "2026-10-24T09:14:56"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasRationale "Closed 2026-10-24T09:14:56 UTC by the change route of ex:CR3_Repair20 (v0.252.0): the task is superseded by TK_Ch11_Page_Build, of Iteration 21, which rebuilds the page of chapter 11 on template 9.52.2 with the section-link ERD; it is withdrawn, not Done, and its result (page 9.78.0 failing the page tests, suspended since 2026-10-22) stays in the register as history." ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Research, ex:TK_SecLinks_PageData, ex:TK_PageGates_Template, ex:TK_PageGates_Test, ex:TK_PageGates_Regression ;
    backlog:notYetScoreable true ; backlog:hasScoreabilityReason "Ranked by its story's state; scoring both would double-count." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "From the new research version of chapter 11 and the new page-data builder, build the page as a new file with a new page version on the page template 9.51.0 with the page builder v4_14_0, run the page tests 9.34.0 and 9.35.0 unchanged (the ERD label features must run, not skip) and store the result; build the Stage 4 page ABox from the new page with the Stage 4 builder (a new file). A committed file is never edited: every output is a new file with a new version number. No gate, test, threshold, criterion or page template is changed; STOP and report if any would be needed (including a relation type the template cannot draw). The OEE relationship taxonomy is oe-method/04-documentation/RELATIONSHIP_TAXONOMY_RESEARCH_v1_11_0.md (categories as kb:RelationshipCategory_* in oe-method/09-governance/oegov_abox_v1_36_0.ttl, properties kb:hasRelationshipCategory and kb:hasClassKind in oegov_tbox_v1_15_0.ttl); construction method BP-D58 (choose the relation: which category, is there a standard relation that says it, which pattern, what to declare), class kinds BP-D59, missing-link discovery BP-D57 (tool repo-tooling/oe_link_discovery_v1_1_0.py: syntactic, semantic, temporal families; file set = a T-Box and A-Box pair), kind rule check repo-tooling/oe_kind_rule_check_v1_1_0.py. OE v2.31.0 and v2.32.0 (ceremony of 2026-10-22: PROCEED, repo-tooling v1.77.0) add kind rules and two class kinds: they bind the ontology files and any research that declares a category or a kind; they do not bind the A-Box versions of this register. Satisfies the criterion ex:AC3L_Ch11." .

