ex:Iter_14 a backlog:Iteration ; rdfs:label "Iteration 14: state the relationships between the sections of chapters 10 and 11 as links in the research and rebuild their pages"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "Iter_14" ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:iterationStart "2026-10-21T23:22:56"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:iterationEnd "2026-10-24T06:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDurationSource "Proposed by the builder session on 2026-10-22: the start is the instant of the planning ceremony ex:PC3_Iter_14; the proposed end is Saturday 2026-10-24 06:00 UTC (09:00 Istanbul), a day after the end of ex:Iter_13, for two chapters of research, one builder version and two page rebuilds at about nine minutes per page test run. The end is the owner's to decide: the plan stands whatever end he gives, and a story still open at the end shows as spillover (L4) until he rebaselines or recommits. Why a new iteration: the goal of ex:Iter_13 is frozen at its start and adding work to it is the mid-sprint extension the owner ruled out on 2026-10-21 10:14 Istanbul; closing ex:Iter_13 early would need a Rebaseline decided by the owner. ex:Iter_13 stays open with ST_Page_Template only (members unchanged) until AC3T_Ch10 and AC3T_Ch11 are met by the verify tasks here." ;
    backlog:hasSprintGoal "The research of chapters 10 and 11 states the relationships between their sections as links discovered with the OEE relationship taxonomy, the page-data builder reads them, and the two pages are rebuilt so that the ERD label features of the page test 9.35.0 run and pass with no skip, on the gates as they stand, each unit that fails named; then the owner records the Mission outcome. Frozen at the iteration's start: work added later goes to a new iteration or to the owner's rebaseline." ;
