    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done, recorded 2026-10-22: delivered by the executor session SEN0401-I14-research-ch11 (commit 4a2f709); control run on the evidence bridge, serial, logs in 08-tooling/verify/iter14/ch11. Results as printed: Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 (current validator v1.13.0): verified -> OVERALL: PASS; chapter check Research v1_3_0 (pinned validator v1.6.0): verified -> RESULT Research/Ch11: PASS; section links declared, between sections, every section covered (sen0401_ch_seclinks_check v1_0_0): verified -> RESULT: PASS; every link annotated with the sentence that states it (sen0401_ch_seclinks_check v1_0_0 --evidence): verified -> RESULT: PASS; OE link discovery v1_1_0 (BP-D57, BP-D61 duplicate family): 0 beyond the baseline: verified -> VERDICT: PASS; OE kind rule check v1_1_0 (BP-D58, BP-D59): verified -> VERDICT: PASS; one property per category and super-property (floor of BP-D61), sen0401_lineage_research_check v1_0_0: verified -> RESULT: PASS (a measurable floor of BP-D61: one property per category and super-property; two properties in one group are one meaning unless they differ in cate." .
