ex:AC3L_Ch10_Singular a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The chapter 10 research states each relationship meaning once, keeps its 28 links and gives each link its sentence"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Given the chapter 10 research v1.1.0 (commit d4dda4c: 26 properties for 28 links, the same meaning stated more than once; no link carries its sentence) and the owner's standing rule of 2026-10-21, as relayed by the coordinator on 2026-10-22: real equals (terms with the same meaning) are ONE property with several labels, not parallel properties (consolidate; OE v2.27.0 BP-D61 'one meaning, one term', v2.28.0 duplicate detector, rule S6), when a new research version v1.2.0 states the relationships once per meaning, then ALL of: (1) singular: the check singular:10 reports PASS (no two properties share a label, none share both a relationship category and a super-property) and each retained property's definition says what it means that no other retained property means, chapter 11 being the model (6 properties for 32 links); (2) the same 28 link meanings: the check samepairs:10 reports PASS (every link of v1.1.0 is still stated between the same two individuals); (3) every one of the 17 sections is an end of at least one link (seclinks:10 PASS); (4) every link carries the sentence that states it (annotated:10 PASS); (5) gates: the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 for chapter 10 (reading the current validator v1.13.0) exits 0, the Research chapter check v1_3_0 (reading the pinned validator v1.6.0) passes, the OE link discovery v1_1_0 reports 0 beyond the baseline and the OE kind rule check v1_1_0 reports 0 violations; (6) no committed file is edited, no gate, test, threshold or criterion is changed; results are reported as printed (PASS, FAIL, NOT_MEASURED, CANNOT_RUN); if any element fails the research is named failing and this criterion has no passing result." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS_Stage4Gates, ex:TS_ChapterCheck, ex:TS_LinkDiscovery, ex:TS_KindRuleCheck, ex:TS_SeclinksCheck, ex:TS_ResearchCheck, ex:TS_RdodiValidatorCurrent, ex:TS_RdodiValidatorPinned ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "research check v1_0_0 (singular, samepairs, annotated, seclinks); Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 reading the CURRENT RDODI validator v1.13.0; chapter check v1_3_0 reading the PINNED RDODI validator v1.6.0; OE link discovery v1_1_0 and OE kind rule check v1_1_0 (repo-tooling v1.77.0, OE v2.32.0); section links check v1_0_0" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new chapter 10 research files cited by SHA-256, and the runs of the research checks, the Stage 4 gate runner, the chapter check, the link discovery and the kind rule check, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC3L_L_Passes, ex:TC3L_L_NotClaimed .

ex:TK_SecLinks_Ch10_Consolidate a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Consolidate the chapter 10 section links: one property per meaning, a sentence on every link, research v1.2.0"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "TK_SecLinks_Ch10_Consolidate" ; backlog:hasTitle "Consolidate the chapter 10 section links: one property per meaning, a sentence on every link, research v1.2.0" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:memberOfContainer ex:Iter_15 ; backlog:admittedByOutput ex:Out3_BacklogR28 ; backlog:responsible ex:Executor_ClaudeCodeSession ;
    backlog:hasInvestmentCategory backlog:Cat_NewCapability ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:effectiveDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD ; backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:startedAt "2026-10-22T01:01:08"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:finishedAt "2026-10-22T01:05:31"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:lastAuditedAt "2026-10-22T01:07:06"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasExecutionModality backlog:Mode_Hybrid ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK_SecLinks_Ch10_Research ;
    backlog:notYetScoreable true ; backlog:hasScoreabilityReason "Ranked by its story's state; scoring both would double-count." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Write the chapter 10 research as a NEW version v1.2.0 (new files only; research v1.1.0, commit d4dda4c, and its generator are not edited) in which the same relationships are stated once per meaning: (1) ONE PROPERTY PER MEANING (the owner's standing rule of 2026-10-21, as relayed by the coordinator on 2026-10-22: real equals (terms with the same meaning) are ONE property with several labels, not parallel properties (consolidate; OE v2.27.0 BP-D61 'one meaning, one term', v2.28.0 duplicate detector, rule S6)): read the definitions of the 26 properties of v1.1.0 and the sentence that states each of the 28 links, group them by meaning (for example the five 'precedes' variants, the six requirement variants, the five comparison variants, the 'defend against an attack' variants), and state each meaning as one general object property with its relationship category, one label and, where an earlier wording adds information, a further label (skos:altLabel); the class pair belongs to the link and to the sentence that states it, not to a new property; chapter 11 is the model (hasComponent, refersTo, hasConsequence, isComparedWith, isFollowedBy, isEarlierThan: 6 properties for 32 links). A meaning that really differs (a different category or a different standard super-property) stays a separate property, with its definition saying how it differs; (2) THE SAME 28 LINK MEANINGS: every link of v1.1.0 is still stated between the same two individuals (check samepairs:10); a pair you cannot keep is reported by name, not dropped; (3) every one of the 17 sections is related to at least one other (check seclinks:10); (4) EVERY LINK CARRIES THE SENTENCE THAT STATES IT, as chapter 11 does (owl:Axiom with rdfs:comment; see the chapter 11 A-Box v1.1.0 and check annotated:10); (5) STANDARD RELATIONS: where a retained property reuses a standard relation (BFO precedes, dcterms or RDODI properties such as requires, replaces, isPartOf) the T-Box says which and why, and an evidence note that stops being true after merging is corrected or removed; the reuse stays only where it is true (a process 'precedes' a process); (6) CHECKS, all as printed: sen0401_lineage_research_check singular:10, samepairs:10, seclinks:10, annotated:10, linkdisc:10 (0 beyond the baseline), kindrule:10 (0 violations; declare class kinds where the kind rule needs them), the Stage 4 gate runner for 10 (current validator v1.13.0) and the Research chapter check (pinned v1.6.0). A committed file is never edited; no gate, test, threshold or criterion is changed. STOP and report if a merge would change what a link says, or a check would have to change. Satisfies the criterion ex:AC3L_Ch10_Singular." .

ex:ST_Ch10_Consolidate a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "The chapter 10 section links are stated once per meaning, each with its sentence"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "ST_Ch10_Consolidate" ; backlog:hasTitle "The chapter 10 section links are stated once per meaning, each with its sentence" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:memberOfContainer ex:Iter_15 ; backlog:admittedByOutput ex:Out3_BacklogR28 ;
    backlog:hasInvestmentCategory backlog:Cat_NewCapability ;
    backlog:asRole "SEN0401 instructor" ; backlog:wantsCapability "the chapter 10 research to state each relationship meaning once, keep its 28 links and give each link its sentence" ; backlog:soThat "the page of chapter 10 is built on a research that follows the owner's rule one meaning one term, and its ERD labels say what each link means" ;
    backlog:satisfiesDeliverable ex:Del3_SectionLinks ; backlog:pursuesObjective ex:Obj3_SectionsLinked ; backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC3L_Ch10_Singular ;
    backlog:effectiveDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD ; backlog:hasApplicableConcern backlog:Concern_Data ; backlog:responsible ex:Executor_ClaudeCodeSession ;
    backlog:decomposesInto ex:TK_SecLinks_Ch10_Consolidate ;
    backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:startedAt "2026-10-22T01:01:08"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:finishedAt "2026-10-22T01:07:06"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:lastAuditedAt "2026-10-22T01:07:06"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasExecutionModality backlog:Mode_Hybrid ;
    backlog:notYetScoreable true ; backlog:hasScoreabilityReason "Not scored: a repair raised by the control under the owner's rule, so there is no ranking left to compute." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Created by the change route CR3_Singular after the control of the research task (v0.163): Found by the control run of 2026-10-22 (register v0.163; logs in 08-tooling/verify/iter14/ch10): the chapter 10 research v1.1.0 (commit d4dda4c) states its 28 links with 26 properties, one per class pair, and the same meaning is stated more than once: five 'precedes' variants (precedesCompactBlockMode, precedesFeefilter, precedesHeadersRequest, precedesWtxidAnnouncement, relayNetworkPrecedesCompactBlocks), six requirement variants (buildsOn x3, requiresAddressExchange, requiresProtocolVersion, plaintextFramedBy), five comparison variants ('in the way of', 'differs in privacy from', 'shares its hash function with') and two 'defend against an attack' variants among four causal ones. The check 'singular' of sen0401_lineage_research_check v1_0_0 (a floor: no two properties share a category and a super-property, no two share a label) fails with groups of 4, 2, 5, 6 and 5; chapter 11 passes it with 6 general properties for 32 links. The OE link discovery passes chapter 10 because its duplicate family compares definitions word for word and finds no identical one. Second finding: the chapter 10 links carry no sentence that states them (0 of 28; chapter 11: 32 of 32, check 'annotated'). Cause on the builder side: the brief generated for the research task (sen0401_lineage_brief v1_1_0) did not carry BP-D61 or the singularity rule, and the criterion AC3L_Ch10 did not ask for the sentence. Planned into the new iteration ex:Iter_15 as a story of its own, because a story is planned into one iteration only (L4) and the goal of ex:Iter_14 is frozen. The tasks of ex:ST_Section_Links for chapter 10 depend on its task." .
ex:ST_Ch10_Consolidate backlog:standsAlone true .
