ex:Iter_15 a backlog:Iteration ; rdfs:label "Iteration 15: consolidate the chapter 10 section links, one property per meaning"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "Iter_15" ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:iterationStart "2026-10-22T00:41:41"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:iterationEnd "2026-10-23T06:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDurationSource "Proposed by the builder session on 2026-10-22: the start is the instant of the planning ceremony ex:PC3_Iter_15; the proposed end is Friday 2026-10-23 06:00 UTC (09:00 Istanbul), the end of ex:Iter_13; one research task of about ten minutes. The end is the owner's to decide. Why a new iteration: the goal of ex:Iter_14 is frozen at its start and work added later goes to a new iteration or to the owner's rebaseline. The remaining tasks of ex:Iter_14 for chapter 10 wait for this one (dependsOn), so the two iterations run one after the other in effect." ;
    backlog:hasSprintGoal "The chapter 10 research states each relationship meaning once (one property per meaning with several labels, the class pair and the sentence carried by the link), keeps its 28 links and covers all 17 sections, on the gates as they stand, so that the section links of ex:Iter_14 are built on it; each check that fails is named. Frozen at the iteration's start." ;
    backlog:hasMember ex:ST_Ch10_Consolidate, ex:TK_SecLinks_Ch10_Consolidate .
ex:PB3L_Iter_15 a backlog:PlanBaseline ; rdfs:label "Plan baseline of iteration 15 when it was planned"@en ; backlog:baselineFor ex:Iter_15 ; backlog:baselinedAt "2026-10-22T00:41:41"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:isCurrentBaseline true ; backlog:hasBaselineStart "2026-10-22T00:41:41"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasBaselineEnd "2026-10-23T06:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime .
ex:PC3_Iter_15 a backlog:SprintPlanningCeremony ; rdfs:label "Planning of iteration 15: the chapter 10 consolidation"@en ; backlog:ceremonyFor ex:Iter_15 ; backlog:heldAt "2026-10-22T00:41:41"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:includesPlanningEvent ex:Plan3L_ST_Ch10_Consolidate ;
    rdfs:comment "Held 2026-10-22T00:41:41 by the builder session after the control of the research tasks (v0.163): the task TK_SecLinks_Ch10_Consolidate is committed to this iteration, whose goal is frozen at its start. No executor has started; work begun is recorded at the real start of the session SEN0401-I15-consolidate-ch10 with its brief."@en .
ex:SC3_Singular a backlog:ScopeChange ;
    rdfs:label "Backlog widened by the consolidation of the chapter 10 section links"@en ;
    backlog:fulfillsRequest ex:CR3_Singular ; backlog:changesScope ex:Scope3 ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:admitsItem ex:ST_Ch10_Consolidate ;
    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "The rule applied is the owner's standing rule of 2026-10-21, as relayed by the coordinator on 2026-10-22: real equals (terms with the same meaning) are ONE property with several labels, not parallel properties (consolidate; OE v2.27.0 BP-D61 'one meaning, one term', v2.28.0 duplicate detector, rule S6). The criterion AC3L_Ch10_Singular and the task TK_SecLinks_Ch10_Consolidate are admitted with the new story ex:ST_Ch10_Consolidate. Found by the control run of 2026-10-22 (register v0.163; logs in 08-tooling/verify/iter14/ch10): the chapter 10 research v1.1.0 (commit d4dda4c) states its 28 links with 26 properties, one per class pair, and the same meaning is stated more than once: five 'precedes' variants (precedesCompactBlockMode, precedesFeefilter, precedesHeadersRequest, precedesWtxidAnnouncement, relayNetworkPrecedesCompactBlocks), six requirement variants (buildsOn x3, requiresAddressExchange, requiresProtocolVersion, plaintextFramedBy), five comparison variants ('in the way of', 'differs in privacy from', 'shares its hash function with') and two 'defend against an attack' variants among four causal ones. The check 'singular' of sen0401_lineage_research_check v1_0_0 (a floor: no two properties share a category and a super-property, no two share a label) fails with groups of 4, 2, 5, 6 and 5; chapter 11 passes it with 6 general properties for 32 links. The OE link discovery passes chapter 10 because its duplicate family compares definitions word for word and finds no identical one. Second finding: the chapter 10 links carry no sentence that states them (0 of 28; chapter 11: 32 of 32, check 'annotated'). Cause on the builder side: the brief generated for the research task (sen0401_lineage_brief v1_1_0) did not carry BP-D61 or the singularity rule, and the criterion AC3L_Ch10 did not ask for the sentence." .
ex:CR3_Singular rdfs:comment "Disposition set to Accepted on 2026-10-22 in the version that records the ScopeChange ex:SC3_Singular and the items it admits; it was Pending before. The owner's rule of 2026-10-21 is the decision."@en .

