ex:TK_SecLinks_Ch10_Consolidate backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC3L_Ch10_Singular ; backlog:hasEvidence ex:Ev5C_stage4_Ch10, ex:Ev5C_research_Ch10, ex:Ev5C_seclinks_Ch10, ex:Ev5C_annotated_Ch10, ex:Ev5C_linkdisc_Ch10, ex:Ev5C_kindrule_Ch10, ex:Ev5C_singular_Ch10, ex:Ev5C_samepairs_Ch10, ex:Ev3C_File_7713340027, ex:Ev3C_File_d56336e218, ex:Ev3C_File_6a7bc6ad11, ex:Ev3C_File_f75e2eb7a9, ex:Ev3C_File_560ddd8118, ex:Ev3C_File_8488ef6b8e, ex:Ev3C_File_a3c74e2072, ex:Ev3C_File_f8c2394189, ex:Ev3C_File_2147a7d8bb, ex:Ev3C_File_6767434170, ex:Ev3C_File_cc95e9b05a, ex:Ev3C_File_c16a6b4376, ex:Ev3C_File_8fae8511f8, ex:Ev3C_File_df5d2e2f7e, ex:Ev3C_File_4723180eaa ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done, recorded 2026-10-22: delivered by the executor session SEN0401-I15-consolidate-ch10 (commit a8c8f29); control run on the evidence bridge, serial, logs in 08-tooling/verify/iter15/ch10. Results as printed: Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 (current validator v1.13.0): verified -> OVERALL: PASS; chapter check Research v1_3_0 (pinned validator v1.6.0): verified -> RESULT Research/Ch10: PASS; section links declared, between sections, every section covered (sen0401_ch_seclinks_check v1_0_0): verified -> RESULT: PASS; every link annotated with the sentence that states it (sen0401_ch_seclinks_check v1_0_0 --evidence): verified -> RESULT: PASS; OE link discovery v1_1_0 (BP-D57, BP-D61 duplicate family): 0 beyond the baseline: verified -> VERDICT: PASS; OE kind rule check v1_1_0 (BP-D58, BP-D59): verified -> VERDICT: PASS; one property per category and super-property (floor of BP-D61), sen0401_lineage_research_check v1_0_0: verified -> RESULT: PASS (a measurable floor of BP-D61: one property per category and super-property; two properties in one group are one meaning unless they differ in cate; the 28 link pairs of research v1.1.0 are still stated, sen0401_lineage_research_check v1_0_0: verified -> RESULT: PASS. JUDGMENT CALLS the executor flagged, recorded as facts: (1) the property 'precedes' of BFO is no longer reused, because the fifth 'comes before' link joins dated examples, not occurrents, so the reuse would not be true; dcterms requires, replaces and isPartOf are kept as super-properties; (2) the former shortensBlockRace ('is a means to shorten the race of') is merged into isMeansAgainst (category Intentional), so one property now covers the means against an attack and the means against a block race; (3) the former isBaseOfConnectionType is merged into isReasonFor (category Causal). Not decided by a check: the OE link discovery (v1_1_0, repo-tooling v1.78.0, OE v2.33.0, family duplicate) reports 0 beyond the baseline on the new T-Box, but it finds only word-for-word definitions, shared labels and declared matches; the floor check singular reports 9 properties in 9 groups. The OE kind rule check passes vacuously: every domain and range of the new properties is owl:Thing (as in chapter 11), so 0 ends are measured; it is reported as printed and not claimed as a kind check. Result: 26 properties of v1.1.0 consolidated into 9 for the same 28 links, each annotated with its sentence." .
ex:AC3L_Ch10_Singular backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-22 (record v0.169.0), research v1.2.0 of chapter 10: elements run by the bridge: Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 (current validator v1.13.0): verified -> OVERALL: PASS; chapter check Research v1_3_0 (pinned validator v1.6.0): verified -> RESULT Research/Ch10: PASS; section links declared, between sections, every section covered (sen0401_ch_seclinks_check v1_0_0): verified -> RESULT: PASS; every link annotated with the sentence that states it (sen0401_ch_seclinks_check v1_0_0 --evidence): verified -> RESULT: PASS; OE link discovery v1_1_0 (BP-D57, BP-D61 duplicate family): 0 beyond the baseline: verified -> VERDICT: PASS; OE kind rule check v1_1_0 (BP-D58, BP-D59): verified -> VERDICT: PASS; one property per category and super-property (floor of BP-D61), sen0401_lineage_research_check v1_0_0: verified -> RESULT: PASS (a measurable floor of BP-D61: one property per category and super-property; two properties in one group are one meaning unless they differ in cate; the 28 link pairs of research v1.1.0 are still stated, sen0401_lineage_research_check v1_0_0: verified -> RESULT: PASS. RESULT: MET, every element passes as printed. JUDGMENT CALLS the executor flagged, recorded as facts: (1) the property 'precedes' of BFO is no longer reused, because the fifth 'comes before' link joins dated examples, not occurrents, so the reuse would not be true; dcterms requires, replaces and isPartOf are kept as super-properties; (2) the former shortensBlockRace ('is a means to shorten the race of') is merged into isMeansAgainst (category Intentional), so one property now covers the means against an attack and the means against a block race; (3) the former isBaseOfConnectionType is merged into isReasonFor (category Causal). Not decided by a check: the OE link discovery (v1_1_0, repo-tooling v1.78.0, OE v2.33.0, family duplicate) reports 0 beyond the baseline on the new T-Box, but it finds only word-for-word definitions, shared labels and declared matches; the floor check singular reports 9 properties in 9 groups. The OE kind rule check passes vacuously: every domain and range of the new properties is owl:Thing (as in chapter 11), so 0 ends are measured; it is reported as printed and not claimed as a kind check. Result: 26 properties of v1.1.0 consolidated into 9 for the same 28 links, each annotated with its sentence." .
