5.0 counts against the stored result of page 9.77.0: verified -> 9_35_0 final run: widgets (86, 86), features 185, gates 6, skipped 0 | stored test_results_abox_v9_77_0.json: widgets 86, features 184, gates 6, skipped 2; Stage 4 page ABox and stored page-test result exist as new files for page 9.78.0: NOT verified -> Stage 4 page ABox 03-materials/ch10/page/sen0401_ch10_page_abox_v9_78_0.ttl: False | stored page-test result 08-tooling/ch10-page/test_results_abox_v9_78_0.json: False] | (5) nothing changed: MET [no committed file edited by the executor (every file of its commits added): verified -> commits a52911a: 8 file(s) added, 0 changed or removed []]. RESULT: NOT MET: element(s) (3) gates, (4) AC3T elements; by its own text, if any element fails the chapter is named failing and this criterion has no passing result; nothing is waived and the criterion is not edited. Facts measured by this control (page 9.78.0, template 9.51.0, tests 9.34.0 and 9.35.0, one run each, 366 passed and 4 failed in each: two distinct features, each reported twice): (A) the feature 'the ERD's sections choice draws one entity per section with the mentioned-together relationships on by default (the toggle removes them)' fails: sections 17, relations 23 -> 23 with mentions off; the page has 0 'mentions' relations because the new links are all 'operates on'-type links stated in the research, and the test requires the mentions toggle to remove at least one relation; (B) the feature 'relocate on the concept map ... Untangle leaves no two boxes overlapping' fails: 24 boxes, 2 overlap; the ERD label features themselves run and PASS (labels shown 23 -> 23, overlaps 0/0)." .
