    backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-22: NOT Done. Delivered by the executor session SEN0401-I14-page-ch11 (commits 7aaba8d, 2de9dcf). The checks and their results are those of the evidence nodes and the note of AC3L_Ch11; failing checks are recorded evidenceVerified false. Facts measured by this control (page 9.78.0, template 9.51.0, tests 9.34.0 and 9.35.0, one run each): both runs stopped before their end with a click timeout ('HeaderFields intercepts pointer events': the SVG rect of the box HeaderFields sits over the element the test clicks), 161 features passed and 1 failed, widgets not reported; the feature (A) 'the ERD's sections choice ... mentioned-together relationships on by default' fails: sections 16, relations 32 -> 32 with mentions off, 0 'mentions' relations; the filled-ERD label feature PASSES (32 labels, 0 overlapping pairs); the on-choice labels feature was NOT reached in these runs. The executor's earlier run crashed the same way, so the crash is seen in three runs of three; the executor's force-click diagnostic (kept as a log, not a result) reported the same two failing features as chapter 10, including 4 of 22 boxes overlapping after Untangle; that overlap count is the executor's, not measured by this control. The first run of each test is the only run: a [FAIL] line is a result, not a budget failure, so no re-run was due." .
