ex:TK_SecLinks_Ch10_Page backlog:hasAuditNote "Plan 2026-10-22 (change request ex:CR3_PageGates, owner's answer \"Yes, proceed.\"): this task is Suspended since v0.173 and is not begun again until TK_PageGates_Template, TK_PageGates_Test and TK_PageGates_Regression are Done; when it resumes (T_Resume, with a new executor and a new brief) it rebuilds the page as a new page version 9.79.0 on the template 9.51.1 and runs the tests 9.34.1 and 9.35.1, and its criterion is ex:AC3L2_Ch10. The text above that says 'unchanged tests' and 'template 9.51.0' is the text of the earlier plan and is read with these versions; a click-force workaround is never part of a result." .
