ex:AC3L_Ch10 backlog:hasAuditNote "Note 2026-10-22: replaced in ST_Section_Links by ex:AC3L2_Ch10 by the owner's decision on ex:CR3_PageGates (the tests named 'unchanged' here are changed by a new version, which the owner approved). This criterion is not edited. Its recorded result at v0.173 stays: NOT MET on page 9.78.0 (elements as printed there). It is history; the story no longer points to it." .
ex:AC3T_Ch10 backlog:hasAuditNote "Note 2026-10-22: element 4 names the page tests 9.34.0 and 9.35.0. After the owner's decision on ex:CR3_PageGates (\"Yes, proceed.\") it is measured with the new test versions 9.34.1 and 9.35.1, which differ from the old only in the one named assertion (proved by ex:AC3P_Test) and give the stored result on every shipped page (ex:AC3P_Regression). If that proof fails, the element stays NOT MET. The criterion is not edited." .
