ex:Iter_16 a backlog:Iteration ; rdfs:label "Iteration 16: a new page template version and new page test versions, measured against the shipped pages"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "Iter_16" ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:iterationStart "2026-10-22T06:33:19"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:iterationEnd "2026-10-23T23:59:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDurationSource "Proposed by the builder session on 2026-10-22: the start is the instant of the planning ceremony ex:PC3_Iter_16; the proposed end is Friday 2026-10-23 06:00 UTC (09:00 Istanbul), the same end as ex:Iter_15. Justification: the critical path of this iteration is the template task and the test task in parallel (each one to two hours with its own scratch runs), then the regression task: 14 shipped pages and 4 rebuilt pages, about 18 page-test runs at nine minutes, serially about 3 hours, plus the builder's control of each task and the bridge runs; about 8 to 10 hours of machine time in all, so the work started in the morning of 2026-10-22 ends the same day if nothing fails; 24 hours leave the margin for one repeat of a task. The tasks T4 to T6 (pages of chapters 10 and 11 and their Verify) follow in ex:Iter_14 (end 2026-10-24 06:00 UTC). The end is the owner's to decide; the plan stands whatever end he chooses." ;
    backlog:hasSprintGoal "The new page template version 9.51.1 and the new page test versions 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 exist as new files with the old ones kept and byte-identical, differ from them only in the named parts, and give every shipped page the result its stored result has, and the pages of chapters 1, 8, 12 and 14 rebuilt on the new template an equal or better one, on the gates as they stand otherwise, each unit that fails named; then the pages of chapters 10 and 11 are rebuilt on them in ex:Iter_14. Frozen at the planning ceremony." ;
    backlog:hasMember ex:ST_Page_Gates, ex:TK_PageGates_Template, ex:TK_PageGates_Test, ex:TK_PageGates_Regression .
