ex:SC3_PageGates a backlog:ScopeChange ;
    rdfs:label "Scope grown by a new page template version and new page test versions"@en ;
    backlog:fulfillsRequest ex:CR3_PageGates ; backlog:changesScope ex:Scope3 ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:admitsItem ex:ST_Page_Gates ;
    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "Owner's answer of Thursday 2026-10-22 08:35 Istanbul (05:35 UTC), as relayed by the course coordinator; the time at which the owner wrote it is not known to the builder session to the question of ex:CR3_PageGates (Do you approve building a new page template version and a new page-test version as NEW files (the old ones kept for comparison), so that the section-link pages of chapters 10 and 11 can be rebuilt and measured: the template with an Untangle fix for dense section edges, and the test with the 'mentioned-together relations' assertion applying only to a page that has such relations (yes or no)?), relayed by the course coordinator and recorded by the builder session, quoted: \"Yes, proceed.\" This is option A of the request. Under the standing rule that work following the owner's direction is recorded as owner-directed, it is not listed as an open owner confirmation. The boundary moved outward by one story; the exclusion of any change to a gate or a test is lifted for exactly the two named changes, as new files beside the old ones, measured against the stored results of the shipped pages." .
ex:CR3_PageGates rdfs:comment "Disposition set to Accepted on 2026-10-22 in the version that records the ScopeChange ex:SC3_PageGates and the story it admits; it was Pending before. Accepted for option A by the owner's answer of Thursday 2026-10-22 08:35 Istanbul (05:35 UTC), as relayed by the course coordinator; the time at which the owner wrote it is not known to the builder session."@en .
ex:Iter_14 backlog:containerDependsOn ex:Iter_16 ; backlog:derivedContainerDependency ex:Iter_16 .

