    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK_Remedy_Page_Ch05_Build ;
    backlog:notYetScoreable true ; backlog:hasScoreabilityReason "Ranked by its story's state; scoring both would double-count." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Re-run serially the page tests 9.36.0, 9.34.1 and 9.35.1, the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0, the Research, Deck and Page chapter checks, the deck match check, the link check and the manifest equality (the chapter-code tab equals the deck's code order); record every result as printed. Planned session builder; estimated start T0+8.5h after the executors begin, about 1.0 hours (an estimate, G120: nobody has witnessed a start; the real start is recorded at work begun)." .

