 playground list items have data-pg-item and show names only; a page that follows the standard declares <meta name=\"page-standard\" content=\"9.52\">. A committed file is never edited: every output is a new file with a new version number. STOP and report if the task cannot be satisfied without editing a committed file, a gate, a test or a threshold beyond the named new files. Report every result as printed (PASS, FAIL, NOT_MEASURED, CANNOT_RUN); a skip is not a pass. The machine has 2 cores: browser tests run one at a time and no build runs beside them. Planned session SEN0401-I17-page-ch06; estimated start T0+6.0h after the executors begin, about 3.0 hours (an estimate, G120: nobody has witnessed a start; the real start is recorded at work begun)." .

