ex:CR3_DeckCh06Slide51 a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "The subsidy chart on slide 51 of the chapter 6 deck has crowded data labels: may a new deck version fix it?"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Remedy56, ex:AC4R_Deck_Ch06 ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "Found by the builder session's rendered review of deck v2_1_0 of chapter 6 (control of TK_Remedy_Deck_Ch06_Build, register v0.198.0), 2026-10-22. FACT (seen in the soffice render of slide 51 'The subsidy, halving by halving'): the native chart's data labels of the five smallest bars at the right end (the subsidies after the fourth halving, values 3.125 down to 0.195...) overlap each other and cannot be read. The deck standard check, the overlap scan and the Deck chapter check do not measure chart label collisions, so all of them pass; no element D1 to D12 fails, so AC4R_Deck_Ch06 stays MET and this is a finding outside the criterion, not a failure of it. The coordinator (relaying the owner) decides: yes means a deck v2_2_0 as a new file by the deck executor with the labels fixed (for example fewer decimals or labels only on the first bars) and a control; no means the slide stays as it is. Disposition Pending." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Pending .
ex:IA3_DeckCh06Slide51 a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "What fixing the slide 51 chart labels costs, measured before any decision"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR3_DeckCh06Slide51 ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage3 ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:IA3_Remedy56 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "Affected if yes: the deck of chapter 6 (a new file v2_2_0, not an edit of v2_1_0, G125), its chapter-code manifest only if a code example changes (none does), TK_Remedy_Page_Ch06_Build only if the page's lecture export is taken from the new deck (the page task starts from deck v2_1_0 unless the coordinator says otherwise), and a new Build and Verify pair for the deck (about one hour of executor time and 0.5 hours of control) under a Scope-stage revision (G127). Not affected: AC4R_Deck_Ch06 and the Done state of TK_Remedy_Deck_Ch06_Build and TK_Remedy_Deck_Ch06_Verify (their evidence and note stay), the chapter 5 work, the template, the page test, the Mission outcome and the Achieved status. Cost of no: none; the finding stays recorded. The builder session proposes nothing here: the coordinator decides." .

