 (page test and manifest check): MET [page test 9.36.0: the added features P1 P2 P3 P4 P5 P6 P8 P9 P11 all PASS, none : verified -> 9.36.0 added features: 12 PASS lines of 12, FAIL/other {}, SKIP 0; the chapter-code manifest equals the order of the deck's code slides (names uniq: verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch06_v1_1_0.json | 18 examples | 18 code slides | deck SEN0401_Ch06_Transactions_3e_v2_1_0.pptx | PASS order equals code-slide order, names unique, library files exist, hashes match where stated] | (4) Stage 4 runner, Research/Deck/Page chapter checks, deck match: MET [Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 (current validator v1.13.0): verified -> OVERALL: PASS; chapter check Research v1_3_0 (pinned validator v1.6.0): verified -> RESULT Research/Ch06: PASS; chapter check Deck: verified -> deck: 03-materials/ch06/SEN0401_Ch06_Transactions_3e_v2_1_0.pptx deck check: deck_check_v1_0_0.py deck_notes_check 1.0.0: 62 slides, 62 with notes written for the reader RESULT Deck/Ch06: PASS; chapter check Page: verified -> page test: sen0401_page_test_v9_36_0.py on page version 9_81_0 page 06: exit 0, widgets ('121', '121'), features passed 398, failed 0, release step with a TEST key RESULT: PASS RESULT Page/Ch06: PASS; deck match check: 0 not carried: verified -> chapter 06 page 9_81_0: 18 items compared with lecture_v1_3_0.json and sen0401_ch06_stories_v1_2_0; not carried: 0] | (5) no committed file edited; ABox and stored result new files: MET [no committed file is edited (every file of the executor's commits added): verified -> commits faf1b10,ce46520,426b295,ca2e510: 25 file(s) added, 0 modified or removed []; the Stage 4 page ABox and the stored page-test result are new files: verified -> Stage 4 page ABox 03-materials/ch06/page/sen0401_ch06_page_abox_v9_81_0.ttl: True | stored page-test result 08-tooling/ch06-page/test_results_abox_v9_81_0.json: True]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. The page tests 9.36.0, 9.35.1 and 9.34.1 were RUN by the builder session on this page, serially, on 2026-10-23 (logs in 08-tooling/verify/iter17/pages), not read from the executor's logs. The link check pages_link_verify_v1_0_0 compares the page with the OLD deck's link register (ch06-deck/link_register_v1_0_0.json); it prints entries the rebuilt deck no longer lists, so it is a stale measure and is not an element of the criterion; its output, as printed, is in the log pages_bridge and in the note of the Verify task." .
