ex:Iter_18 a backlog:Iteration ; rdfs:label "Iteration 18: the story chip repair, template 9.52.1 and the chapter 5 and 6 pages rebuilt"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "Iter_18" ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:iterationStart "2026-10-23T01:21:38"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:iterationEnd "2026-10-23T23:59:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDurationSource "Proposed by the builder session on 2026-10-23: the start is the instant of the planning ceremony ex:PC3_Iter_18; the proposed end is Friday 2026-10-23 09:00 UTC (12:00 Istanbul); the owner decides the end. Justification (estimates, not measurements): the template change is one handler (about 1 h with scratch proof runs), its verification about 0.7 h; the two page rebuilds follow in parallel (about 2 h each with three serial page-test runs each, on 2 cores), their verification about 1 h each, serial. Critical path: template 1.0 h + verification 0.7 h + page 2.0 h + verification 1.0 h = about 4.7 h after the template executor starts; chapter 6 about 0.5 h later. The page of chapter 6 can be declined without blocking chapter 5." ;
    backlog:hasSprintGoal "The story chip of the chapter 5 and 6 pages brings its story into view on a new template 9.52.1, and both pages are rebuilt on it and pass the three page tests, verified by the evidence bridge; the new template and the rebuilt pages are new files and nothing existing is edited. Frozen at the planning ceremony." ;
