    backlog:iterationStart "2026-10-23T09:14:21"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:iterationEnd "2026-10-23T23:59:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDurationSource "Proposed by the builder session on 2026-10-23: the start is the instant of the planning ceremony ex:PC3_Iter_19; the proposed end is Friday 2026-10-23 23:59 UTC; the owner decides the end. Justification (estimates, not measurements): the template change is one moved tag (about 0.5 h with a scratch proof run) and the check is a small tool (about 0.5 h), in parallel, each verified in about 0.5 h; the two page rebuilds follow in parallel (about 1.5 h each with three serial page-test runs each, on 2 cores), their verification about 1 h each, serial. Critical path: 0.5 h + 0.5 h verification + 1.5 h + 1.0 h = about 3.5 h after the tool executors start; chapter 6 about 0.5 h later. The page of chapter 6 can be declined without blocking chapter 5." ;
    backlog:hasSprintGoal "The character set of the chapter 5 and 6 pages is declared within the first 1024 bytes on a new template 9.52.2, measured by a new check, and both pages are rebuilt on it and pass the check and the three page tests, verified by the evidence bridge; the new template and the rebuilt pages are new files and nothing existing is edited. Frozen at the planning ceremony." ;
