s UTF-8'; tag 1 time(s) at byte 37; page test 9.36.0 exit ['0'], widgets ('113] | (5) no committed file edited: MET [the executor's two commits add files only, no committed file edited: verified -> PASS commits fc7f78a,3652227: 8 file(s) added, 0 modified or removed []]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. The checks were run by the builder: the page charset check on the template, the comparison of the two templates, a scratch page of chapter 5 built on 9.52.2 and page test 9.36.0 (run twice: the first run had 1 failed feature line, the main-thread budget after load, 211 ms against 200, while a register validator and another session's page test were running on the same two cores; the second run, with the validator finished, passed 398 features with 0 failed; both logs are kept and the run that is read by the bridge is the second); the executor's own logs are kept as its own evidence." .
