    backlog:hasScoreValue "0.64"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:scoredAt "2026-10-23T11:10:32"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:isAveragedFromMembers false ;
    backlog:hasScoreRationale "RICE with dependency factor (BP-D10): score = Reach x Impact x Confidence / Effort = 1 x 2 x 0.8 / 2.5 = 0.64; the dependency factor 1 is recorded beside it and the ORDERING KEY is the score times the dependency factor = 0.64. Reach 1 page. Impact 2 (high): the owner uses this page in class and sees garbled labels. Confidence 0.8. Effort 2.5 h: 1.5 h executor plus 1.0 h verification. DepFactor 1: its prerequisites (template and check, with their verification) are Done. FACTS: the owner's archive holds 14 chapter pages built on the one template line, each with the charset tag behind byte 1024 (the coordinator's measure); the builder session measured the tag at byte 13578 in the pages 9.82.0 of chapters 5 and 6; the owner reported garbled labels on pages he uses in class (2026-10-23 09:32 Istanbul). Recorded on the owner's instruction 'Repairs should change the priority of the PBIs or the tasks'; a new dated record, no earlier score is edited. Re-run after the completion of TK_Charset_Template and TK_Charset_Template_Verify (BP-D11); the prerequisites of both page rebuilds are now Done, so their dependency factor is 1; the item points to this record, the earlier record stays in the register unedited." .
