ex:Iter_19 rdfs:comment "Ranking of 2026-10-23T11:10:32 (BP-D10, RICE with dependency factor; the scores are the records ex:Rank34_*): 1. Template 9.52.2: the character set declared first (ordering key 25.20); 2. Charset check: measures the declaration on any page (ordering key 12.60); 3. Regression run of the three tools of Iteration 17 (ordering key 1.20); 4. Page of chapter 6 rebuilt on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.64); 5. Page of chapter 5 rebuilt on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.64); 6. Chapter 5 page 9.82.0 task: the remainder is a log file written twice (ordering key 0.27); 7. Chapter 5 page 9.80.0 story of Iteration 17 (superseded) (ordering key 0.20). The executors start in this order: the two repair tools first (they block the page rebuilds and the repair outranks the remaining Iteration 18 items and any new page build), then the page rebuilds when their prerequisites are Done. The inputs are stated in each record; the scale values (impact levels, the dependency factor 0.5) are stipulations of the method's scale and are disclosed as such."@en .

