ex:Scope3 rdfs:comment "Revised 2026-10-23 by the stage revision ex:Revision_Lineage3_Scope8 on the change requests ex:CR3_Ch78 and ex:CR3_Retrofit (Friday 2026-10-23 16:06 Istanbul, relayed by the course coordinator (the owner's decision)). The statement above is unchanged (L-112). It now also requires four deliverables in the area ex:Area3_Remedy56 (the decks and pages of chapters 7 and 8 with a new deck check version; the planned retrofit of the decks and pages of ten more chapters). No exclusion changes: new files only, and the exclusion of changes to gates, tests and thresholds still holds."@en .

