complete, D11 32 of 87 research concepts shown = 36.8 percent); chapter 8 (26 slides, 16 code slides) and chapters 9 to 14 fail D1, D2, D3, D5, D7, D10 and the check returns NOT_MEASURED for D4 and D11 because their research files declare the key concepts as sen0414:PrimarySourceConcept while the check reads sen0401:PrimarySourceConcept (a skip is not a pass). Manifests: only chapters 5 and 6 have a chapter-code manifest. Pages: the charset check v1_0_0 passes the newest pages of chapters 5 and 6 (tag at byte 37) and fails the newest page of every other chapter (tag at byte 11172, or 11888 for chapter 10); the pages of chapters 7 and 8 (9.76.0, 9.77.0) are built on template 9.51.0 and have no chapter-code tab. Research, a deck and a page exist for all fourteen chapters; no chapter is unbuilt. PAGE STANDARD (checked by the new page test 9.36.0, Playwright 1.56.0): P1 no horizontal overflow at 390 px and at 1366 px; P2 the chapter-code tab lists the deck's examples by NAME in the deck's slide order, each runnable in the page with the chapter library defined in the page and its result visualised, and the code lives in the editor, not in the list; P3 tabs and left tree are synchronised and their label sets are disjoint or the tab bar is one row; P4 no third level of tabs, and one more level of panels so that one panel holds one concept; P5 a panel is at most 1.0 screen high at 1366x768; P6 no list repeated on one screen; P7 every diagram has zoom; P8 the top-level menu is uncrowded (at most 8 top-level tabs); P9 a text-size control and an adaptive layout at 390, 768 and 1366 px; P10 executed code results are visualised; P11 the page declares the standard and the examples equal the deck's code manifest." ;
