    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK_Ch78_DeckCheck ;
    backlog:notYetScoreable true ; backlog:hasScoreabilityReason "Ranked by its story's state; scoring both would double-count." ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Re-run on the bridge: v1_0_0 byte-identical; the diff limited to the reading of the concept class; the same results as v1_0_0 on chapters 5, 6 and 7; D4 and D11 measured on chapters 8 to 14 with the concept counts stated; no file edited. Planned session builder; estimated start T0+0.7h (T0 = the first executor start of the iteration), about 0.5 hours (an estimate, G120: nobody has witnessed a start; the real start is recorded at work begun)." .

