hreshold changed; logs kept: MET [the executor's commit adds files only, no committed file edited: verified -> PASS commits cd98fcd: 25 file(s) added, 0 modified or removed []]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. The builder re-ran both versions of the check itself and counted the concepts with its own reader (rdflib), not the executor's. COUNT FIGURE (disclosed reading of element 4): the numbers 46, 38, 62, 43, 43, 29, 69 are the DECLARATIONS of the class in the newest research files (the builder counted exactly these); the check, as v1_0_0 defines it and as element 3 pins for chapters 5 to 7, de-duplicates by normalised label, so D4 and D11 are measured over 45, 36, 56, 41, 41, 25, 61 key concepts (real equals are one concept with several labels, the owner's standing rule of 2026-10-21). The figure that applies to the criterion of a deck build is the de-duplicated one; no element, gate, test or threshold was waived or changed." .
