    backlog:hasScoreRationale "RICE with dependency factor (BP-D10): score = Reach x Impact x Confidence / Effort = 14 x 2 x 0.9 / 1.0 = 25.20; the dependency factor 1 is recorded beside it and the ORDERING KEY is the score times the dependency factor = 25.20. Reach 14 pages: every later build and all 14 archived chapters take the template line. Impact 2 (high): it removes the cause of the garbled labels the owner reported. Confidence 0.9: the cause is measured on file bytes. Effort 1.0 h: executor 0.5 h plus builder verification 0.5 h (task estimates). DepFactor 1: no prerequisite. FACTS: the owner's archive holds 14 chapter pages built on the one template line, each with the charset tag behind byte 1024 (the coordinator's measure); the builder session measured the tag at byte 13578 in the pages 9.82.0 of chapters 5 and 6; the owner reported garbled labels on pages he uses in class (2026-10-23 09:32 Istanbul). Recorded on the owner's instruction 'Repairs should change the priority of the PBIs or the tasks'; a new dated record, no earlier score is edited. Re-run after the completion of the control of the deck standard check v1_1_0 (BP-D11 L3)." .
