ter 10 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 28. Retrofit: page of chapter 9 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 29. Retrofit: page of chapter 4 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 30. Retrofit: page of chapter 3 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 31. Retrofit: page of chapter 2 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 32. Retrofit: page of chapter 1 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16). The urgent items (impact 3, the owner's priority input of 2026-10-23 16:06) rank ahead of the retrofit; pages carry the dependency factor 0.5 until their deck is Done. The inputs are stated in each record; the scale values (impact levels, the dependency factor 0.5) are stipulations of the method's scale and are disclosed as such."@en .

