ex:Iter_20 rdfs:comment "Ranking of 2026-10-24T08:20:29 (BP-D10, RICE with dependency factor; the scores are the records ex:Rank38_*): 1. Template 9.52.2: the character set declared first (ordering key 25.20); 2. Deck standard check for the research of chapters 8 to 14 (ordering key 16.80); 3. Charset check: measures the declaration on any page (ordering key 12.60); 4. Regression run of the three tools of Iteration 17 (ordering key 1.20); 5. Deck and chapter-code manifest of chapter 8 (ordering key 1.20); 6. Deck and chapter-code manifest of chapter 7 (ordering key 1.20); 7. Page of chapter 8 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.48); 8. Page of chapter 7 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.48); 9. Retrofit: deck and manifest of chapter 4 (ordering key 0.40); 10. Retrofit: deck and manifest of chapter 3 (ordering key 0.40); 11. Retrofit: deck and manifest of chapter 2 (ordering key 0.40); 12. Retrofit: deck and manifest of chapter 1 (ordering key 0.40); 13. Page of chapter 6 rebuilt on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.32); 14. Page of chapter 5 rebuilt on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.32); 15. Chapter 5 page 9.82.0 task: the remainder is a log file written twice (ordering key 0.27); 16. Chapter 5 page 9.80.0 story of Iteration 17 (superseded) (ordering key 0.20); 17. Retrofit: deck and manifest of chapter 14 (ordering key 0.20); 18. Retrofit: deck and manifest of chapter 13 (ordering key 0.20); 19. Retrofit: deck and manifest of chapter 12 (ordering key 0.20); 20. Retrofit: deck and manifest of chapter 11 (ordering key 0.20); 21. Retrofit: deck and manifest of chapter 10 (ordering key 0.20); 22. Retrofit: deck and manifest of chapter 9 (ordering key 0.20); 23. Retrofit: page of chapter 14 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 24. Retrofit: page of chapter 13 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 25. Retrofit: page of chapter 12 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 26. Retrofit: page of chapter 11 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 27. Retrofit: page of chapter 10 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 28. Retrofit: page of chapter 9 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 29. Retrofit: page of chapter 4 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 30. Retrofit: page of chapter 3 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 31. Retrofit: page of chapter 2 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16); 32. Retrofit: page of chapter 1 on template 9.52.2 (ordering key 0.16). The urgent items (impact 3, the owner's priority input of 2026-10-23 16:06) rank ahead of the retrofit; pages carry the dependency factor 0.5 until their deck is Done. The inputs are stated in each record; the scale values (impact levels, the dependency factor 0.5) are stipulations of the method's scale and are disclosed as such."@en .

ex:CR3_Repair20 a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "Three repairs found by the controls of 2026-10-24: the deck of chapter 7 re-issued, the page test 9.37.0, and the remainder of the section-links story split off"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ;
    rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Ch78 ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "Ordered Saturday 2026-10-24, the course coordinator's order after the controls of the same day (v0.244.0) and the owner's rule that repairs re-rank the open items. MEASURED (control of 2026-10-24, register v0.244.0, logs in 08-tooling/verify/iter20/deck_ch07_bridge): the deck of chapter 7 v2_0_0 (61 slides, 15 examples, executor commits ed03d15 and 27d36a5): deck standard check D1 to D12 PASS=12 FAIL=0, overlap check clean, Deck chapter check PASS, manifest equals the 15 code slides, deck match check 0 not carried, every slide viewed zoomed; the element 'no committed file edited' is NOT MET: the commit 27d36a5 modified in place four files that the commit ed03d15 had added (03-materials/ch07/SEN0401_Ch07_AuthorizationAuthentication_3e_v2_0_0.pptx, 08-tooling/ch07-deck/deck_build_v2_0_0.py, deck_plan_v2_0_0.json, sen0401_ch07_deck_v2_0_0.pptx; the nochange check prints status M for each). MEASURED (executor SEN0401-I20-page-ch08, commits 75e0a47 and 0e34361; builder's root-cause analysis 2026-10-24): the page 9.85.0 of chapter 8 fails the page test 9.36.0 on feature P2 only: examples 17 and 18 are judged 'result is text, not a visualisation'; the page tests 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 pass. ROOT CAUSE: the test waits for the result element to hold any non-empty text, the template 9.52.2 writes the placeholder 'Running...' into that element when an example starts, so the wait ends at once; the test then waits 300 ms and reads. Examples that take longer than about 0.3 s (17: 0.7 s, 18: 1.3 s on the machine) are read while the placeholder is still shown. The diagnostic log 08-tooling/ch08-page/iter20_logs/ch08_9_85_0_diag_p2_timing.log shows that both examples do show a visual when they finish. The pages of chapters 5 and 6 pass because all their examples finish within 0.3 s (one chapter 5 run failed once under load); the SEN0414 page test carries the same code. CHOICE by rule and fact: the template placeholder is correct behaviour for a reader and lighter example code would change the teaching content to suit the test; a defective gate is repaired by a new test file (the precedent of 9.34.1 and 9.35.1), so a new test file 9.37.0 is made. It enters no criterion until the owner answers the question that is asked. MEASURED: Iteration 14 ended at 2026-10-24T06:00 UTC; the story ST_Section_Links is open in it (chapter 10 delivered; TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Page Suspended since 2026-10-22, TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Verify Proposed), so the validator reports L4 on it ('split the remainder into a story that fits the next iteration'). The chapter 11 page is rebuilt anyway by TK_Ch11_Page_Build of Iteration 21 on template 9.52.2, which contains the section-link ERD, so the remainder is a Verify task that waits for that page. The change grows the scope by one deliverable: three repairs, all new files; nothing existing is edited. Pending until the ScopeChange that admits the stories is recorded in the Backlog version." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .

ex:IA3_Repair20 a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "What the three repairs cost and what they unblock, measured before they are started"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR3_Repair20 ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage3 ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:IA3_Ch78 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "MEASURED (control of 2026-10-24, register v0.244.0, logs in 08-tooling/verify/iter20/deck_ch07_bridge): the deck of chapter 7 v2_0_0 (61 slides, 15 examples, executor commits ed03d15 and 27d36a5): deck standard check D1 to D12 PASS=12 FAIL=0, overlap check clean, Deck chapter check PASS, manifest equals the 15 code slides, deck match check 0 not carried, every slide viewed zoomed; the element 'no committed file edited' is NOT MET: the commit 27d36a5 modified in place four files that the commit ed03d15 had added (03-materials/ch07/SEN0401_Ch07_AuthorizationAuthentication_3e_v2_0_0.pptx, 08-tooling/ch07-deck/deck_build_v2_0_0.py, deck_plan_v2_0_0.json, sen0401_ch07_deck_v2_0_0.pptx; the nochange check prints status M for each). MEASURED (executor SEN0401-I20-page-ch08, commits 75e0a47 and 0e34361; builder's root-cause analysis 2026-10-24): the page 9.85.0 of chapter 8 fails the page test 9.36.0 on feature P2 only: examples 17 and 18 are judged 'result is text, not a visualisation'; the page tests 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 pass. ROOT CAUSE: the test waits for the result element to hold any non-empty text, the template 9.52.2 writes the placeholder 'Running...' into that element when an example starts, so the wait ends at once; the test then waits 300 ms and reads. Examples that take longer than about 0.3 s (17: 0.7 s, 18: 1.3 s on the machine) are read while the placeholder is still shown. The diagnostic log 08-tooling/ch08-page/iter20_logs/ch08_9_85_0_diag_p2_timing.log shows that both examples do show a visual when they finish. The pages of chapters 5 and 6 pass because all their examples finish within 0.3 s (one chapter 5 run failed once under load); the SEN0414 page test carries the same code. CHOICE by rule and fact: the template placeholder is correct behaviour for a reader and lighter example code would change the teaching content to suit the test; a defective gate is repaired by a new test file (the precedent of 9.34.1 and 9.35.1), so a new test file 9.37.0 is made. It enters no criterion until the owner answers the question that is asked. MEASURED: Iteration 14 ended at 2026-10-24T06:00 UTC; the story ST_Section_Links is open in it (chapter 10 delivered; TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Page Suspended since 2026-10-22, TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Verify Proposed), so the validator reports L4 on it ('split the remainder into a story that fits the next iteration'). The chapter 11 page is rebuilt anyway by TK_Ch11_Page_Build of Iteration 21 on template 9.52.2, which contains the section-link ERD, so the remainder is a Verify task that waits for that page. AFFECTED: ST_Ch07_Deck (its Build task is Suspended, its Verify task withdrawn; its criterion stays unmet and unchanged; the story stays open for the owner's answer on superseded stories), TK_Ch07_Page_Build (now depends on the re-issued deck's Verify task), ST_Ch08_Page (its criterion measures with 9.36.0, which fails; unchanged until the owner answers whether 9.37.0 may be used), ST_Section_Links (closed by a review after its remainder is split). NOT AFFECTED: the template, the builders, tests 9.34.1, 9.35.1, 9.36.0 (new file only), every other deck and page, the Mission outcome and the Achieved status. PLAN (route as ex:CR3_Ch78, G127): a StageRevision from the Scope stage, seven versions; then one version for the withdrawals, one for the ranking (repairs first, BP-D10), one for work begun. New iteration Iter_22 (start at planning, proposed end Sunday 2026-10-25 09:00 UTC, the owner's to decide) with two stories and four tasks (the deck re-issue about 1.0 h executor and 0.5 h verification, the test 9.37.0 about 1.0 h executor and 1.0 h verification with serial browser runs); one story and one Verify task in Iter_21. COST: new files only; a failing criterion is named failing; nothing is waived. ORDER: repairs rank ahead of the page of chapter 7 (repair 9.37.0 first for the pages; the criterion of the pages uses 9.36.0 until the owner answers)." .

