oad); the SEN0414 page test carries the same code. CHOICE by rule and fact: the template placeholder is correct behaviour for a reader and lighter example code would change the teaching content to suit the test; a defective gate is repaired by a new test file (the precedent of 9.34.1 and 9.35.1), so a new test file 9.37.0 is made. It enters no criterion until the owner answers the question that is asked. MEASURED: Iteration 14 ended at 2026-10-24T06:00 UTC; the story ST_Section_Links is open in it (chapter 10 delivered; TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Page Suspended since 2026-10-22, TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Verify Proposed), so the validator reports L4 on it ('split the remainder into a story that fits the next iteration'). The chapter 11 page is rebuilt anyway by TK_Ch11_Page_Build of Iteration 21 on template 9.52.2, which contains the section-link ERD, so the remainder is a Verify task that waits for that page." ;
