    backlog:hasGoalRationale "Derived from the revised scope and the change request ex:CR3_Repair20: the controls of 2026-10-24 found a deck whose files were edited in place, a page test that reads a placeholder as a result, and a story whose iteration ended. MEASURED (control of 2026-10-24, register v0.244.0, logs in 08-tooling/verify/iter20/deck_ch07_bridge): the deck of chapter 7 v2_0_0 (61 slides, 15 examples, executor commits ed03d15 and 27d36a5): deck standard check D1 to D12 PASS=12 FAIL=0, overlap check clean, Deck chapter check PASS, manifest equals the 15 code slides, deck match check 0 not carried, every slide viewed zoomed; the element 'no committed file edited' is NOT MET: the commit 27d36a5 modified in place four files that the commit ed03d15 had added (03-materials/ch07/SEN0401_Ch07_AuthorizationAuthentication_3e_v2_0_0.pptx, 08-tooling/ch07-deck/deck_build_v2_0_0.py, deck_plan_v2_0_0.json, sen0401_ch07_deck_v2_0_0.pptx; the nochange check prints status M for each). MEASURED (executor SEN0401-I20-page-ch08, commits 75e0a47 and 0e34361; builder's root-cause analysis 2026-10-24): the page 9.85.0 of chapter 8 fails the page test 9.36.0 on feature P2 only: examples 17 and 18 are judged 'result is text, not a visualisation'; the page tests 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 pass. ROOT CAUSE: the test waits for the result element to hold any non-empty text, the template 9.52.2 writes the placeholder 'Running...' into that element when an example starts, so the wait ends at once; the test then waits 300 ms and reads. Examples that take longer than about 0.3 s (17: 0.7 s, 18: 1.3 s on the machine) are read while the placeholder is still shown. The diagnostic log 08-tooling/ch08-page/iter20_logs/ch08_9_85_0_diag_p2_timing.log shows that both examples do show a visual when they finish. The pages of chapters 5 and 6 pass because all their examples finish within 0.3 s (one chapter 5 run failed once under load); the SEN0414 page test carries the same code. CHOICE by rule and fact: the template placeholder is correct behaviour for a reader and lighter example code would change the teaching content to suit the test; a defective gate is repaired by a new test file (the precedent of 9.34.1 and 9.35.1), so a new test file 9.37.0 is made. It enters no criterion until the owner answers the question that is asked." ;
    backlog:producedByStage ex:Out3_GoalR10 .
