ex:AC7R_PageTest937 a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The page test 9.37.0 waits for the end of a chapter-code example, fails a text-only result and leaves 9.36.0 unchanged"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Owner-directed work (ex:CR3_Repair20, Saturday 2026-10-24, the course coordinator's order after the controls of the same day (v0.244.0) and the owner's rule that repairs re-rank the open items). Given the page test 9.36.0 (byte-identical after the task) and the template 9.52.2, when the NEW file 08-tooling/sen0401_page_test_v9_37_0.py is written from sen0401_page_test_v9_36_0.py, changing ONLY the P2 wait: after a chapter-code example is run the test waits until the result element no longer shows the placeholder 'Running...' (and holds text or a visual), within the bound that the wait has today (90 s per example), then ALL of: (1) the file is new and v9_36_0 is byte-identical (SHA-256 before and after); (2) the unified diff against 9.36.0 is limited to that wait (and the version strings); every other feature, threshold and message is unchanged; (3) FIXTURES, built by the executor as new files in 08-tooling/page-test-937-fixtures/ and re-run by the builder on the bridge: (a) a page whose example takes 1.5 s and then shows a visual: 9.36.0 fails P2 on it (the race) and 9.37.0 passes it; (b) a page whose example ends with text only and no visual: 9.37.0 FAILS P2 with 'result is text, not a visualisation' (the gate is not weakened); (c) a page whose example never finishes: 9.37.0 fails P2 within the bound; (4) on the pages 9.83.0 of chapters 5 and 6, 9.37.0 gives for every feature the same result as 9.36.0; on the page 9.85.0 of chapter 8 the P2 result of 9.37.0 is reported as printed; (5) no committed file is edited (the executor's logs are written once), no gate, test or threshold other than the new file is changed, and 9.37.0 is NOT used in any other criterion; results are reported as printed; if any element fails the file is named failing. MEASURED (executor SEN0401-I20-page-ch08, commits 75e0a47 and 0e34361; builder's root-cause analysis 2026-10-24): the page 9.85.0 of chapter 8 fails the page test 9.36.0 on feature P2 only: examples 17 and 18 are judged 'result is text, not a visualisation'; the page tests 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 pass. ROOT CAUSE: the test waits for the result element to hold any non-empty text, the template 9.52.2 writes the placeholder 'Running...' into that element when an example starts, so the wait ends at once; the test then waits 300 ms and reads. Examples that take longer than about 0.3 s (17: 0.7 s, 18: 1.3 s on the machine) are read while the placeholder is still shown. The diagnostic log 08-tooling/ch08-page/iter20_logs/ch08_9_85_0_diag_p2_timing.log shows that both examples do show a visual when they finish. The pages of chapters 5 and 6 pass because all their examples finish within 0.3 s (one chapter 5 run failed once under load); the SEN0414 page test carries the same code. CHOICE by rule and fact: the template placeholder is correct behaviour for a reader and lighter example code would change the teaching content to suit the test; a defective gate is repaired by a new test file (the precedent of 9.34.1 and 9.35.1), so a new test file 9.37.0 is made. It enters no criterion until the owner answers the question that is asked." ;
