ex:AC7R_SecLinks_Ch11 a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The section links of chapter 11 show on its rebuilt page with the ERD labels measured, as in the carried criterion"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Carried from the story ex:ST_Section_Links by ex:CR3_Repair20 (Saturday 2026-10-24, the course coordinator's order after the controls of the same day (v0.244.0) and the owner's rule that repairs re-rank the open items; its criterion ex:AC3L2_Ch11 names the page 9.79.0 on template 9.51.1, which no longer exists as the target; the elements are restated on the page that is built now). Given the research of chapter 11 (16 sections, section links Done) and the page of chapter 11 rebuilt by TK_Ch11_Page_Build on template 9.52.2 (Iteration 21), when the checks are run, then ALL of: (1) links: every one of the 16 sections is related to at least one other section by a stated link, and no relationship is stated as text only; (2) ERD: the page tests 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 run their ERD label features (the filled ERD overlap and labels-over-entity reading, and the on-choice labels mode) with no skip and pass them, labels shown after Untangle at least 95 percent of the grid's, and the run ends without a crash; (3) gates: the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 for 11 (current validator v1.13.0) exits 0 with Stage3.F, Stage4.A, B, cov, sub and src PASS, and the Research, Deck and Page chapter checks v1_3_0 (pinned validator v1.6.0) pass; (4) the template markers, the deck match check with 0 not carried, the Stage 4 page ABox and the stored page-test result as new files; (5) no committed file is edited and no gate, test, threshold or criterion is changed; results as printed; if any element fails the chapter is named failing. MEASURED: Iteration 14 ended at 2026-10-24T06:00 UTC; the story ST_Section_Links is open in it (chapter 10 delivered; TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Page Suspended since 2026-10-22, TK_SecLinks_Ch11_Verify Proposed), so the validator reports L4 on it ('split the remainder into a story that fits the next iteration'). The chapter 11 page is rebuilt anyway by TK_Ch11_Page_Build of Iteration 21 on template 9.52.2, which contains the section-link ERD, so the remainder is a Verify task that waits for that page." ;
