stored test_results_abox_v9_77_0.json: widgets 127, features 185, gates 6, skipped 0; the feature 'a story chip on a concept opens that story in the Stories tab' pass: verified -> story chip feature by test: {'9_36_0': ['PASS'], '9_35_1': ['PASS'], '9_34_1': ['PASS']}] | (3) chapter-code tab equals the deck's manifest, examples run (page test and manifest check): NOT MET [page test 9.36.0: the added features P1 P2 P3 P4 P5 P6 P8 P9 P11 all PASS, none : NOT verified -> 9.36.0 added features: 11 PASS lines of 12, FAIL/other {'P2 every chapter-code example opens in the editor, runs in t': 'FAIL'}, SKIP 0; the chapter-code manifest equals the order of the deck's code slides (names uniq: verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch08_v1_0_0.json | 20 examples | 20 code slides | deck SEN0401_Ch08_DigitalSignatures_3e_v2_0_0.pptx | PASS order equals code-slide order, names unique, library files exist, hashes match where stated] | (4) Stage 4 runner, Research/Deck/Page chapter checks, deck match: NOT MET [Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 (current validator v1.13.0): verified -> OVERALL: PASS; chapter check Research v1_3_0 (pinned validator v1.6.0): verified -> RESULT Research/Ch08: PASS; chapter check Deck: verified -> deck: 03-materials/ch08/SEN0401_Ch08_DigitalSignatures_3e_v2_0_0.pptx deck check: deck_check_v1_0_0.py deck_notes_check 1.0.0: 51 slides, 51 with notes written for the reader RESULT Deck/Ch08: PASS; chapter check Page: NOT verified -> page test: sen0401_page_test_v9_36_0.py on page version 9_85_0 page 08: exit 0, widgets ('127', '127'), features passed 392, failed 2, release step with a TEST key RESULT: FAIL RESULT Page/Ch08: FAIL; deck match check: 0 not carried: verified -> (log missing)] | (5) no committed file edited; ABox and stored result new files: NOT MET [no committed file is edited (every file of the executor's commits added): verified -> (log missing); the Stage 4 page ABox and the stored page-test result are new files: NOT verified -> (log missing)]. RESULT: NOT MET: (2a) page test 9.36.0: every added feature passes, exit 0; (3) chapter-code tab equals the deck's manifest, examples run (page test and manifest check); (4) Stage 4 runner, Research/Deck/Page chapter checks, deck match; (5) no committed file edited; ABox and stored result new files. A unit whose element fails is named failing and is not Done (the criterion is not edited). The page tests 9.36.0, 9.35.1 and 9.34.1 were RUN by the builder session on this page, serially, on 2026-10-24 (logs in 08-tooling/verify/iter20/pages), not read from the executor's logs. ROOT CAUSE of the failing P2, established by the builder session: the page test 9.36.0 accepts the placeholder 'Running...' that the template 9.52.2 writes into the result element as a finished result (its wait is satisfied by any non-empty text) and reads after 300 ms; examples 17 and 18 take 0.7 s and 1.3 s, so they were read while the placeholder was shown (the executor's diagnostic log ch08_9_85_0_diag_p2_timing.log shows both show a visual when they finish); the pages of chapters 5 and 6 pass because their examples finish within 0.3 s. The executor also built no stored page-test result and no Stage 4 page ABox (as its brief ordered when a gate fails). The repair is the new page test 9.37.0 (change request CR3_Repair20); it enters no criterion until the owner answers." .
