ex:AC8R_Regress a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The template 9.52.2 gives the old page tests the stored result on a control set of pages built from it"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Owner-directed work (ex:CR3_Remedy56), RESTATED by ex:CR3_Repair21 from ex:AC4R_Regress (Saturday 2026-10-24, decided by the lineage's own change route under the owner's standing rule of the same day (relayed by the course coordinator): a lineage never waits on questions unrelated to its work; when the answerer is not a person, the lineage's agentic system decides without a handover; work the lineage enforces but the actual work misses must be dealt with; progress must not need expensive switch-overs): the control set is built on the template that is now in use, 9.52.2, instead of 9.52.0 (replaced by 9.52.1 and 9.52.2, which the controls of Iterations 18 and 19 passed); nothing else is changed. Given the template 9.52.2, the builders v4_15_0 and v2_24_0 and the page tests 9.34.1 and 9.35.1, when the pages of chapters 1 and 10 are built into a scratch folder on the template 9.52.2 and the page tests 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 are run on each, serially, under flock /tmp/page_test.lock, then ALL of: (1) each of the 4 runs ends exit 0 with RESULT PASS, no [FAIL], and widgets, features and gates not below the stored result of the shipped page, skipped features not more and each of them one the stored result skips; (2) every run is kept as a log; (3) no committed file is edited, the scratch pages are not shipped; results as printed; if any element fails the template is named failing. Control set justified: the template is a new file used only by pages built from it; the shipped pages stay on their files, so their results cannot move. The old criterion stays as history and is not met; the task that carried it (TK_Remedy_Regress) is withdrawn because it named the template 9.52.0 that no page uses." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS_PageTemplateE, ex:TS_PageBuilder415, ex:TS_PageData224, ex:TS_PageTest34b, ex:TS_PageTest35b ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "page template 9.52.2 (course_page_template_v9_52_2.html); page builder v4_15_0 and page-data builder v2_24_0; page tests 9.34.1 and 9.35.1; Playwright 1.56.0" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the logs of the runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC8R_Reg_Passes, ex:TC8R_Reg_NotClaimed .
