    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "Decided by the owner through his standing rule of 2026-10-24, which the builder role applied (Saturday 2026-10-24, decided by the lineage's own change route under the owner's standing rule of the same day (relayed by the course coordinator): a lineage never waits on questions unrelated to its work; when the answerer is not a person, the lineage's agentic system decides without a handover; work the lineage enforces but the actual work misses must be dealt with; progress must not need expensive switch-overs). The decider recorded is the Owner because the rule is his decision; the builder role did the recording. The boundary moved outward by three stories; new files only; nothing existing is edited or weakened." .
