    backlog:hasAuditNote "Disclosure 2026-10-24 (Saturday 2026-10-24, decided by the lineage's own change route under the owner's standing rule of the same day (relayed by the course coordinator): a lineage never waits on questions unrelated to its work; when the answerer is not a person, the lineage's agentic system decides without a handover; work the lineage enforces but the actual work misses must be dealt with; progress must not need expensive switch-overs): the words of this criterion that the page test 9.37.0 'enters no criterion until the owner answers' and its clause (5) 'is NOT used in any other criterion' were conditions on the task TK_PageTest937_Build while the owner's question was open; the task was Done as controlled in v0.258.0 and is not edited (G125). The owner's standing rule of 2026-10-24 settles the question without a handover: ex:AC8R_Page_Ch07 and ex:AC8R_Page_Ch08 name 9.37.0 by the change route ex:CR3_Repair21, with the race as the recorded defect of the gate and no element loosened." .

