    backlog:hasScoreRationale "RICE with dependency factor (BP-D10): score = Reach x Impact x Confidence / Effort = 1 x 1 x 0.8 / 2.0 = 0.40; the dependency factor 1 is recorded beside it and the ORDERING KEY is the score times the dependency factor = 0.40. Reach 1 chapter. Impact 1 (medium): retrofit planned after the urgent chapters by the owner's decision of 2026-10-23 16:06. Confidence 0.8. Effort 2.0 h: 1.5 h executor plus 0.5 h verification. DepFactor 1: no open prerequisite. FACTS: the page test 9.37.0 and the re-issued deck of chapter 7 are controlled MET (v0.258.0, v0.257.0); the pages of chapters 7 and 8 name 9.37.0 by the change route of ex:CR3_Repair21 (the lineage's decision under the owner's standing rule of 2026-10-24). FACTS: the owner's archive holds 14 chapter pages built on the one template line, each with the charset tag behind byte 1024 (the coordinator's measure); the builder session measured the tag at byte 13578 in the pages 9.82.0 of chapters 5 and 6; the owner reported garbled labels on pages he uses in class (2026-10-23 09:32 Istanbul). Recorded on the owner's instruction 'Repairs should change the priority of the PBIs or the tasks'; a new dated record, no earlier score is edited." .
