    rdfs:label "The decks and pages of the fourteen chapters restated on the measured standard, the template 9.52.3 with the story layout, the story-layout repair of the pages of chapters 5 to 8, and the chapter 1 verify script"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "the research behind it and an interactive page"^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:hasDeliverableText "The decks of chapters 1 to 4 and 9 to 14 as new files meeting the deck standard with no overlap and a manifest without error-first examples; the pages of all fourteen chapters as new files on the template 9.52.3 (a new file; 9.52.2 stays) meeting the page standard with the story layout at three viewports; the verify script of the chapter 1 research. MEASURED (the lineage agent's baseline, 2026-10-25, tool sen0401_lineage_baseline_v1_0_0.py, one log per run in 08-tooling/verify/iter24/baseline, committed before this change): DECKS: the deck standard check v1_1_0 gives 12 of 12 elements PASS for chapters 5 to 8 and 4 PASS, 8 FAIL (D1, D2, D3, D4, D5, D7, D10, D11) for every one of chapters 1 to 4 and 9 to 14; the deck overlap check v1_0_0 is clean on the decks of chapters 5 to 14 and reports overlaps (text over a picture, a table over text) on chapters 1 to 4. MANIFESTS: a chapter-code manifest exists for chapters 5 to 8 only (27, 18, 15 and 20 examples; the control check manifest:NN exits 0; no example's first output line starts with an error name) and for no other chapter. PAGES: the newest pages of chapters 5 to 8 declare the standard 9.52, have the chapter-code tab and pass the charset check; the newest pages of the other ten chapters have no chapter-code tab, no standard declaration and fail the charset check (tag behind byte 1024). STORY LAYOUT (the owner's rule, new tool sen0401_story_layout_probe_v1_0_0.py, 1366x768, 1400x900 and 390x844, logs in 08-tooling/verify/iter24/storylayout): the pages of chapters 5, 6, 7 and 8 FAIL it (a photograph as tall as the screen pushes the narrative below the first screen: 4 of 9, 3 of 12, 2 of 9 and 3 of 9 stories); the cause is the template 9.52.2 (.simgrow img with width 100 percent and height auto, no height cap). GATES: the Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 gives OVERALL PASS for all fourteen chapters; the Research chapter check v1_3_0 exits 0 for chapters 2 to 14 and CRASHES for chapter 1 (no file sen0401_ch01_verify_v*.py exists; the check names the verify script as a part). NOT MEASURED here: the page test 9.37.0 on the old pages (they lack the chapter-code tab, so P2 and P11 cannot pass) - the page test is run on every rebuilt page." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area3_Remedy56 ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
ex:Scope3 backlog:requiresDeliverable ex:Del3_Retro24 ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Retro24, ex:IA3_Retro24 .
ex:Scope3 rdfs:comment "Revised 2026-10-25 by the stage revision ex:Revision_Lineage3_Scope11 on the change request ex:CR3_Retro24 (Sunday 2026-10-25, decided by the lineage's own change route under the owner's standing orders (retrofit all chapters starting with chapter 1; repairs re-rank the open items; a lineage never waits on unrelated questions)). The statement above is unchanged (L-112). It now also requires one deliverable in the area ex:Area3_Remedy56 (the retrofit on the measured standard). No exclusion changes: new files only; the exclusion of changes to gates, tests and thresholds still holds (9.52.3 and the probe are new files)."@en .

