ex:Spec3I_Retro24 a backlog:Specification ;
    rdfs:label "What it is for a retrofitted chapter to meet the standard"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:specifiesGoal ex:G3_Retro24 ;
    backlog:hasSpecificationText "A chapter meets the standard when every element of the criteria of its deck and its page is measured on the evidence bridge as met, the output files are new, and no committed file is edited. STORY RULE (the owner's): the text of a story is visible without scrolling past a full-height photograph; check EVERY story at 1366x768, 1400x900 and 390x844 with the narrative starting within the first screen. The template 9.52.2 has no height cap on story photographs (.simgrow img{width:100%;height:auto}); the template 9.52.3 caps them." ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_Derived ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:producedByStage ex:Out3_GoalR12 .
ex:Spec3I_Retro24_Pass a backlog:TestScenario ; rdfs:label "A deck or page built as new files passes its criterion"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:scenarioKind backlog:Scen_Nominal ; backlog:scenarioOf ex:Spec3I_Retro24 ; backlog:hasScenarioText "Given the deck or the page of a chapter built as new files, when the checks of its criterion are run on the bridge, then every element passes and the nochange check prints status A only." .
ex:Spec3I_Retro24_Fail a backlog:TestScenario ; rdfs:label "A deck with an overlap, a manifest example that starts with an error name, a page whose story text lies below the first screen, or a committed file edited is not claimed"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:scenarioKind backlog:Scen_Rejection ; backlog:scenarioOf ex:Spec3I_Retro24 ; backlog:hasScenarioText "Given a deck whose slides overlap, a manifest whose example starts with an error name, a page whose story narrative begins below the first screen, or a task that edits a committed file, when the checks are run, then the named check fails and nothing is claimed." .

