ex:AC9_VerifyScript backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.293.0), deck of chapter 1, every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) Research/Ch01 exits 0 with the verify script: MET [Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch01 ex: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch01: PASS] | (2) Research/Ch02 to Ch14 exit 0 as in the baseline: MET [Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch02 (0: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch02: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch03 (0: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch03: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch04 (0: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch04: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch05 (0: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch05: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch06 (0: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch06: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch07 (0: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch07: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch08 (0: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch08: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch09 (0: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch09: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch10 (1: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch10: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch11 (1: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch11: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch12 (1: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch12: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch13 (1: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch13: PASS; Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch14 (1: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch14: PASS] | (3) no committed file edited: MET [no committed file is edited (every file of the exe: verified -> nochange commits 7ac4a31 | PASS every file of the commits was added, none modified or deleted]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. CONTROL FINDINGS: the executor reports a deviation, confirmed by the control as a fact of the chapter 1 research, not of the script: the form of the chapter 2 verify script (the shared library sen0401_research_verify_lib_v1_0_0.py) fails on the chapter 1 research with two structural findings (a publication P23, RFC 3986, never cited; a counts check 30 against 7 findings, the library minimum being 8), so the executor's script checks quotations, number pairs and examples only. The criterion AC9_VerifyScript asks for a verify script that the Research chapter check accepts; it does not ask for the form of chapter 2, so it is met; the two findings are real gaps in the chapter 1 research set, NOT waived: they are carried by the research repair of chapter 1 planned in the register (ChangeRequest ex:CR3_Ch01Research, Pending). The 'same as before' of chapters 2 to 14 is measured here against the baseline of 2026-10-25 (all exit 0)." .
