ex:CR3_Ch01Research a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the chapter 1 research set: cite the publication P23 or drop it, and reach the findings minimum, as new research files"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Retro24, ex:CR3_ArcCheck ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the executor of TK_Ch01_VerifyScript_Build (commit 7ac4a31) and confirmed in the control: the form of the chapter 2 verify script (the shared library sen0401_research_verify_lib_v1_0_0.py) FAILS on the chapter 1 research with two structural findings: ('publication never cited', 'P23', 'RFC 3986') and ('counts', 30, 7), i.e. 7 findings against the library minimum of 8. The chapter 1 verify script that exists checks quotations (228), number pairs (63) and examples (42 of 42 executed), and the Research chapter check passes; the two findings are gaps of the research set, not of the script. The owner's order is to bring each chapter's research set to the course standard; gaps are said openly and are not waived. Pending: it is admitted by the ScopeChange of the planning of Iteration 26, where the chapter 1 page is built; nothing is built now." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .

ex:IA3_Ch01Research a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "What the chapter 1 research repair costs and what it touches"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR3_Ch01Research ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the executor of TK_Ch01_VerifyScript_Build (commit 7ac4a31) and confirmed in the control: the form of the chapter 2 verify script (the shared library sen0401_research_verify_lib_v1_0_0.py) FAILS on the chapter 1 research with two structural findings: ('publication never cited', 'P23', 'RFC 3986') and ('counts', 30, 7), i.e. 7 findings against the library minimum of 8. The chapter 1 verify script that exists checks quotations (228), number pairs (63) and examples (42 of 42 executed), and the Research chapter check passes; the two findings are gaps of the research set, not of the script. AFFECTED: the research files of chapter 1 (new versions, the old stay), the chapter 1 verify script (a new version may then adopt the library form), the Research and Stage 4 checks of chapter 1. NOT AFFECTED: the chapter 1 deck and page criteria, which do not depend on the two findings. ESTIMATE (G120): research repair 2.0 h executor plus 1.0 h verification. ORDER: Iteration 26, in parallel with the page of chapter 1; a new story in the chapter 1 line, ranked at planning." .

