ex:Revision_Lineage3_Scope12 a backlog:StageRevision ;
    rdfs:label "Revision of the third lineage from the Scope stage: the repair of the chapter 1 research set and of the deck arc check"@en ;
    backlog:revisesLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:revisesFromStage backlog:Stage_Scope ;
    rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Ch01Research, ex:CR3_ArcCheck, ex:IA3_Ch01Research ;
    backlog:revisionReason "The change requests ex:CR3_Ch01Research, ex:CR3_ArcCheck (Sunday 2026-10-25, decided by the lineage's own change route under the owner's standing orders (gaps found are filled through change management; repairs re-rank; a lineage never waits)) add a deliverable (the repair of the chapter 1 research set and of the arc check); the lineage is in its closed Backlog stage, and a deliverable added to a closed scope statement is a revision from the Scope stage (ruling G127). The requests and their assessments were recorded first (v0.288.0, v0.294.0). This version retracts the Scope, Goal, Objective and Backlog outputs and rebuilds nothing; the next four versions rebuild them one stage each, a sixth fills the last commit; the items already in the register, Done ones included, re-enter by admission and are not re-dated (L-112). The interim versions are the declared transition (G129)." ;
    backlog:retractsOutput ex:Out3_ScopeR12, ex:Out3_GoalR12, ex:Out3_ObjectiveR12, ex:Out3_BacklogR14 ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Builder ;
    backlog:revisedAtCommit "8eba4dd" .
ex:Out3_ScopeR12 backlog:outputRetracted true .
ex:Out3_GoalR12 backlog:outputRetracted true .
ex:Out3_ObjectiveR12 backlog:outputRetracted true .
ex:Out3_BacklogR14 backlog:outputRetracted true .

ex:Del3_Res01 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ;
    rdfs:label "The research set of chapter 1 repaired and the deck arc check repaired, each as new files"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "the research behind it and an interactive page"^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:hasDeliverableText "The research of chapter 1 as new files citing or dropping P23 and reaching the findings minimum, with a verify script version that adopts the shared form; the deck arc check v1_2_0 as a new file that reads the deck length and accepts a closing part. MEASURED 2026-10-25. Research set of chapter 1: the form of the chapter 2 verify script (library sen0401_research_verify_lib_v1_0_0.py) fails on it with ('publication never cited', 'P23', 'RFC 3986') and ('counts', 30, 7): 7 findings against the minimum of 8 (executor of TK_Ch01_VerifyScript_Build, commit 7ac4a31; control v0.293.0). Arc check: sen0401_deck_arc_check_v1_1_0.py demands a 26-slide deck (--slides N is a flag, not read from the plan) and refuses a deck whose agenda ends with a summary-and-resources part that starts at a slide that is not a section slide; it refuses the decks of chapters 1 and 8 and, with the right length, the deck of chapter 4 (agenda range 45-47). It is not an element of any criterion of Iterations 24 to 28." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area3_Remedy56 ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
ex:Scope3 backlog:requiresDeliverable ex:Del3_Res01 ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Ch01Research, ex:CR3_ArcCheck .
ex:Scope3 rdfs:comment "Revised 2026-10-25 by the stage revision ex:Revision_Lineage3_Scope12 on the change requests ex:CR3_Ch01Research, ex:CR3_ArcCheck (Sunday 2026-10-25, decided by the lineage's own change route under the owner's standing orders (gaps found are filled through change management; repairs re-rank; a lineage never waits)). The statement above is unchanged (L-112). It now also requires one deliverable in the area ex:Area3_Remedy56 (the research repair and the arc-check repair). No exclusion changes: new files only."@en .

