ex:AC9_Ch01Research a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The research set of chapter 1 passes the form of the chapter 2 verify script and the Research chapter check, as new files"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Owner-directed work (ex:CR3_Ch01Research, Sunday 2026-10-25, decided by the lineage's own change route under the owner's standing orders (gaps found are filled through change management; repairs re-rank; a lineage never waits)). Given the research of chapter 1 and the chapter 1 verify script v1_0_0 (unchanged), when the research is repaired as new files, then ALL of: (1) P23 is cited or dropped with a stated reason; (2) the findings reach the library minimum of 8; (3) the form of the chapter 2 verify script (shared library, unedited) passes on the new research and a NEW verify script version adopts it; (4) the Research chapter check for Research/Ch01 and the Stage 4 gate runner for 01 exit 0; (5) no committed file is edited; results as printed; if any element fails the research is named failing. MEASURED 2026-10-25. Research set of chapter 1: the form of the chapter 2 verify script (library sen0401_research_verify_lib_v1_0_0.py) fails on it with ('publication never cited', 'P23', 'RFC 3986') and ('counts', 30, 7): 7 findings against the minimum of 8 (executor of TK_Ch01_VerifyScript_Build, commit 7ac4a31; control v0.293.0). Arc check: sen0401_deck_arc_check_v1_1_0.py demands a 26-slide deck (--slides N is a flag, not read from the plan) and refuses a deck whose agenda ends with a summary-and-resources part that starts at a slide that is not a section slide; it refuses the decks of chapters 1 and 8 and, with the right length, the deck of chapter 4 (agenda range 45-47). It is not an element of any criterion of Iterations 24 to 28." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS_ResearchCheck, ex:TS_ChapterCheck, ex:TS_Stage4Gates, ex:TS_RdodiValidatorCurrent, ex:TS_RdodiValidatorPinned ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "Research chapter check v1_3_0 (venv314) reading the PINNED RDODI validator v1.6.0; Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 reading the CURRENT validator v1.13.0; shared verify library sen0401_research_verify_lib_v1_0_0.py" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new files cited by SHA-256, the logs of the runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC9R_Ch01Research_Passes, ex:TC9R_Ch01Research_NotClaimed .
