    backlog:hasFixtureState "The finding as measured in the baseline of 2026-10-25 (ex:IA3_Retro24)." .

ex:AC9_ArcCheck a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The deck arc check v1_2_0 reads the deck length and accepts a closing part and changes nothing else"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Owner-directed work (ex:CR3_ArcCheck, Sunday 2026-10-25, decided by the lineage's own change route under the owner's standing orders (gaps found are filled through change management; repairs re-rank; a lineage never waits)). Given the arc check v1_1_0 (unchanged), when the NEW file v1_2_0 is made, then ALL of: (1) v1_1_0 is byte-identical (SHA-256 before and after); (2) the diff is limited to the reading of the deck length and the closing-part agenda range; (3) on the decks of chapters 1, 4 and 8 the two refusals are gone and the remaining refusals are listed with their rule; (4) a fixture with a wrong agenda range is still refused; (5) no committed file is edited; results as printed. MEASURED 2026-10-25. Research set of chapter 1: the form of the chapter 2 verify script (library sen0401_research_verify_lib_v1_0_0.py) fails on it with ('publication never cited', 'P23', 'RFC 3986') and ('counts', 30, 7): 7 findings against the minimum of 8 (executor of TK_Ch01_VerifyScript_Build, commit 7ac4a31; control v0.293.0). Arc check: sen0401_deck_arc_check_v1_1_0.py demands a 26-slide deck (--slides N is a flag, not read from the plan) and refuses a deck whose agenda ends with a summary-and-resources part that starts at a slide that is not a section slide; it refuses the decks of chapters 1 and 8 and, with the right length, the deck of chapter 4 (agenda range 45-47). It is not an element of any criterion of Iterations 24 to 28." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS_DeckStdCheck11 ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "arc check v1_2_0 (python-pptx 1.0.2); v1_1_0 byte-identical" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new files cited by SHA-256, the logs of the runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC9R_ArcCheck_Passes, ex:TC9R_ArcCheck_NotClaimed .
