ex:AC9_Deck_Ch11 backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.306.0), deck of chapter 11, every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) deck standard check D1 to D12: MET [deck standard check v1_1_0: every element D1 to D12 met, no NOT_MEASUR: verified -> SUMMARY PASS=12 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0 | failing: none RESULT PASS (exit 0)] | (2) overlap check: MET [deck overlap check v1_0_0: exit 0 (no overlap, nothing beyond the slid: verified -> RESULT CLEAN (0 findings)] | (3) manifest equals the code slides, no error-first example: MET [deck control check v1_1_0 manifest: order equals the order of the code: verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch11_v1_0_0.json | 17 examples | 17 code slides | deck SEN0401_Ch11_TheBlockchain_3e_v2_0_0.pptx | PASS order equals code-slide order, names unique, library files exist, hashes match where stated; error-first scan: no manifest example has a first output line that sta: verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch11_v1_0_0.json | 17 examples | error-first examples: [] RESULT PASS] | (4) Deck chapter check: MET [Deck chapter check v1_3_0 (examples re-run, fixtures refused, layout, : verified -> deck: 03-materials/ch11/SEN0401_Ch11_TheBlockchain_3e_v2_0_0.pptx deck check: deck_check_v1_0_0.py deck_notes_check 1.0.0: 43 slides, 43 with notes written for the reader RESULT Deck/Ch11: PASS] | (5) no committed file edited: MET [no committed file is edited (every file of the executor's commits adde: verified -> nochange commits 8588709 | PASS every file of the commits was added, none modified or deleted]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. The deck match check is not an element run here: the lecture export and page data of the chapter do not exist until its page task (Iteration 26). The slides were rendered (LibreOffice PDF, contact sheets of all slides) and read by the builder as a reading, not a tool result: cream scheme throughout, numbered slides, native charts, stories with picture and link strips. Not measured: the arc check v1_1_0 refuses this deck as it refuses the deck of chapter 8 (it demands a 26-slide standard); it is not an element of the criterion. Slide reading by the lineage agent (soffice render, 43 slides, contact sheets 08-tooling/verify/iter24/ctl_deck11): numbered, native charts, three stories with real pictures (The Times headline, Ralph Merkle, testnet) each with a link bar, one concept slide per five concepts with an everyday analogy, resources slide present. The Bitcoin sign renders as an eight in the small contact sheet only (font substitution of the render). Executor disclosures kept: deck match check NOT_MEASURED (falls to the page task), two earlier chapter-check runs failed and were not kept. Links: 15 of 15 answered 200 on the executor's run, not re-run by the lineage agent." .
