ex:AC9_Deck_Ch10 backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.307.0), deck of chapter 10, every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) deck standard check D1 to D12: MET [deck standard check v1_1_0: every element D1 to D12 met, no NOT_MEASUR: verified -> SUMMARY PASS=12 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0 | failing: none RESULT PASS (exit 0)] | (2) overlap check: MET [deck overlap check v1_0_0: exit 0 (no overlap, nothing beyond the slid: verified -> RESULT CLEAN (0 findings)] | (3) manifest equals the code slides, no error-first example: MET [deck control check v1_1_0 manifest: order equals the order of the code: verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch10_v1_0_0.json | 22 examples | 22 code slides | deck SEN0401_Ch10_TheBitcoinNetwork_3e_v2_0_0.pptx | PASS order equals code-slide order, names unique, library files exist, hashes match where stated; error-first scan: no manifest example has a first output line that sta: verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch10_v1_0_0.json | 22 examples | error-first examples: [] RESULT PASS] | (4) Deck chapter check: MET [Deck chapter check v1_3_0 (examples re-run, fixtures refused, layout, : verified -> deck: 03-materials/ch10/SEN0401_Ch10_TheBitcoinNetwork_3e_v2_0_0.pptx deck check: deck_check_v1_0_0.py deck_notes_check 1.0.0: 49 slides, 49 with notes written for the reader RESULT Deck/Ch10: PASS] | (5) no committed file edited: MET [no committed file is edited (every file of the executor's commits adde: verified -> nochange commits 107ba36,a7465b5 | PASS every file of the commits was added, none modified or deleted]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. The deck match check is not an element run here: the lecture export and page data of the chapter do not exist until its page task (Iteration 26). The slides were rendered (LibreOffice PDF, contact sheets of all slides) and read by the builder as a reading, not a tool result: cream scheme throughout, numbered slides, native charts, stories with picture and link strips. Not measured: the arc check v1_1_0 refuses this deck as it refuses the deck of chapter 8 (it demands a 26-slide standard); it is not an element of the criterion. Slide reading by the lineage agent (soffice render, 49 slides, sheets 08-tooling/verify/iter24/ctl_deck10): numbered, 9 native charts, five stories with real pictures and link bars, concept slides with everyday analogies, resources slide present. Links: the lineage agent's own curl re-check of all 13 links of the deck returned 200 (13 of 13, 2026-10-25). Executor disclosures kept: deck match check v1_0_0 compares the old page with the old export and says nothing about the new deck (v1_1_0 does not exist, falls to the page task, NOT_MEASURED); slide 11 census is marked recorded, not run on the course page, because the Bitnodes snapshot is not in the wheel (disclosed on the slide); two own checks failed on a first draft and only final runs are logged." .
