ex:AC9_Ch01Research backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.312.0), the research set of chapter 1, every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) P23 cited, or dropped with a reason: MET [lineage agent's own check: the publication P23 (RF: verified -> RESULT PASS] | (2) findings reach the library minimum 8: MET [lineage agent's own check: findings reach the libr: verified -> RESULT PASS] | (3) the form of the chapter 2 verify script passes and a NEW verify script version adopts it: MET [form of the chapter 2 verify script (shared librar: verified -> failures: []; chapter 1 verify script v1_1_0 exits 0 with failur: verified -> failures: []] | (4) Research chapter check for Research/Ch01 and Stage 4 gate runner for 01 exit 0, further proofs (additive, HermiT): MET [Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch01 ex: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch01: PASS; Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 for 01 exits 0: verified -> OVERALL: PASS; lineage agent's own check: every triple of researc: verified -> RESULT PASS; lineage agent's own check: HermiT consistency of r: verified -> RESULT PASS] | (5) no committed file edited: MET [no committed file is edited (every file of the exe: verified -> nochange commits 83c4c2d,e6c12f6 | PASS every file of the commits was added, none modified or deleted]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. CONTROL FINDINGS (lineage agent): the new finding F8 was read: it cites RFC 3986 (P23), BIP 21 (P16) and the DID specification (P07) and states that the saved copy of BIP 21 is superseded by BIP 321, so the sources are named honestly; its quotations are re-read against the saved copies by the verify script v1.1.0 part 4 (passes). Research v1_3_0 is ADDITIVE over v1_2_0 (own subset check: no old triple outside version header and scorecard is missing; 13 triples added). Findings 7 to 8 reach the library minimum, not more. Stage 4 gate runner printed OVERALL PASS with NOT_MEASURED for Stage1.C, Stage1.E, Stage3.E, Stage4.L, Cross.C and CANNOT_RUN for Cross.B: these are not passes; they are the same kind of gap as before (no concept inventory in the research file; no hybrid chains) and are NOT repaired by this story: open gap. The runner printed validator v1_14_0 while the brief named v1_13_0 (executor disclosure; the runner selects the validator; unchanged). Scorecard figures 15 to 17 are the executor's statement, not independently scored." .
