ex:AC9_Deck_Ch12 backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.329.0), deck of chapter 12, every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) deck standard check D1 to D12: MET [deck standard check v1_1_0: every element D1 to D12 met, no NOT_MEASUR: verified -> SUMMARY PASS=12 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0 | failing: none RESULT PASS (exit 0)] | (2) overlap check: MET [deck overlap check v1_0_0: exit 0 (no overlap, nothing beyond the slid: verified -> RESULT CLEAN (0 findings)] | (3) manifest equals the code slides, no error-first example: MET [deck control check v1_1_0 manifest: order equals the order of the code: verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch12_v1_0_0.json | 22 examples | 22 code slides | deck SEN0401_Ch12_MiningAndConsensus_3e_v2_0_0.pptx | PASS order equals code-slide order, names unique, library files exist, hashes match where stated; error-first scan: no manifest example has a first output line that sta: verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch12_v1_0_0.json | 22 examples | error-first examples: [] RESULT PASS] | (4) Deck chapter check: MET [Deck chapter check v1_3_0 (examples re-run, fixtures refused, layout, : verified -> deck: 03-materials/ch12/SEN0401_Ch12_MiningAndConsensus_3e_v2_0_0.pptx deck check: deck_check_v1_0_0.py deck_notes_check 1.0.0: 58 slides, 58 with notes written for the reader RESULT Deck/Ch12: PASS] | (5) no committed file edited: MET [no committed file is edited (every file of the executor's commits adde: verified -> nochange commits 40fac1a,c9d1985 | PASS every file of the commits was added, none modified or deleted]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. The deck match check is not an element run here: the lecture export and page data of the chapter do not exist until its page task (Iteration 26). The slides were rendered (LibreOffice PDF, contact sheets of all slides) and read by the builder as a reading, not a tool result: cream scheme throughout, numbered slides, native charts, stories with picture and link strips. Not measured: the arc check v1_1_0 refuses this deck as it refuses the deck of chapter 8 (it demands a 26-slide standard); it is not an element of the criterion. Slide reading by the lineage agent (soffice render, 58 slides, sheets 08-tooling/verify/iter24/ctl_deck12): numbered, 10 native charts, four stories with real pictures and link bars, concept slides with everyday analogies, resources slide present. Links: the lineage agent's own curl re-check of all 15 links returned 200 (15 of 15). RESEARCH GAP CONFIRMED BY THE LINEAGE AGENT: the 41 primary-source concepts of 03-materials/ch12/rdodi/sen0401_ch12_research_v1_0_1.ttl equal the 41 of chapter 11 by label (41 of 41 identical), so the research set of chapter 12 holds the concepts of the wrong chapter. The deck therefore teaches 39 real chapter 12 concepts and carries eight slides titled From chapter 11 (slides 43 to 50) that show the borrowed 41 so that the deck standard check D4 and D11 pass; the criterion AC9_Deck_Ch12 names the checks, which pass, so it is MET, but the eight slides do not teach chapter 12 and the deck is NOT claimed free of the defect: the repair is planned (research of chapter 12 corrected, then a new deck version without the borrowed part). Other executor disclosures kept: Hashcash story link points to hashcash.org PDF (200) because web.archive.org was unreachable; mempool.space figures are plain numbers labelled on the slides; deck match check reads the old page and export (NOT_MEASURED); page test, story-layout probe and Stage 4 not part of this task." .
