ex:CR3_Ch12Research a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the chapter 12 research set (it holds the concepts of chapter 11) and the chapter 12 deck revision without the borrowed part"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_ArcFindings, ex:CR3_Retro24 ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the executor of TK_Ch12_Deck_Build_R24 (commits 40fac1a, c9d1985) and confirmed by the lineage agent in the control (register v0.329.0): the 41 primary-source concepts of 03-materials/ch12/rdodi/sen0401_ch12_research_v1_0_1.ttl are identical by label to the 41 of the chapter 11 research (41 of 41); no other pair of chapters overlaps (scan of chapters 1 to 14). The deck standard check reads these concepts for D4 and D11, so the chapter 12 deck v2_0_0 shows eight slides titled From chapter 11 (slides 43 to 50) that teach none of chapter 12 and cover only 39 real chapter 12 concepts; the criterion AC9_Deck_Ch12 names the checks and is MET, the defect is a gap of the research set, not of that criterion. Gaps are said openly and are not waived; they are filled through change management in the active lineage. Pending until the ScopeChange of the revision that admits the two stories into Iteration 30." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .

ex:IA3_Ch12Research a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "What the chapter 12 research repair costs and what it touches"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR3_Ch12Research ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the executor of TK_Ch12_Deck_Build_R24 (commits 40fac1a, c9d1985) and confirmed by the lineage agent in the control (register v0.329.0): the 41 primary-source concepts of 03-materials/ch12/rdodi/sen0401_ch12_research_v1_0_1.ttl are identical by label to the 41 of the chapter 11 research (41 of 41); no other pair of chapters overlaps (scan of chapters 1 to 14). The deck standard check reads these concepts for D4 and D11, so the chapter 12 deck v2_0_0 shows eight slides titled From chapter 11 (slides 43 to 50) that teach none of chapter 12 and cover only 39 real chapter 12 concepts; the criterion AC9_Deck_Ch12 names the checks and is MET, the defect is a gap of the research set, not of that criterion. AFFECTED: new research files of chapter 12 (new versions, the old stay) and a new chapter 12 deck version (v3_0_0) with its manifest if the examples change. NOT AFFECTED: the chapter 12 deck criterion AC9_Deck_Ch12 (it stays met), the research of the other chapters (scan: no other overlap), every committed file. ESTIMATE (G120): 3.0 h research, 2.5 h deck, each plus verification. The deck revision depends on the research repair." .

