    rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Ch12Research, ex:IA3_Ch12Research ;
    backlog:revisionReason "The change request ex:CR3_Ch12Research (Sunday 2026-10-25, decided by the lineage's own change route (gaps found are filled through change management in the active lineage; the coordinator relayed the owner's standing orders; nothing is waived)) adds a deliverable (the repair of the chapter 12 research set and the deck revision); the lineage is in its closed Backlog stage, and a deliverable added to a closed scope statement is a revision from the Scope stage (ruling G127). The request and its assessment were recorded first. This version retracts the Scope, Goal, Objective and Backlog outputs and rebuilds nothing; the next four versions rebuild them one stage each, a sixth fills the last commit; the items already in the register, Done ones included, re-enter by admission and are not re-dated (L-112). The interim versions are the declared transition (G129)." ;
    backlog:retractsOutput ex:Out3_ScopeR14, ex:Out3_GoalR14, ex:Out3_ObjectiveR14, ex:Out3_BacklogR16 ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Builder ;
    backlog:revisedAtCommit "fbc0b04" .
