ex:Rank47_ST_Ch12_Research_R24 a backlog:RICEScore ; rdfs:label "Ranking of Chapter 12 research set correction, 2026-10-25"@en ; backlog:scoredByMethod backlog:Method_RICE_DepFactor ;
    backlog:hasReach "1"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasImpact "2"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasConfidence "0.8"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasEffort "4.0"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasDepFactor "1"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:hasScoreValue "0.40"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:scoredAt "2026-10-25T11:44:36"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:isAveragedFromMembers false ;
    backlog:hasScoreRationale "RICE with dependency factor (BP-D10): score = Reach x Impact x Confidence / Effort = 1 x 2 x 0.8 / 4.0 = 0.40; the dependency factor 1 is recorded beside it and the ORDERING KEY is the score times the dependency factor = 0.40 (ties break in the owner's chapter order). Reach 1 chapter. Impact 2 (high): the research of chapter 12 is the wrong chapter's, the deck and the page of chapter 12 stand on it. Confidence 0.8. Effort 4.0 h: 3.0 h executor plus 1.0 h verification. DepFactor 1: no open prerequisite. FACTS: ex:CR3_Ch12Research, admitted by ex:SC3_Res12 (register v0.336.0): the research set of chapter 12 holds the 41 concepts of chapter 11 (confirmed in the control of v0.329.0), so the chapter 12 deck carries eight borrowed slides. A repair re-ranks the open items (G147); a new dated record, no earlier score is edited." .
