ex:AC9_ArcLookup backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.343.0), the arc check, chapter-free (29), every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) v1_2_0 byte-identical: MET [lineage agent's own check: v1_2_0 is byte-identica: verified -> RESULT PASS] | (2) diff limited to the deck lookup and the mismatch refusal: MET [lineage agent's own check: the diff v1_1_0 to v1_2: verified -> RESULT PASS] | (3) chapters 1 to 14: the delivered deck is read, no refusal lost, no crash on chapters 3 and 5: MET [lineage agent's own check: for every chapter v1_3_: verified -> RESULT PASS; lineage agent's own check: on every chapter with a: verified -> RESULT PASS] | (4) plan/deck mismatch fixture refused with both lengths: MET [lineage agent's own check: fixtures with a range s: verified -> RESULT PASS] | (5) no committed file edited: MET [no committed file is edited (every file of the exe: verified -> nochange commits 663e649,0ec94c4 | PASS every file of the commits was added, none modified or deleted]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. CONTROL FINDINGS (lineage agent): v1_2_0 SHA-256 unchanged (73617904...9642), one commit, no change; diff 14 changed lines, all in the deck lookup, the mismatch refusal and the analogy-slide guard. COMPARE on all 14 chapters (v1_2_0 given the same delivered deck versus v1_3_0): no refusal lost, none added. LOOKUP: for every chapter v1_3_0 reports the slide count of the newest .pptx in 03-materials/chNN (chapter 3: 42 slides, 0 refusals, no crash; chapter 5: 68 slides). FIXTURE: the chapter 4 plan against the chapter 9 deck is refused with exit 1 and a message naming 47 and 55 slides; the real chapter 4 deck passes. OPEN FINDINGS the repaired check shows (none waived, routed by change management): chapter 5: 82 refusals because its plan file deck_plan_v3_1_0.json is in the remedy schema (no slide kinds title, closing or sections), a plan-schema finding, not a deck finding; chapters 10, 12, 13: one notes refusal each (notes of 5 sentences against 2 to 4); chapters 1 and 7 as before (planned in Iteration 29). Executor disclosures kept: the old v1_2_0 mismatch line is printed next to the new one on mismatch; the before logs of chapters 3 and 5 keep only the last four lines; the repository moved to github.com/altunelyusuf/SEN0401 (push succeeded)." .
