ex:Rank49_ST_Ch05_ArcPlan a backlog:RICEScore ; rdfs:label "Ranking of Chapter 5 plan in the arc check schema, 2026-10-25"@en ; backlog:scoredByMethod backlog:Method_RICE_DepFactor ;
