ex:AC9_Ch12Research backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.354.0), the research set of chapter 12, every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) concepts are chapter 12's and none is shared with another chapter: MET [lineage agent's own check: the concepts are chapte: verified -> RESULT PASS; lineage agent's own check: old v1_0_1 versus new v: verified -> RESULT PASS] | (2) Research chapter check for Research/Ch12 exits 0: MET [Research chapter check v1_3_0 for Research/Ch12 ex: verified -> RESULT Research/Ch12: PASS] | (3) Stage 4 gate runner for 12 exits 0, NOT_MEASURED items listed as such: MET [Stage 4 gate runner v1_1_0 for 12 exits 0 (NOT_MEA: verified -> OVERALL: PASS] | (4) HermiT consistent: MET [lineage agent's own check: HermiT consistency of r: verified -> RESULT PASS] | (5) no committed file edited: MET [no committed file is edited (every file of the exe: verified -> nochange commits ba35018,05a327c | PASS every file of the commits was added, none modified or deleted]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. CONTROL FINDINGS (lineage agent): the 40 concepts of research v1_1_0 were read (halving, subsidy and fees, coinbase, extra nonce, ASICBoost, difficulty retarget, regtest, pools and Stratum, attacks, forks and soft-fork activation) and are chapter 12's; own scan: 0 shared labels with the newest research of chapters 1 to 11, 13 and 14, none of the 43 old concepts remains by label. SUBSET (old v1_0_1 versus new v1_1_0 by local names): 80 old triples are not in the new file, all of them the 43 removed chapter 11 concept nodes' own triples (75) and the version header and scorecard (5), no other triple lost, none pointing at a removed concept: the replacement is by design and within the criterion. HermiT consistent (own run). Stage 4 gate runner printed OVERALL PASS with NOT_MEASURED for Stage1.C, Stage1.E, Stage3.E, Stage4.L, Cross.C and CANNOT_RUN for Cross.B: these are not passes, an open gap of the same kind as chapter 1, not repaired by this story. DECK FACT, measured and stated openly: the delivered chapter 12 deck v2_0_0 now FAILS the deck standard check against the new research: D4 28 of 40 analogies (70.0 percent), D11 30 of 40 concepts on slides (75.0 percent, target 90), ten concepts on no slide (coinbase fields today, coinbase data and tags, extra nonce space, covert ASICBoost, regtest halving every 150 blocks, Stratum, top pool against the thresholds, BIP 34 activation, BIP 8 lock-in by height, Segwit activation 2017); the deck criterion AC9_Deck_Ch12 was MET against the research v1_0_1 when controlled (v0.329.0) and is not edited; its status against the new research is NOT MET and is repaired by ST_Deck12_Revise (deck v3_0_0). Executor disclosures kept: the verify script is unchanged and does not read the research; Stage 4 was not compared against a v1_0_1 run; headings and index terms were not added as concepts." .
