ex:CR3_TmpLeak a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the temporary-folder leak of the Deck chapter check, as new tool versions"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Retro24 ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the lineage agent while controlling the chapter 14 deck (register v0.361.0): the root disk had 0 MB free; the control run of the Deck chapter check v1_3_0 died in its fixture part with OSError 28 (No space left on device) and the first control run was discarded and rerun. Cause: 34 directories /tmp/sen0401_fx_* (1.7 GB), the output folders of the deck fixtures tool (sen0401_deck_fixtures_v1_2_0.py line 149, tempfile.mkdtemp, never removed), left by every run of the Deck chapter check; the same leak is named in the briefs' DISK paragraph for /tmp/sen0401_page_test_*. 16 folders older than 30 minutes were removed by the lineage agent to continue; 18 recent ones were left in case executors were running. Gaps are said openly and are not waived; they are filled through change management in the active lineage. Pending until the ScopeChange of the revision that admits the three stories into Iteration 31." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .

ex:IA3_TmpLeak a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "What the temporary-folder repair costs and what it touches"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR3_TmpLeak ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the lineage agent while controlling the chapter 14 deck (register v0.361.0): the root disk had 0 MB free; the control run of the Deck chapter check v1_3_0 died in its fixture part with OSError 28 (No space left on device) and the first control run was discarded and rerun. Cause: 34 directories /tmp/sen0401_fx_* (1.7 GB), the output folders of the deck fixtures tool (sen0401_deck_fixtures_v1_2_0.py line 149, tempfile.mkdtemp, never removed), left by every run of the Deck chapter check; the same leak is named in the briefs' DISK paragraph for /tmp/sen0401_page_test_*. 16 folders older than 30 minutes were removed by the lineage agent to continue; 18 recent ones were left in case executors were running. AFFECTED: two new tool files (fixtures v1_3_0, chapter check v1_4_0). NOT AFFECTED: the controlled criteria of the decks (they stay met), the old tool versions, every committed file. ESTIMATE (G120): 2.0 h plus 1.0 h verification." .

