    rdfs:label "Revision of the third lineage from the Scope stage: the repair of the temporary-folder leak of the Deck chapter check"@en ;
    backlog:revisesLineage ex:Lineage3 ; backlog:revisesFromStage backlog:Stage_Scope ;
    rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_TmpLeak, ex:IA3_TmpLeak ;
    backlog:revisionReason "The change request ex:CR3_TmpLeak (Sunday 2026-10-25, decided by the lineage's own change route (gaps found are filled through change management in the active lineage; the coordinator relayed the owner's standing orders; nothing is waived)) adds a deliverable (the repair of the temporary-folder leak of the Deck chapter check); the lineage is in its closed Backlog stage, and a deliverable added to a closed scope statement is a revision from the Scope stage (ruling G127). The request and its assessment were recorded first. This version retracts the Scope, Goal, Objective and Backlog outputs and rebuilds nothing; the next four versions rebuild them one stage each, a sixth fills the last commit; the items already in the register, Done ones included, re-enter by admission and are not re-dated (L-112). The interim versions are the declared transition (G129)." ;
    backlog:retractsOutput ex:Out3_ScopeR16, ex:Out3_GoalR16, ex:Out3_ObjectiveR16, ex:Out3_BacklogR18 ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Builder ;
    backlog:revisedAtCommit "c83bee3" .
