ex:Rank52_ST_TmpCleanup a backlog:RICEScore ; rdfs:label "Ranking of Deck chapter check without temporary folders, 2026-10-25"@en ; backlog:scoredByMethod backlog:Method_RICE_DepFactor ;
    backlog:hasReach "14"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasImpact "2"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasConfidence "0.8"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasEffort "3.0"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasDepFactor "1"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:hasScoreValue "7.47"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:scoredAt "2026-10-25T11:58:49"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:isAveragedFromMembers false ;
    backlog:hasScoreRationale "RICE with dependency factor (BP-D10): score = Reach x Impact x Confidence / Effort = 14 x 2 x 0.8 / 3.0 = 7.47; the dependency factor 1 is recorded beside it and the ORDERING KEY is the score times the dependency factor = 7.47 (ties break in the owner's chapter order). Reach 14 chapters whose decks and research are checked by it, and every executor session sharing the disk. Impact 2 (high): a full disk stops all work and breaks control runs. Confidence 0.8. Effort 3.0 h: 2.0 h executor plus 1.0 h verification. DepFactor 1: no open prerequisite. FACTS: ex:CR3_TmpLeak, admitted by ex:SC3_Tmp (register v0.368.0): the Deck chapter check leaves /tmp/sen0401_fx_* folders (1.7 GB) and filled the root disk to 0 MB free, which crashed a control run (OSError 28). A repair re-ranks the open items (G147); a new dated record, no earlier score is edited." .
ex:Iter_32 rdfs:comment "Ranking of 2026-10-25T11:58:49 (BP-D10, RICE with dependency factor; the scores are the records ex:Rank52_*): 1. Deck chapter check without temporary folders (ordering key 7.47). The scale values (impact levels, the dependency factor 0.5) are stipulations of the method's scale and are disclosed as such."@en .

