ex:AC9_Ch12DeckRevise backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.374.0), deck of chapter 12, every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) deck standard check D1 to D12 on the corrected research, no slide From chapter 11: MET [deck standard check v1_1_0: every element D1 to D12 met, no NOT_MEASUR: verified -> SUMMARY PASS=12 FAIL=0 NOT_MEASURED=0 | failing: none RESULT PASS (exit 0); lineage agent's own check: no slide From chapter 11, no chapter-11-onl: verified -> decks: ['SEN0401_Ch12_MiningAndConsensus_3e_v1_0_0.pptx', 'SEN0401_Ch12_MiningAndConsensus_3e_v1_1_0.pptx', 'SEN0401_Ch12_MiningAndConsensus_3e_v2_0_0.pptx', 'SEN0401_Ch12_MiningAndConsensus_3e_v3_0_0.pptx', 'SEN0401_Ch12_MiningAndConsensus] | (2) overlap check, manifest, error-first scan, Deck chapter check: MET [deck overlap check v1_0_0: exit 0 (no overlap, nothing beyond the slid: verified -> RESULT CLEAN (0 findings); deck control check v1_1_0 manifest: order equals the order of the code: verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch12_v1_2_0.json | 22 examples | 22 code slides | deck SEN0401_Ch12_MiningAndConsensus_3e_v3_0_1.pptx | PASS order equals code-slide order, names unique, library files exist, hashes match where stated; error-first scan: no manifest example has a first output line that sta: verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch12_v1_2_0.json | 22 examples | error-first examples: [] RESULT PASS; Deck chapter check v1_3_0 (examples re-run, fixtures refused, layout, : verified -> deck: 03-materials/ch12/SEN0401_Ch12_MiningAndConsensus_3e_v3_0_1.pptx deck check: deck_check_v1_0_0.py deck_notes_check 1.0.0: 51 slides, 51 with notes written for the reader RESULT Deck/Ch12: PASS] | (3) arc check run and its refusals listed: MET [arc check v1_3_0 on the new deck: exit 0 (every refusal would be liste: verified -> sen0401_deck_arc_check 1.3.0 (chapter 12): 51 slides, sections [5, 11, 16, 22, 32, 39], story slides [10, 25, 45, 47], resources slide [50], notes 31..60 words (mean 47); 0 refusal(s), 0 warning(s)] | (4) no committed file edited: MET [no committed file is edited (every file of the executor's commits adde: verified -> nochange commits 6bc5a0b,d750831 | PASS every file of the commits was added, none modified or deleted]. RESULT: MET: all elements are met. The deck match check is not an element run here: the lecture export and page data of the chapter do not exist until its page task (Iteration 26). The slides were rendered (LibreOffice PDF, contact sheets of all slides) and read by the builder as a reading, not a tool result: cream scheme throughout, numbered slides, native charts, stories with picture and link strips. Not measured: the arc check v1_1_0 refuses this deck as it refuses the deck of chapter 8 (it demands a 26-slide standard); it is not an element of the criterion. Slide reading by the lineage agent (soffice render, 51 slides of v3_0_1, sheets 08-tooling/verify/iter24/ctl_revise12): numbered, native charts, four stories with link bars, concept cards with analogies, resources slide present; no slide From chapter 11 (own check noborrow: 0 such slides, 0 chapter-11-only concepts of three or more words on slides, v2_0_0 unchanged in git). Standard check D4 and D11 40 of 40 on the corrected research (bridge-verified, 8 checks verified, 0 unverified); arc check v1_3_0 on the new deck exit 0. Links: lineage agent's own curl re-check, 15 of 15 returned 200. The final deck is v3_0_1 (v3_0_0 stays committed as the intermediate that the arc check refused for two notes with five sentences; the new version fixed them and no check was changed). OWNER CONTENT DECISION still open and not decided by the lineage: three of the four story pictures of this chapter are stand-ins labelled on the slide (mining machine for block 840,000, fork in a road, taproot), the same as in v2_0_0; list with chapters 2 and 13. DISK: the executor removed stale /tmp/sen0401_fx_* and page_test_* folders older than 60 minutes (allowed by its brief) because the disk was full; the lineage agent had removed 16 older than 30 minutes earlier for the same reason; nothing of the lineage records lived in them (all records are in the repository and the logs are rerun). Executor disclosures kept: 11 old-taxonomy chapter 12 concepts kept as extra cards (51 concepts), 12 concept cards newly added; manifest versions v1_1_0 and v1_2_0 because slide numbers and the deck name changed; the deck match check, page test and story-layout probe are not part of this task." .
