ex:AC9_TmpCleanup backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.379.0), every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) v1_2_0 and v1_3_0 byte-identical: MET [verified -> sen0401_deck_fixtures_v1_2_0.py identical to its first commit: True sen0401_lineage_chapter_check_v1_3_0.py identical to its first commit: True sen0401_deck_fixtures_v1_3_0.py exists: True sen0401_lin] | (2) no new fx or hermit folder after the runs: MET [verified -> Deck/Ch09 exit 0 new folders: 0 Research/Ch09 exit 0 new folders: 0 RESULT noleak: PASS] | (3) old and new print equal lines and exit codes: MET [verified -> Deck/Ch09 old exit 0 new exit 0 lines equal: True (old run left 1 folders, removed) Deck/Ch12 old exit 0 new exit 0 lines equal: True (old run left 1 folders, removed) Research/Ch09 old exit 0 new exi] | (4) a fixture that must be refused is still refused: MET [verified -> fixtures run: exit 0 refused-and-accepted line: True new folders: 0 nonexistent deck: exit 1 new folders: 0 --keep: exit 0 new folders: 1 RESULT refuse: PASS] | (5) no committed file edited: MET [verified -> 14 files, not added: [] RESULT nochange: PASS]. RESULT: MET. Disclosures: the lineage agent's control runs of the old tools (v1_3_0) left 3 fx/hermit folders, removed by the check itself; the executor's own old-version comparison runs leaked 2 fx and 1 hermit folder and it removed fx/page_test folders older than 60 minutes. The brief names only fx and page_test folders; the lineage agent removed 237 older /tmp/hermit_* folders (older than 60 minutes, left by its own earlier runs of chapter check v1_3_0) as its own cleanup, 21 recent ones remain. Fixture file names inside the new fixtures tool still carry v1_2_0 (named by the executor; no effect on results). From now on the lineage control runs use chapter check v1_4_0." .
