ex:AC9_Ch05ArcPlan backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.383.0), every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) as many slides as the deck, same order: MET [verified -> deck_plan_v3_2_0.json 68 slides; SEN0401_Ch05_WalletRecovery_3e_v3_1_0.pptx 68 slides plan titles not found on the deck slide of the same number: [] last slide real background: FAF6EF | plan bg of the] | (2) no refusal for a missing kind or section, the remaining ones listed: MET [verified -> sen0401_deck_arc_check 1.3.0 (chapter 05): 68 slides, sections [7, 12, 19, 31, 43, 53, 57], story slides [5, 20, 56], resources slide [67], notes 24..44 words (mean 34); 10 refusal(s), 0 warning(s)   ] | (3) deck, old plan and committed files unchanged: MET [verified -> 03-materials/ch05/SEN0401_Ch05_WalletRecovery_3e_v3_1_0.pptx True 08-tooling/ch05-deck/deck_plan_v3_1_0.json True 08-tooling/sen0401_deck_arc_check_v1_3_0.py True files modified or deleted since the r]. RESULT: MET. The plan file is controlled; the ten refusals that remain are findings about the delivered deck v3_1_0 (last slide light not dark; agenda range at slide 65 not at a section slide; slide 66 not a summary slide; six Everyday pictures slides without takeaway strip; notes of slides 13, 21 and 65 over the limit) and are carried, not hidden: they are admitted through change management as a chapter 5 deck fix story. Disclosures of the executor: slide 68 bg light copied from the deck, not forced dark; its nochange log's git diff --stat HEAD~1 HEAD section shows another session's commit (shared tree); its first derive run missed the resources slide and was fixed before commit. The lineage agent's own check read the real deck: 68 slides, plan titles equal the deck slide titles in order, last slide background FAF6EF = plan bg light." .
