ex:CR3_Ch05DeckFix a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the ten arc-check findings about the chapter 5 deck, as a new deck version and plan"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Retro24 ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the executor of TK_Ch05_ArcPlan_Build (commits 635eed8, 67e8fc6) and confirmed by the lineage agent in the control of the plan (register v0.383.0): with the new plan file 08-tooling/ch05-deck/deck_plan_v3_2_0.json (68 slides, as many as the delivered deck v3_1_0, same order) the arc check v1_3_0 on chapter 5 prints 10 refusals, 0 warnings, exit 1, and no longer refuses a missing kind or section. The 10 refusals are findings about the delivered deck: (1) the last slide 68 is light (FAF6EF), not the dark closing slide; (2) the agenda range that starts at slide 65 does not start at a section slide (sections 7, 12, 19, 31, 43, 53, 57; slide 65 is the summary, 66 the check, 67 the resources); (3) six slides titled 'Everyday pictures' (15, 30, 40, 42, 51, 52) have no takeaway strip; (4) slide 66 'Check yourself' is not a summary slide; (5) the notes of slides 13, 21 and 65 are outside the limit of 2 to 4 sentences and 100 words (5, 5 and 6 sentences). None of these is an element of the criteria the chapter 5 deck was controlled on, so that control stays met; the findings are carried openly, not waived. Gaps are said openly and are not waived; they are filled through change management in the active lineage. Pending until the ScopeChange of the revision that admits the story into Iteration 33." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .

ex:IA3_Ch05DeckFix a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "What the chapter 5 deck repair costs and what it touches"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR3_Ch05DeckFix ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the executor of TK_Ch05_ArcPlan_Build (commits 635eed8, 67e8fc6) and confirmed by the lineage agent in the control of the plan (register v0.383.0): with the new plan file 08-tooling/ch05-deck/deck_plan_v3_2_0.json (68 slides, as many as the delivered deck v3_1_0, same order) the arc check v1_3_0 on chapter 5 prints 10 refusals, 0 warnings, exit 1, and no longer refuses a missing kind or section. The 10 refusals are findings about the delivered deck: (1) the last slide 68 is light (FAF6EF), not the dark closing slide; (2) the agenda range that starts at slide 65 does not start at a section slide (sections 7, 12, 19, 31, 43, 53, 57; slide 65 is the summary, 66 the check, 67 the resources); (3) six slides titled 'Everyday pictures' (15, 30, 40, 42, 51, 52) have no takeaway strip; (4) slide 66 'Check yourself' is not a summary slide; (5) the notes of slides 13, 21 and 65 are outside the limit of 2 to 4 sentences and 100 words (5, 5 and 6 sentences). None of these is an element of the criteria the chapter 5 deck was controlled on, so that control stays met; the findings are carried openly, not waived. AFFECTED: a new deck and a new plan file. NOT AFFECTED: the controlled criteria of the decks (they stay met), the delivered deck, the old plans, every committed file. ESTIMATE (G120): 4.0 h plus 1.0 h verification." .

