ex:AC9_Template backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.394.0): (1) 9.52.2 byte-identical (SHA-256 before and after): MET [verified -> 9.52.2 identical to its first commit: True 9.52.3 SHA-256 44bcb3e7b29a4917b8673c5cf08e79bd516a66ad3e21e4985a3884918f98564d matches the reported 44bcb3e7...564d: True RESULT sha: PASS] | (2) the diff against 9.52.2 is limited to the story rules: MET [verified -> 4 changed lines; not a story rule: none RESULT diff: PASS] | (3) scratch pages of chapters 5 to 8 pass the story layout probe: MET [verified -> chapter 05 page 9_83_0 build exit 0 | CHECKS 9, FAILED 0 RESULT: PASS chapter 06 page 9_83_0 build exit 0 | CHECKS 12, FAILED 0 RESULT: PASS chapter 07 page 9_84_0 build exit 0 | CHECKS 9, FAILED 0 RE] | (4) regression: page tests at or above the stored results: MET [verified -> ch01 page 9_70_0 test 9_34_1: widgets (122, 122), features 186, gates 6, skips 0, FAIL 0 | stored (page-gates-evidence/regression/R16_9_34_1_ch01_9_70_0.full.log): widgets 122, features 186, gates 6, ] | (5) no committed file is edited: NOT MET [NOT verified -> commits that MODIFIED a committed file of the template task: 3    8a1922f Page template 9.52.3, revision 4: story grid without :has() (the :has() selector made the main-thread budget of the page test ]. RESULT: NOT MET: (5) no committed file is edited. Element (5) is NOT MET and is named so: the executor edited its own committed template file three times after the first commit (fb1d9f8 revision 2, 36eeb95 revision 3, 8a1922f revision 4), each after a failed check (revision 2 shrank the story link chips to 12.8px/22px, breaking the floors of the page test 9.34.1 (14px text, 24px controls), four features failed on the scratch page of chapter 5; revision 3 used :has() and the main-thread budget failed twice, 218 ms and 305 ms; revision 4 removed :has() and passed; the disk full crashed the runs of chapters 1 and 10, rerun later), and the log of the first failed batch (the 12.8px failure) was deleted by the executor's own rm before it was saved; the line 1 comment of the template still says version 9.52.2. The executor disclosed all of this. The content of the final file (SHA-256 44bcb3e7...564d) meets elements (1) to (4) on the control's own runs: 9.52.2 unchanged, the diff limited to the story rules, the story layout probe PASS on scratch pages of chapters 5 to 8 built by the control, and seven page-test runs (9.37.0, 9.34.1, 9.35.1 on chapter 5; 9.34.1, 9.35.1 on chapters 1 and 10) at or above the stored results. Nothing is waived: the template task is Suspended, the criterion is not edited, and the template is delivered again as a new file that is never edited, by change management." .
