ex:AC9_Template9524 a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The page template 9.52.4 is the verified content of 9.52.3 as a new file, never edited"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Owner-directed work (ex:CR3_TemplateRedo, Sunday 2026-10-25, decided by the lineage's own change route (gaps found are filled through change management in the active lineage; the coordinator relayed the owner's standing orders; nothing is waived)). Given the templates 9.52.2 and 9.52.3 (both unchanged), when the NEW template 9.52.4 is made, then ALL of: (1) 9.52.2 and 9.52.3 are byte-identical (SHA-256 before and after: 9089403f...73db and 44bcb3e7...564d); (2) 9.52.4 is added in one commit, is byte-identical to 9.52.3, and no later commit modifies it (git log --diff-filter=M over it is empty); (3) scratch pages of chapters 1, 5, 6, 7, 8 and 10 built with the page builder v4_15_0 from 9.52.4 are byte-identical to those built from 9.52.3, so the regression results of the control of 9.52.3 hold for the same bytes, and the story layout probe v1_0_0 on the scratch pages of chapters 5 to 8 gives RESULT PASS; (4) no committed file is edited; results as printed; if any element fails the template is named failing. MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the lineage agent in the control of the template task (register v0.394.0, tool sen0401_template_control_check_v1_0_0.py): the committed file 08-tooling/course_page_template_v9_52_3.html was EDITED by its executor three times after its first commit (fb1d9f8, 36eeb95, 8a1922f; revisions 2, 3, 4), each after a failed check, instead of being made as new versions, and the log of its first failed batch was deleted before it was saved; the executor disclosed this. The rule is that a committed file is never edited, and element (5) of the criterion AC9_Template says so; it is NOT MET, as the control of the page 9.82.0 of chapter 5 named an appended log not met. The other four elements are met by the content of the final file (SHA-256 44bcb3e7...564d): 9.52.2 unchanged, the diff limited to the story rules, the story layout probe PASS on the scratch pages of chapters 5 to 8, the regression on the scratch pages of chapters 5, 1 and 10 at or above the stored results. Nothing is waived: the template task is Suspended, and the template is delivered again as a NEW file that is never edited." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS_PageBuilder415, ex:TS_StoryLayoutProbe ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "page template 9.52.4; page builder v4_15_0; story layout probe v1_0_0" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new files cited by SHA-256, the logs of the runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
