ex:Rank56_ST_Template_9524 a backlog:RICEScore ; rdfs:label "Ranking of Page template 9.52.4 as a new file, 2026-10-25"@en ; backlog:scoredByMethod backlog:Method_RICE_DepFactor ;
    backlog:hasReach "14"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasImpact "2"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasConfidence "0.8"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasEffort "2.0"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasDepFactor "1"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:hasScoreValue "11.20"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:scoredAt "2026-10-25T16:37:47"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:isAveragedFromMembers false ;
    backlog:hasScoreRationale "RICE with dependency factor (BP-D10): score = Reach x Impact x Confidence / Effort = 14 x 2 x 0.8 / 2.0 = 11.20; the dependency factor 1 is recorded beside it and the ORDERING KEY is the score times the dependency factor = 11.20 (ties break in the owner's chapter order). Reach 14 chapters: every page rebuild of Iterations 25 to 28 waits for it. Impact 2 (high): it blocks all page work. Confidence 0.8. Effort 2.0 h: 1.5 h executor plus 0.5 h verification. DepFactor 1: no open prerequisite. FACTS: ex:CR3_TemplateRedo, admitted by ex:SC3_TemplateRedo: the control of the page template 9.52.3 (register v0.394.0) found the committed template file edited three times by its executor (element 5 not met); the page items of 14 chapters wait for a template. A repair re-ranks the open items (G147); a new dated record, no earlier score is edited." .
ex:ST_Template_9524 backlog:hasPriorityScore ex:Rank56_ST_Template_9524 .
ex:Iter_34 rdfs:comment "Ranking of 2026-10-25T16:37:47 (BP-D10, RICE with dependency factor; the scores are the records ex:Rank56_*): 1. Page template 9.52.4 as a new file (ordering key 11.20). The scale values (impact levels, the dependency factor 0.5) are stipulations of the method's scale and are disclosed as such."@en .

