ex:Del3_Ch05DeckFix2 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ;
    rdfs:label "The chapter 5 deck made to meet the arc check v1_3_0, as a new deck and plan"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "the research behind it and an interactive page"^^xsd:string ;
    backlog:hasDeliverableText "New files: the chapter 5 deck v3_2_0 and the plan v3_3_0. MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the lineage agent (register v0.404.0, after the executor of TK_Ch05_DeckFix_Build stopped without committing): (A) THE GATES CONTRADICT: the arc check v1_3_0 rule 1 refuses a last slide that is not the dark closing slide (it tests the plan's declaration kind closing and bg dark), and the deck standard check v1_1_0 element D9 (one background scheme, the owner's rule against switching dark and light) fails a deck with one dark slide among light ones (1 dark, 67 light, 1 switch). The decks of chapters 4, 6, 8, 12, 13 and 14 pass both only because their plans DECLARE bg dark for a last slide that is really light (FAF6EF); the plan of chapter 5 v3_2_0 declares it as it is (light), so the arc check refuses it. No deck can satisfy both gates with true declarations. A gate is not changed without the owner's explicit word (scope exclusion): the contradiction is recorded as the pending change request ex:CR3_GateArcDark and is carried, not worked around. (B) THE NEW PLAN BROKE ANOTHER CHECK: the plan file deck_plan_v3_2_0.json (control of TK_Ch05_ArcPlan_Build, register v0.384.0) is in the arc check's schema but dropped fields that the deck check, the picture check and the fixtures tool read from the NEWEST plan file (picture names, chart items, expressions): the Deck chapter check v1_4_0 on chapter 5 fails the part fixtures of every owner check refused (FAILED ok_image_reencoded, stale_chart, stale_expr, stale_image_swap; with the plan v3_2_0 hidden the same tool says every stale fixture refused, the control accepted). The control of that task did not run the chapter check; this is stated as a gap of the lineage's control and carried by this story. (C) THE REMAINING ARC FINDINGS (10 refusals with the plan v3_2_0): six slides without takeaway strip (15, 30, 40, 42, 51, 52), notes of slides 13, 21, 65 over the limit, the agenda range at slide 65 and the summary slide not immediately before the resources slide (the summary comes before the resources slide, after the check yourself slide)." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area3_Remedy56 ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
ex:Scope3 backlog:requiresDeliverable ex:Del3_Ch05DeckFix2 ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Ch05DeckFix2 .
