ex:Rank57_ST_Ch05_DeckFix2 a backlog:RICEScore ; rdfs:label "Ranking of Chapter 5 deck accepted by every check but the contradicting arc rule, 2026-10-25"@en ; backlog:scoredByMethod backlog:Method_RICE_DepFactor ;
    backlog:hasReach "1"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasImpact "1"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasConfidence "0.8"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasEffort "5.0"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasDepFactor "1"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:hasScoreValue "0.16"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:scoredAt "2026-10-25T16:41:54"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:isAveragedFromMembers false ;
    backlog:hasScoreRationale "RICE with dependency factor (BP-D10): score = Reach x Impact x Confidence / Effort = 1 x 1 x 0.8 / 5.0 = 0.16; the dependency factor 1 is recorded beside it and the ORDERING KEY is the score times the dependency factor = 0.16 (ties break in the owner's chapter order). Reach 1 chapter. Impact 1 (medium): the Deck chapter check on chapter 5 FAILS now (the plan v3_2_0 broke its fixtures part), so the delivered deck cannot be re-controlled; plus the open arc findings. Confidence 0.8. Effort 5.0 h: 4.0 h executor plus 1.0 h verification. DepFactor 1: no open prerequisite. FACTS: ex:CR3_Ch05DeckFix2: the first attempt was withdrawn because the arc check rule 1 contradicts the deck standard D9; the new plan file broke the fixtures part of the Deck chapter check on chapter 5; the remaining arc findings are open. A repair re-ranks the open items (G147); a new dated record, no earlier score is edited." .
ex:ST_Ch05_DeckFix2 backlog:hasPriorityScore ex:Rank57_ST_Ch05_DeckFix2 .
ex:Iter_35 rdfs:comment "Ranking of 2026-10-25T16:41:54 (BP-D10, RICE with dependency factor; the scores are the records ex:Rank57_*): 1. Chapter 5 deck accepted by every check but the contradicting arc rule (ordering key 0.16). The scale values (impact levels, the dependency factor 0.5) are stipulations of the method's scale and are disclosed as such."@en .

