ex:AC9_ArcFix_Ch10 backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.416.0), every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) arc check v1_3_0 on the new deck exits 0: MET [verified -> sen0401_deck_arc_check 1.3.0 (chapter 10): 49 slides, sections [5, 12, 30], story slides [17, 25, 37, 42, 45], resources slide [48], notes 33..59 words (mean 48); 0 refusal(s), 0 warning(s)] | (2) deck standard, overlap, manifest, error-first scan and Deck chapter check: MET [verified -> sen0401_deck_standard_check v1.1.0 | python-pptx 1.0.2 | chapter 10 | deck 03-materials/ch10/SEN0401_Ch10_TheBitcoinNetwork_3e_v2_1_0.pptx FACTS slides=49 code_slides=22 native_charts=9 analogies=67 l; verified -> RESULT CLEAN (0 findings); verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch10_v1_0_0.json | 22 examples | 22 code slides | deck SEN0401_Ch10_TheBitcoinNetwork_3e_v2_0_0.pptx | PASS order equals code-slide order, names unique, library files exist, hash; verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch10_v1_0_0.json | 22 examples | error-first examples: [] RESULT PASS; verified -> deck: 03-materials/ch10/SEN0401_Ch10_TheBitcoinNetwork_3e_v2_1_0.pptx deck check: deck_check_v1_0_0.py 22 examples re-run on 49 slides; 0 mismatch(es) stale fixtures: ['fixture_stale_expr_v1_0_0.pptx'] | (3) the delivered deck and every committed file unchanged: MET [verified -> nochange commits e11882b,e2b2fb7 | PASS every file of the commits was added, none modified or deleted]. RESULT: MET. Reading of the changed slides 7 and 15 (by the lineage agent, from the files): the shapes and texts of all 49 slides of v2_1_0 equal those of v2_0_0 (type, position and text of every shape compared); only the notes of slides 7, 10, 15, 16, 18, 22, 27, 35 and 36 differ, each merged into 2 to 4 sentences with the same facts and the pointer to its chapter code example kept (slide 7: version and verack in one sentence; slide 15: addrv2 joined to the addr sentence). The deck v2_1_0 supersedes v2_0_0 (kept, unchanged); the manifest is unchanged and its deck field names v2_0_0 (slide numbers identical), so the manifest check read the 2.0.0 deck. Disclosures of the executor: a first draft of the slide 15 note had 61 words (D7 limit 60) and was discarded uncommitted; no visible version text on the slides. FINDING outside this criterion, carried openly: the story check v1_0_0 on the chapter 10 deck prints 1 refusal (BloomFiltersLeak: the READ link's host eprint.iacr.org is on no slide) and 1 warning (no story marked money_picture); the baseline line charset=1 tab=False is the old page of chapter 10 (no chapter-code tab, retrofit planned in Iteration 26). The refusal is admitted through change management with the same finding on the decks of chapters 12 and 14." .
