ex:CR3_StoryLink a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "The READ-link hosts missing on the story slides of the decks of chapters 10, 12 and 14"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Retro24 ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the lineage agent (register v0.417.0, running the story check v1_0_0 on the decks of all fourteen chapters while controlling the chapter 10 deck): the story check refuses three delivered decks because the host of a story's READ link is on no slide, so the live further-reading link is not visible on the material itself (the owner's rule for stories: a live further-reading link on the material itself): chapter 10, story BloomFiltersLeak, host eprint.iacr.org; chapter 12, story HashcashBeforeBitcoin, host web.archive.org; chapter 14, story SpillmanChannels, host web.archive.org. The story check is not an element of the criteria these decks were controlled on, so those controls stay met; the finding is carried, not hidden. Chapter 1 shows a different refusal (StoneMoney: no slide carries the date and the picture credit together), which its retrofit story already covers. Gaps are said openly and are not waived; they are filled through change management in the active lineage. Pending until the ScopeChange of the revision that admits the three stories into Iteration 36." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .

ex:IA3_StoryLink a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
