    backlog:hasImpactStatement "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the lineage agent (register v0.417.0, running the story check v1_0_0 on the decks of all fourteen chapters while controlling the chapter 10 deck): the story check refuses three delivered decks because the host of a story's READ link is on no slide, so the live further-reading link is not visible on the material itself (the owner's rule for stories: a live further-reading link on the material itself): chapter 10, story BloomFiltersLeak, host eprint.iacr.org; chapter 12, story HashcashBeforeBitcoin, host web.archive.org; chapter 14, story SpillmanChannels, host web.archive.org. The story check is not an element of the criteria these decks were controlled on, so those controls stay met; the finding is carried, not hidden. Chapter 1 shows a different refusal (StoneMoney: no slide carries the date and the picture credit together), which its retrofit story already covers. AFFECTED: a new deck and a new plan file. NOT AFFECTED: the controlled criteria of the decks (they stay met), the delivered deck, the old plans, every committed file. ESTIMATE (G120): 4.0 h plus 1.0 h verification." .

