ex:CR3_StoryLink2 a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "The chapter 14 deck: the READ-link host of its story and the notes the arc check refuses"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Retro24 ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the executor of TK_Deck14_StoryLink_Build (who stopped without committing) and confirmed by the lineage agent (register v0.428.0): the arc check v1_3_0 on the delivered chapter 14 deck v2_0_0 exits 1: 'REFUSED 3 of 47 slides have notes outside the short reader's-prose limit (2 to 4 sentences, 100 words) (longest: slide 22 with 54 words; slides [22, 40, 42])' - 5 sentences each. The lineage had never run the arc check on this deck (no log exists), and the brief of the first story wrongly said it exits 0 as before: an error of the lineage agent. The first story ST_Deck14_StoryLink is withdrawn. The story check v1_0_0 still refuses the story SpillmanChannels (the READ link's host web.archive.org is on no slide), which the executor's uncommitted deck v2_0_1 already answers (visible host text beside the live link; the archive link is not clickable and not verified: web.archive.org is unreachable from the build machine). Gaps are said openly and are not waived; they are filled through change management in the active lineage. Pending until the ScopeChange of the revision that admits the story into Iteration 37." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .

ex:IA3_StoryLink2 a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "What the chapter 5 deck repair costs and what it touches"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR3_StoryLink2 ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the executor of TK_Deck14_StoryLink_Build (who stopped without committing) and confirmed by the lineage agent (register v0.428.0): the arc check v1_3_0 on the delivered chapter 14 deck v2_0_0 exits 1: 'REFUSED 3 of 47 slides have notes outside the short reader's-prose limit (2 to 4 sentences, 100 words) (longest: slide 22 with 54 words; slides [22, 40, 42])' - 5 sentences each. The lineage had never run the arc check on this deck (no log exists), and the brief of the first story wrongly said it exits 0 as before: an error of the lineage agent. The first story ST_Deck14_StoryLink is withdrawn. The story check v1_0_0 still refuses the story SpillmanChannels (the READ link's host web.archive.org is on no slide), which the executor's uncommitted deck v2_0_1 already answers (visible host text beside the live link; the archive link is not clickable and not verified: web.archive.org is unreachable from the build machine). AFFECTED: a new deck and a new plan file. NOT AFFECTED: the controlled criteria of the decks (they stay met), the delivered deck, the old plans, every committed file. ESTIMATE (G120): 4.0 h plus 1.0 h verification." .

