ex:AC9_StoryLink2_Ch14 a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The chapter 14 deck is accepted by the story check v1_0_0 and the arc check v1_3_0 as a new version and stays met on its earlier checks"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Owner-directed work (ex:CR3_StoryLink2, Sunday 2026-10-25, decided by the lineage's own change route (gaps found are filled through change management in the active lineage; the coordinator relayed the owner's standing orders; nothing is waived)). Given the chapter 14 deck v2_0_0 delivered (unchanged), when a NEW deck version and a NEW plan are made, then ALL of: (1) the story check v1_0_0 on chapter 14 prints no refusal; (2) the arc check v1_3_0 on chapter 14 exits 0 with no refusal; (3) the deck standard check v1_1_0, overlap check, deck control check manifest, error-first scan and Deck chapter check v1_4_0 (every part, with the newest plan) exit 0; (4) the delivered deck and every committed file are unchanged (nochange); results as printed; if any element fails the deck is named failing. The visible host text beside a live link is what the story check measures; that the archive link itself is not clickable and not verified is stated, not hidden. MEASURED 2026-10-25 by the executor of TK_Deck14_StoryLink_Build (who stopped without committing) and confirmed by the lineage agent (register v0.428.0): the arc check v1_3_0 on the delivered chapter 14 deck v2_0_0 exits 1: 'REFUSED 3 of 47 slides have notes outside the short reader's-prose limit (2 to 4 sentences, 100 words) (longest: slide 22 with 54 words; slides [22, 40, 42])' - 5 sentences each. The lineage had never run the arc check on this deck (no log exists), and the brief of the first story wrongly said it exits 0 as before: an error of the lineage agent. The first story ST_Deck14_StoryLink is withdrawn. The story check v1_0_0 still refuses the story SpillmanChannels (the READ link's host web.archive.org is on no slide), which the executor's uncommitted deck v2_0_1 already answers (visible host text beside the live link; the archive link is not clickable and not verified: web.archive.org is unreachable from the build machine)." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS_ArcCheck13, ex:TS_ChapterCheck, ex:TS_DeckStdCheck11 ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "story check v1_0_0; arc check v1_3_0; deck standard check v1_1_0; deck overlap check v1_0_0; deck control check v1_1_0; Deck chapter check v1_4_0 (system python3, python-pptx)" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new files cited by SHA-256, the logs of the runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC9J_StoryLink2_Ch14_Passes, ex:TC9J_StoryLink2_Ch14_NotClaimed .
