ex:Rank59_ST_Deck14_StoryLink2 a backlog:RICEScore ; rdfs:label "Ranking of Chapter 14 deck accepted by the story check and the arc check, 2026-10-25"@en ; backlog:scoredByMethod backlog:Method_RICE_DepFactor ;
    backlog:hasReach "1"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasImpact "0.5"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasConfidence "0.8"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasEffort "3.5"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasDepFactor "1"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:hasScoreValue "0.11"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:scoredAt "2026-10-25T17:03:02"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:isAveragedFromMembers false ;
    backlog:hasScoreRationale "RICE with dependency factor (BP-D10): score = Reach x Impact x Confidence / Effort = 1 x 0.5 x 0.8 / 3.5 = 0.11; the dependency factor 1 is recorded beside it and the ORDERING KEY is the score times the dependency factor = 0.11 (ties break in the owner's chapter order). Reach 1 chapter. Impact 0.5 (low): the deck meets its criterion; one story shows no link host and three notes are over the limit. Confidence 0.8. Effort 3.5 h: 2.5 h executor plus 1.0 h verification. DepFactor 1: no open prerequisite. FACTS: ex:CR3_StoryLink2: the first chapter 14 story was withdrawn because the arc check v1_3_0 refuses the notes of slides 22, 40 and 42 of the delivered deck; the story check refuses the READ-link host of SpillmanChannels. A repair re-ranks the open items (G147); a new dated record, no earlier score is edited." .
ex:ST_Deck14_StoryLink2 backlog:hasPriorityScore ex:Rank59_ST_Deck14_StoryLink2 .
ex:Iter_37 rdfs:comment "Ranking of 2026-10-25T17:03:02 (BP-D10, RICE with dependency factor; the scores are the records ex:Rank59_*): 1. Chapter 14 deck accepted by the story check and the arc check (ordering key 0.11). The scale values (impact levels, the dependency factor 0.5) are stipulations of the method's scale and are disclosed as such."@en .

