f 15,30,40,42,51,52,65-68: tables readable, one light scheme, no overflow; closing slide light (D9 kept). Carried gate contradiction: arc check refuses the single closing-slide dark rule (CR3_GateArcDark pending); fixtures/chapter-check parts pass." .
