ex:AC9_Page_Ch06 backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-25 (record v0.455.0), every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) charset check exits 0: MET [verified -> PASS /home/claude/sen0401/03-materials/ch06/page/sen0401_ch06_page_v9_84_0.html: tag at byte 37; first 1024 bytes decode as UTF-8 RESULT charset: PASS] | (2) page tests 9.37.0, 9.34.1, 9.35.1 at the stored results or better: MET [verified -> ch06 9_84_0 test 9_37_0 run ctl_ch06_page_9_84_0_test_9_37_0.full.log : widgets (121, 121) features 199 gates 6 skips 0 FAIL 0 [] | stored page 9_83_0 (121, 199, 6, 0) -> ok   verdict of 9_37_0 = the ] | (3) story layout probe PASS on every story at three viewports: MET [verified -> ive top 260.359375, images 1 PASS story 3 at 1366x768: photo height 199 of 768, narrative top 305.09375, images 1 PASS story 4 at 1366x768: photo height 129 of 768, narrative top 283, images 1 PASS st] | (4) chapter-code tab equals the manifest, slides equal the deck: MET [verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch06_v1_1_0.json 18 examples; page tab 18 ; order, name, code, slide, expected equal (fields compared: the keys the page tab carries and the manifest has): True newest deck SEN04] | (5) Stage 4 gates, chapter checks Research, Deck and Page, deck match, deck links carried: MET [verified -> sourced (tier-C residual: fluent-filler-with-source not caught) [PASS       ] Stage3.src: 116 real-sourced, 0 invalid (generator-stamp/absent) [PASS       ] Stage4.A: 2400 triples [PASS       ] Stage4; verified -> t                                                PASS   HermiT consistent                                            PASS RESULT Research/Ch06: PASS * Owlready2 * Running HermiT...     java -Xmx2000M ; verified -> e fixture refused, the control accepted SEN0401_Ch06_Transactions_3e_v2_1_0.pptx: 62 slides, 10.00 x 5.62 in   text frames estimated to overflow their box: 0   shapes reaching outside the slide: 0   s; verified -> d:false};const dx=+tr[0],dy=+tr[1];const edges=[...svg.querySelectorAll('line[data-a]')].filter(e=>e.dataset.a===a.id||e.dataset.b===a.id);const ok=edges.every((e,i)=>{const end=a.mine[i][0],b=a.mine[; verified -> chapter 06 page 9_84_0: 18 items compared with lecture_v1_3_0.json and sen0401_ch06_stories_v1_2_0; not carried: 0 RESULT match: PASS; verified -> deck SEN0401_Ch06_Transactions_3e_v2_1_0.pptx : 14 hyperlinks; 0 address not in the page: [] RESULT links: PASS] | (6) page ABox and stored result are new files: MET [verified -> 03-materials/ch06/page/sen0401_ch06_page_abox_v9_84_0.ttl added by ['1d90dd5'] modified by [] 08-tooling/ch06-page/test_results_abox_v9_84_0.json added by ['9121b51'] modified by [] 03-materials/ch06/] | (7) no committed file is edited: MET [verified -> commits f6f6953,35024b2,9121b51,1d90dd5,7161ff0 | files not added: none RESULT nochange: PASS]. RESULT: MET. Control's own runs under /tmp/page_test.lock, serial. Page tests 9.37.0, 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 all exit 0 on the FIRST control run (121/121 widgets, no [FAIL], no skip, features and gates at or above the stored results of the page 9.83.0; no rerun was needed, every log kept). Story layout probe PASS (12 checks, 4 stories x 3 viewports, run by the control). Page reading (own screenshots at 1366x768 and 390x844 of stories 1, 2 and 4): photo capped beside the text, narrative begins on the first screen, WHO/WHERE/WHEN/READ rows and takeaway visible. Chapter check Page/Ch06 takes the newest page file (9.84.0, checked on disk); the test names the page before it (9.83.0) as the shipped page, which a test of 9.83.0 would not (9.82.0); the tool does not print the tested version itself. Chapter-code tab equals the manifest v1_1_0 (18 examples, fields order, name, code, slide) and the manifest's 18 code slides equal those of the newest deck v2_1_0. Deck match v1_0_0: 0 not carried. Link check: no link register for chapter 6 (pages_link_verify v1_0_0 serves chapters 8 to 14), so the control counted the 14 hyperlinks of the newest deck and found every address in the page; NO link was fetched, the live state is NOT verified. Stage 4 gates as printed (OVERALL PASS; the inventory gates NOT_MEASURED or CANNOT_RUN are outside the named gates). Control tool: the page control check v1_1_0 is a new file (v1_0_0 compared the five fields of chapter 5; chapter 6's manifest has no expected field and its stored 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 results come from verify/iter19/pages). The executor's commit f45a4fa for chapter 7 shares the checkout; nothing of it is touched." .
