s=[...svg.querySelectorAll('line[data-a]')].filter(e=>e.dataset.a===a.id||e.dataset.b===a.id);const ok=edges.every((e,i)=>{const end=a.mine[i][0],b=a.min; verified -> chapter 07 page 9_85_0: 21 items compared with lecture_v1_4_0.json and sen0401_ch07_stories_v1_2_0; not carried: 0 RESULT match: PASS; verified -> deck SEN0401_Ch07_AuthorizationAuthentication_3e_v2_2_0.pptx : 18 hyperlinks; 0 address not in the page: [] RESULT links: PASS] | (6) page ABox and stored result are new files: MET [verified -> 03-materials/ch07/page/sen0401_ch07_page_abox_v9_85_0.ttl added by ['57a445e'] modified by [] 08-tooling/ch07-page/test_results_abox_v9_85_0.json added by ['31e3a3f'] modified by [] 03-materials/ch07/] | (7) no committed file is edited: MET [verified -> commits f45a4fa,8805543,91e79fe,31e3a3f,57a445e,154a590 | files not added: none RESULT nochange: PASS]. RESULT: MET. Control's own runs under /tmp/page_test.lock, serial. Page tests 9.37.0, 9.34.1, 9.35.1 all exit 0 on the FIRST control run (no [FAIL], no skip, widgets/features/gates at or above the stored results of the page 9.84.0; no rerun needed; every log kept). Story layout probe PASS (9 checks, run by the control). Page reading (own screenshots at 1366x768 and 390x844 of stories 1 to 3): photo capped beside the text, narrative begins on the first screen, fact rows and takeaway visible. Chapter check Page/Ch07 takes the newest page file (9.85.0, checked on disk); the test names the page before it (9.84.0) as the shipped page, which a test of 9.84.0 would not (9.83.0); the tool does not print the tested version itself. Chapter-code tab equals the manifest v1_1_0 (15 examples) and its 15 code slides equal those of the newest deck v2_2_0; DISCLOSED: the manifest names deck v2_1_0 while the newest deck is v2_2_0. Deck match v1_0_0: 0 not carried. Link check: no link register for chapter 7; the control counted the 18 hyperlinks of the newest deck and found every address in the page; NO link was fetched, the live state