ex:AC9_Page_Ch08 backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-26 (record v0.460.0), every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) charset check exits 0: MET [verified -> PASS /home/claude/sen0401/03-materials/ch08/page/sen0401_ch08_page_v9_86_0.html: tag at byte 37; first 1024 bytes decode as UTF-8 RESULT charset: PASS] | (2) page tests 9.37.0, 9.34.1, 9.35.1 at the stored results or better: MET [verified -> ch08 9_86_0 test 9_37_0 run ctl_ch08_page_9_86_0_test_9_37_0.full.log : widgets (127, 127) features 197 gates 6 skips 0 FAIL 0 [] | stored page 9_85_0 (127, 197, 6, 0) -> ok   verdict of 9_37_0 = the ] | (3) story layout probe PASS on every story at three viewports: MET [verified -> page 03-materials/ch08/page/sen0401_ch08_page_v9_86_0.html PASS story 1 at 1366x768: photo height 199 of 768, narrative top 382.25, images 1 PASS story 2 at 1366x768: photo height 199 of 768, narrativ] | (4) chapter-code tab equals the manifest, slides equal the deck: MET [verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch08_v1_0_0.json 20 examples; page tab 20 ; order, name, code, slide, expected equal (fields compared: the keys the page tab carries and the manifest has): True newest deck SEN04] | (5) Stage 4 gates, chapter checks Research, Deck and Page, deck match, deck links carried: MET [verified -> sourced (tier-C residual: fluent-filler-with-source not caught) [PASS       ] Stage3.src: 128 real-sourced, 0 invalid (generator-stamp/absent) [PASS       ] Stage4.A: 2728 triples [PASS       ] Stage4; verified -> gates                                         PASS   corpus claims executed                                       PASS   verify script                                                PASS   HermiT cons; verified -> ture refused, the control accepted SEN0401_Ch08_DigitalSignatures_3e_v2_0_0.pptx: 51 slides, 10.00 x 5.62 in   text frames estimated to overflow their box: 0   shapes reaching outside the slide: 0   s; verified -> d:false};const dx=+tr[0],dy=+tr[1];const edges=[...svg.querySelectorAll('line[data-a]')].filter(e=>e.dataset.a===a.id||e.dataset.b===a.id);const ok=edges.every((e,i)=>{const end=a.mine[i][0],b=a.mine[; verified -> chapter 08 page 9_86_0: 17 items compared with lecture_v2_0_0.json and sen0401_ch08_stories_v1_2_0; not carried: 0 RESULT match: PASS; verified -> deck SEN0401_Ch08_DigitalSignatures_3e_v2_0_0.pptx : 14 hyperlinks; 0 address not in the page: [] RESULT links: PASS] | (6) page ABox and stored result are new files: MET [verified -> 03-materials/ch08/page/sen0401_ch08_page_abox_v9_86_0.ttl added by ['bf15c93'] modified by [] 08-tooling/ch08-page/test_results_abox_v9_86_0.json added by ['3ed5806'] modified by [] 03-materials/ch08/] | (7) no committed file is edited: MET [verified -> commits cb6d9b7,1a9f5fa,3ed5806,bf15c93 | files not added: none RESULT nochange: PASS]. RESULT: MET. Control's own runs under /tmp/page_test.lock, serial. Page tests 9.37.0, 9.34.1, 9.35.1 all exit 0 on the FIRST control run (no [FAIL], no skip, widgets/features/gates at or above the stored results of the page 9.85.0; no rerun needed; every log kept). Story layout probe PASS (9 checks, run by the control). Page reading (own screenshots at 1366x768 and 390x844 of stories 1 to 3): narrative begins on the first screen at both widths; the Android story photograph is tall at 1366 but shorter than the viewport (probe PASS); stories 2 and 3 use a platform logo as a stand-in picture, which the page itself labels 'stand-in picture' (a weaker picture than a real photograph of the people or the event, not a failure of the criterion). Chapter check Page/Ch08 takes the newest page file (9.86.0, checked on disk); the test names the page before it (9.85.0) as the shipped page, which a test of 9.85.0 would not; the tool does not print the tested version itself. The executor disclosed that ITS Page/Ch08 run was made without the lock; mine was made under it. Chapter-code tab equals the manifest v1_0_0 (20 examples) and its 20 code slides equal those of the newest deck v2_0_0 (the manifest names the same deck). Deck match v1_0_0: 0 not carried. Link check: no link register for chapter 8 in the control's tool; the control counted the 14 hyperlinks of the newest deck and found every address in the page; NO link was fetched, the live state is NOT verified. Stage 4 gates as printed. Executor's own 9.37.0 and 9.34.1/9.35.1 feature counts differ from the stored 9.85.0 numbers only in the order the tool prints them; mine are compared to the stored logs in verify/iter23/pages." .
