ex:CR3_Ch01PageLinks a backlog:ChangeRequest ;
    rdfs:label "The chapter 1 page: the four deck hyperlinks of slide 19 that it does not carry"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo ex:Scope3 ; backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Retro24 ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "MEASURED 2026-10-26 by the lineage agent in the control of the chapter 1 page 9.72.0 (register v0.474.0), with the control's own deck-link check (sen0401_page_control_check_v1_4_0.py ... links): the newest chapter 1 deck v3_1_0 carries 26 hyperlinks; 4 of them are NOT in the page 9.72.0: the Source links of the Kenya, Cyprus, Greece and Venezuela cases on slide 19 (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M-Pesa, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2012%E2%80%932013_Cypriot_financial_crisis, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greek_government-debt_crisis, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyperinflation_in_Venezuela); the fifth (Ukraine, nbclosangeles.com) is carried. The same links were not in the page 9.70.0 either and slide 19 held them in the deck v3_0_0, so the gap is old, not a regression. The deck match check v1_0_0 compares the READ cards and the resources slide only, so it cannot see it; the criterion AC9_Page_Ch01 does not name it, so the page 9.72.0 stays Done on its criterion. The chapters 2 and 5 to 8 pages carry every deck hyperlink (13 of 13, 18, 14, 18 and 14). Gaps are said openly and are not waived; they are filled through change management in the active lineage. Pending until the ScopeChange of the revision that admits the story into Iteration 38." ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .

