ex:AC9_Page_Ch11 backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-26 (record v0.497.0): (1) charset check exits 0: MET [verified -> PASS /home/claude/sen0401/03-materials/ch11/page/sen0401_ch11_page_v9_79_0.html: tag at byte 37; first 1024 bytes decode as UTF-8 RESULT charset: PASS] | (2) page tests 9.37.0, 9.34.1, 9.35.1 at the stored results or better: NOT MET [NOT verified -> Traceback (most recent call last):   File \"/home/claude/sen0401/08-tooling/sen0401_page_control_check_v1_5_0.py\", line 87, in <module>     else: ok = {\"charset\": charset, \"regr\": regr, \"probe\": probe,] | (3) story layout probe PASS on every story at three viewports: MET [verified -> ve top 278.125, images 1 PASS story 3 at 1366x768: photo height 199 of 768, narrative top 255.515625, images 1 PASS story 4 at 1366x768: photo height 199 of 768, narrative top 234.171875, images 1 PAS] | (4) chapter-code tab equals the manifest, slides equal the deck: MET [verified -> manifest chapter_code_ch11_v1_0_0.json 17 examples; page tab 17 ; order, name, code, slide, expected equal (fields compared: the keys the page tab carries and the manifest has): True newest deck SEN04] | (5) Stage 4 gates, chapter checks Research, Deck and Page, deck match, deck links carried: NOT MET [verified ->  sourced (tier-C residual: fluent-filler-with-source not caught) [PASS       ] Stage3.src: 92 real-sourced, 0 invalid (generator-stamp/absent) [PASS       ] Stage4.A: 2014 triples [PASS       ] Stage4; verified -> istent                                            PASS RESULT Research/Ch11: PASS * Owlready2 * Running HermiT...     java -Xmx2000M -cp /usr/local/lib/python3.13/dist-packages/owlready2/hermit:/usr/l; verified ->  fixture refused, the control accepted SEN0401_Ch11_TheBlockchain_3e_v2_0_0.pptx: 43 slides, 10.00 x 5.62 in   text frames estimated to overflow their box: 0   shapes reaching outside the slide: 0   s; NOT verified -> g click action       - waiting 100ms     58 × waiting for element to be visible, enabled and stable        - element is visible, enabled and stable        - scrolling into view if needed        - done; verified -> chapter 11 page 9_79_0: 19 items compared with lecture_v2_0_0.json and sen0401_ch11_stories_v1_2_0; not carried: 0 RESULT match: PASS; verified -> deck SEN0401_Ch11_TheBlockchain_3e_v2_0_0.pptx : 15 hyperlinks; 0 address not in the page: [] RESULT links: PASS] | (6) page ABox and stored result are new files: NOT MET [NOT verified -> 03-materials/ch11/page/sen0401_ch11_page_abox_v9_79_0.ttl added by [] modified by [] 08-tooling/ch11-page/test_results_abox_v9_79_0.json added by [] modified by [] 03-materials/ch11/page/sen0401_ch11_] | (7) no committed file is edited: MET [verified -> commits 8cfc35e,95b5833,06e8e67 | files not added: none RESULT nochange: PASS]. RESULT: NOT MET: (2) page tests 9.37.0, 9.34.1, 9.35.1 at the stored results or better; (5) Stage 4 gates, chapter checks Research, Deck and Page, deck match, deck links carried; (6) page ABox and stored result are new files. PAGE NAMED FAILING. Measured by the control: the page 9.79.0 (newest page file; the page test names 9_78_0 as the shipped page) makes the page tests 9.37.0, 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 stop in the control's own runs under the lock, each exit 1, RESULT FAIL (ctl_page11 logs kept); the click log names the entity box of HeaderFields intercepting the tap on BlockContainer. Cause measured by the ERD collision probe v1_0_0 (a new probe by the lineage agent; file 08-tooling/sen0401_erd_collision_probe_v1_0_0.py, output of every chapter's newest page in 08-tooling/verify/iter32/erd_collision_probe_all_newest_pages.txt): ch11 page 9.79.0 COLLISION (16 entities, element on top of BlockContainer is HeaderFields); the pages of chapters 1 to 10 CLEAR; the older pages of chapters 12, 13, 14 CLEAR but not built on the rebuild layout. Deck-link check: the newest deck v2_0_0 has 15 hyperlinks, all 15 carried by the page (the executor reported 13 of 13). Also measured and met: charset, codetab, probe 12 of 12 (stories 1 to 4 start the narrative at 349 to 524 px of 844), Stage 4, Research and Deck chapter checks, deck match 0 not carried. NOT met: the page tests (all three), the Page chapter check (it runs the page test), and element (6): the page ABox and the stored result do not exist because the executor stopped before Stage 4 page ABox and results. Nothing is waived; the template repair and the page rebuild are routed in the change request CR3_TemplateErd (Iteration 39). The page 9.79.0 stays as delivered and failing; no committed file is edited. No link fetched, live link state not verified." .
