ex:AC9_Template9525 backlog:hasAuditNote "Control 2026-10-26 (record v0.510.0), every element run by the evidence bridge and recorded as printed: (1) 9.52.2 to 9.52.4 unchanged by content: MET [verified -> 9.52.2 9089403fc9b963e44da7446bd5330996fad867d35498ecd542d75a374c0673db 9.52.3 44bcb3e7b29a4917b8673c5cf08e79bd516a66ad3e21e4985a3884918f98564d 9.52.4 44bcb3e7b29a4917b8673c5cf08e79bd516a66ad3e21e4985] | (2) 9.52.5 added in one commit, never modified, diff limited to the ERD drag code: MET [verified -> added by ['7f87646'] | modified by [] RESULT nomod: PASS; verified -> +function erdSettle(k){const BW=ERD.mode==='schema'?160:170,M=12,hgt=q=>30+OE_ENT[q].attrs.length*16+10;const o=Object.keys(OE_ENT).filter(q=>q!==k).map(q=>({l:OE_ENT[q].x,t:OE_ENT[q].y,r:OE_ENT[q].x+] | (3) scratch pages from 9.52.5 differ from those of 9.52.4 only by that code: MET [verified -> chapter 01 9_72_0 builds exit 0 0 | changed lines 3 | not in the template diff: 0 chapter 05 9_84_0 builds exit 0 0 | changed lines 3 | not in the template diff: 0 chapter 06 9_84_0 builds exit 0 0 | ] | (4) ERD collision probe clear on chapters 1, 5 to 11 and colliding on the 9.52.4 control: MET [verified -> sen0401_ch01_page_v9_72_0.html entities 21, box width 92 to 107, target Cryptography, element on top at its centre: Cryptography -> CLEAR sen0401_ch05_page_v9_84_0.html entities 18, box width 109 to 1] | (5) page tests at the stored results, story layout probe PASS: MET [verified -> ch10 scratch page 9_80_0 on 9.52.5, test 9_37_0 : widgets (86, 86) features 197 gates 6 skips 0 FAIL 0 | stored page 9.80.0 (86, 197, 6, 0) -> ok ch10 scratch page 9_80_0 on 9.52.5, test 9_34_1 : widg; verified -> chapter 05 page 9_84_0 build exit 0 | CHECKS 9, FAILED 0 RESULT: PASS chapter 06 page 9_84_0 build exit 0 | CHECKS 12, FAILED 0 RESULT: PASS chapter 07 page 9_85_0 build exit 0 | CHECKS 9, FAILED 0 RE] | (6) no committed file is edited: MET [verified -> commits 7f87646,fc2835e | files not added: none RESULT nochange: PASS]. RESULT: MET. Control of the template 9.52.5, run by the lineage agent: SHA-256 of 9.52.2 and 9.52.3 equal the expected values, 9.52.4 equals 9.52.3 and equals its content before the executor's commits, 9.52.5 differs (1ce3a958...); 9.52.5 was added by one commit (7f87646) and modified by none; the diff 9.52.4 to 9.52.5 is 3 changed lines (one function erdSettle added, the drag-release handler changed to call it), all naming the ERD. My own builds with the page builder v4_15_0: pairs of the scratch pages of chapters 1, 5 to 10 (7 pairs, 14 builds) each differ by exactly those 3 lines. My own ERD collision probe (v1_0_0): CLEAR on the 9.52.5 pages of chapters 1, 5 to 10 and of chapter 11 (page 9_79_0 inputs; the element on top of BlockContainer is BlockContainer), and COLLISION on the chapter 11 page built from 9.52.4 (HeaderFields on BlockContainer), the control. Chapters 12 to 14 (their existing newest page data, v9_77_0, v9_69_0, v9_77_0): CLEAR from both templates, so no collision is measured there with the data that exists; the data of their rebuild (new lecture exports, manifests) does not exist yet, so the rebuilt pages are NOT measured and their own page tasks carry the collision probe check through their gates. My own page-test runs under the lock on the chapter 10 scratch page built from 9.52.5 (scratch tree of symlinks like the executor's, temp folders under /tmp/claude-0/ctl76tmp which are mine): 9.37.0, 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 exit 0, 86 of 86 widgets, 197/185/185 features, 6 gates, 0 skips, FAIL 0, equal to the stored results of the page 9.80.0. Story layout probe PASS on the 9.52.5 scratch pages of chapters 5 to 8 and 10 (9, 12, 9, 9, 15 checks). Executor disclosures noted: scratch tree of symlinks, wrong first probe call (discarded). Nothing is edited; no link fetched." .
