h11_TheBlockchain_3e_v2_0_0.pptx: 43 slides, 10.00 x 5.62 in   text frames estimated to overflow their box: 0   shapes reaching outside the slide: 0   s; verified -> ved:false};const dx=+tr[0],dy=+tr[1];const edges=[...svg.querySelectorAll('line[data-a]')].filter(e=>e.dataset.a===a.id||e.dataset.b===a.id);const ok=edges.every((e,i)=>{const end=a.mine[i][0],b=a.min; verified -> chapter 11 page 9_80_0: 19 items compared with lecture_v2_0_0.json and sen0401_ch11_stories_v1_2_0; not carried: 0 RESULT match: PASS; verified -> deck SEN0401_Ch11_TheBlockchain_3e_v2_0_0.pptx : 15 hyperlinks; 0 address not in the page: [] RESULT links: PASS] | (6) page ABox and stored result are new files: MET [verified -> 03-materials/ch11/page/sen0401_ch11_page_abox_v9_80_0.ttl added by ['3e07bc8'] modified by [] 08-tooling/ch11-page/test_results_abox_v9_80_0.json added by ['b9a857c'] modified by [] 03-materials/ch11/] | (7) no committed file is edited: MET [verified -> commits 5550252,b9a857c,3e07bc8 | files not added: none RESULT nochange: PASS]. RESULT: MET. Page version: newest page file is 9_80_0 (template 9.52.5, commits 5550252, b9a857c, 3e07bc8); the page test names 9_79_0 (the failing page) as the shipped page. My own runs under the lock (temp folders under /tmp/claude-0/ctl77tmp, mine): 9.37.0, 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 all exit 0 on the first run: 91 of 91 widgets, 197/185/185 features, 6 gates, 0 skips, FAIL 0. Reference: the criterion names the stored results of the page 9.78.0, which does not exist (the executor disclosed this); the control used the stored results of the page 9.77_0 (91 widgets, 184 features, 6 gates; 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 logs of the newest earlier page that has them), a weaker reference than the criterion wished for (the page has 1 feature more and 2 renamed ERD features are now measured, as the executor said). My own ERD collision probe on the page: BlockContainer is on top at its centre, CLEAR (the same page data collided on 9.52.4). My own manifest-vs-deck check (the control's codetab): the manifest (17 examples) equals the page tab (order, name, code, slide, expected) and its slides equal the 17 code slides of the newest deck v2_0_0. Deck-link check: 15 of 15 hyperlinks of the newest deck v2_0_0 are carried (the executor said 13). Probe 12 of 12 (stories 1 to 4 start the narrative at 349 to 524 px of 844). Stage 4 OVERALL PASS, chapter checks Research, Deck and Page pass, deck match 0 not carried, charset pass, ABox and stored result are new files, nochange pass. Executor disclosures noted (relative path on its first probe call, an invocation error). No link fetched, live link state not verified. The previous page 9.79.0 stays as delivered and failing, unchanged." .
