ex:IA3_Ch11PageCancel a backlog:ImpactAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "As-is fit-gap and impact of cancelling the chapter 11 page 9.79.0 story"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest ex:CR3_TemplateErd ; backlog:identifiesAffectedLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "AS-IS FIT-GAP AND IMPACT ANALYSIS of ex:ST_Ch11_Page_R24 (read from the register v0.516.0 and the control of 2026-10-26; criterion AC9_Page_Ch11). ACCOMPLISHED (met, measured by the control): the page 9.79.0 exists as a new file (commit 95b5833) with its inputs (commit 8cfc35e: lecture export, resources, pywheels, Pyodide preflight of the 17 examples, 0 failures); charset check; chapter-code manifest equals the page tab (17 examples); every hyperlink of the newest deck carried (15 of 15); story layout probe 12 of 12; deck match 0 not carried; Research and Deck chapter checks. FAILED (measured, recorded in the control of v0.497.0): the page tests 9.37.0, 9.34.1 and 9.35.1 (exit 1 each in the control's own runs, TimeoutError in the ERD step: the sections ERD of the template 9.52.4 draws HeaderFields over the centre of BlockContainer); the Page chapter check; the page ABox and the stored result (never made). The cause is in the template, not in the page data (change request ex:CR3_TemplateErd). IN PROGRESS: nothing; the Build task is Suspended since the control and its Verify task was never started. DUE: nothing on this unit: what it was to deliver (a chapter 11 page that meets AC9_Page_Ch11's measures) is delivered by ex:ST_Ch11_PageRebuild, whose criterion AC9_PageRebuild_Ch11 repeats those measures and adds the ERD collision probe, controlled MET on the page 9.80.0 (v0.515.0). IMPACT of the cancellation: the page file 9.79.0 and its commits stay in the repository, unchanged (nothing is deleted or edited); the criterion AC9_Page_Ch11 is not edited and not waived: it stays on the register as the criterion this unit did not meet, and the same measures are met by AC9_PageRebuild_Ch11; no other item depends on these three (checked: the only dependency is the Verify task on its own Build task); the open-story ranking loses one entry (0.16) and no other score changes; the mission's coverage is unaffected (the chapter 11 page is delivered by the rebuild)." .

ex:ClosureRep3_Ch11PageR24 a backlog:ClosureReport ;
    rdfs:label "Closure report of the chapter 11 page 9.79.0 story: CANCELLED (superseded)"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage3 ;
    backlog:reportGeneratedAt "2026-10-26T20:36:44"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:seeAlso ex:ST_Ch11_Page_R24, ex:IA3_Ch11PageCancel, ex:ST_Ch11_PageRebuild ;
    backlog:hasClosureSummary "CLOSURE STATUS: CANCELLED (not Done, not failed-and-forgotten). The story ex:ST_Ch11_Page_R24 with its tasks TK_Ch11_Page_Build_R24 (was Suspended) and TK_Ch11_Page_Verify_R24 (was Proposed) is cancelled on 2026-10-26T20:36:44 UTC because its deliverable was superseded by ex:ST_Ch11_PageRebuild (the chapter 11 page 9.80.0 on the template 9.52.5, controlled Done). The unit itself did not meet its criterion (page tests failed, see the analysis ex:IA3_Ch11PageCancel); that is kept as the record and is not waived. The failed page stays in the repository unchanged. Lesson: a template defect (the sections ERD) can fail a page that is otherwise correct; the ERD collision probe is now a measure of the rebuilt page and of the pages of chapters 12 to 14." .
