    rdfs:seeAlso ex:CR3_Ch13Links, ex:IA3_Ch13Links ;
    backlog:revisionReason "The change request ex:CR3_Ch13Links (Tuesday 2026-10-27, decided by the lineage's own change route (gaps found are filled through change management in the active lineage; the coordinator relayed the owner's standing orders and the criterion that a skip is not a pass and the owner's decision of 2026-10-22 on section links in the research; no question to the owner is needed; nothing is waived)) adds a deliverable (the chapter 13 research section links and the chapter 13 page rebuild on them); the lineage is in its closed Backlog stage, and a deliverable added to a closed scope statement is a revision from the Scope stage (ruling G127). The request and its assessment were recorded first. This version retracts the Scope, Goal, Objective and Backlog outputs and rebuilds nothing; the next four versions rebuild them one stage each, a sixth fills the last commit; the items already in the register, Done ones included, re-enter by admission and are not re-dated (L-112). The interim versions are the declared transition (G129)." ;
