13 states how its 16 sections relate. RULING (standing): the page tests are gates and stay unchanged; the research is repaired as a NEW version; the page is rebuilt on it as the next page version. The page 9.82.0 is delivered; nothing is waived." ;
    backlog:deliverableForArea ex:Area3_Remedy56 ; backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:hasProductScopeKind backlog:Kind_Functional .
